(5822210, 848278, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great image, except for one major problem. Excessive JPEG compression is taking away a lot of the fine detail and clarity of this photo. Your file size of only 45k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. I can see lots of compression artifacts around the high contrast edges. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.</td>', 'Great image, except for one major problem. Excessive JPEG compression is taking away a lot of the fine detail and clarity of this photo. Your file size of only 45k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. I can see lots of compression artifacts around the high contrast edges. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.', '2010-01-22 00:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
