(5822361, 848635, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, busy, but appropriate for the subject I feel. As there''s so much in here nothing particularly catches my eye and while the scene is nice and well shot, it doesn''t hold a whole lot of interest for me personally.</td>', 'Interesting composition, busy, but appropriate for the subject I feel. As there''s so much in here nothing particularly catches my eye and while the scene is nice and well shot, it doesn''t hold a whole lot of interest for me personally.', '2010-01-22 01:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822362, 848680, 101117, '<td valign="top">Humorous shot, but photographically, not particularly outstanding. I think the weather and conditions didn''t help you here as the whole thing feels very grey and bleak. A bit of editing may have improved this a bit.</td>', 'Humorous shot, but photographically, not particularly outstanding. I think the weather and conditions didn''t help you here as the whole thing feels very grey and bleak. A bit of editing may have improved this a bit.', '2010-01-22 01:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822365, 847768, 79141, '<td valign="top">awesome  capture</td>', 'awesome  capture', '2010-01-22 01:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822367, 848370, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nicely taken, I''m wondering if this is HDR due to the rich range of tones. <br/> <br/>I''m not particularly keen on the angle you''ve chosen to take it from, I understand that may have been necessary to fit everything in as I''ve seen this scene from this angle a number of times, but I would like to see it perhaps from a different approach / angle.</td>', 'Very nicely taken, I''m wondering if this is HDR due to the rich range of tones.  I''m not particularly keen on the angle you''ve chosen to take it from, I understand that may have been necessary to fit everything in as I''ve seen this scene from this angle a number of times, but I would like to see it perhaps from a different approach / angle.', '2010-01-22 01:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822368, 847066, 101117, '<td valign="top">Well caught, love the smooth blur of what I''m guessing is water under the bird. Well composed as well, I like the space available on the right side of the frame.</td>', 'Well caught, love the smooth blur of what I''m guessing is water under the bird. Well composed as well, I like the space available on the right side of the frame.', '2010-01-22 01:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822371, 848035, 101117, '<td valign="top">First class capture, though it''s disturbing me that the bird appears to be missing a wing!<br/> <br/>This almost looks like it stopped and posed for you, it''s so rich and clear. Very well done indeed, though I''m afraid I can''t stop obsessing with the missing wing!</td>', 'First class capture, though it''s disturbing me that the bird appears to be missing a wing! This almost looks like it stopped and posed for you, it''s so rich and clear. Very well done indeed, though I''m afraid I can''t stop obsessing with the missing wing!', '2010-01-22 01:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822373, 848695, 68769, '<td valign="top">Cool lens effect, I like it.</td>', 'Cool lens effect, I like it.', '2010-01-22 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822375, 848905, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like this, it''s amusing and different, love the fact the one on the right is chewing on a branch!<br/> <br/>Nice details and exposure all over, it''s a shame about the plastic thing to the right, it takes away a little from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I like this, it''s amusing and different, love the fact the one on the right is chewing on a branch! Nice details and exposure all over, it''s a shame about the plastic thing to the right, it takes away a little from the rest of the shot.', '2010-01-22 01:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822376, 848769, 68769, '<td valign="top">I would love to find a place like that, very nice.</td>', 'I would love to find a place like that, very nice.', '2010-01-22 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822379, 847871, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ha, love the tongue sticking out, almost like it''s aimed at you!<br/> <br/>Great details and lovely colours in this shot, I do think perhaps you''ve applied sharpening a little heavily as some of what should be soft background details have some sharpish outlines, though that could just be the lens you used.</td>', 'Ha, love the tongue sticking out, almost like it''s aimed at you! Great details and lovely colours in this shot, I do think perhaps you''ve applied sharpening a little heavily as some of what should be soft background details have some sharpish outlines, though that could just be the lens you used.', '2010-01-22 01:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822385, 848784, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is almost very nice. The structure and landscape choice are good, I also like the details and colouring, but I can''t figure out for the life of me why you would leave halos around the building in a shot which you have obviously taken a lot of time over!</td>', 'This is almost very nice. The structure and landscape choice are good, I also like the details and colouring, but I can''t figure out for the life of me why you would leave halos around the building in a shot which you have obviously taken a lot of time over!', '2010-01-22 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822386, 848535, 68769, '<td valign="top">Dude, check out the goofy looking fish lover staring at me..</td>', 'Dude, check out the goofy looking fish lover staring at me..', '2010-01-22 01:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822389, 848467, 674, '<td valign="top">lovely action shot</td>', 'lovely action shot', '2010-01-22 01:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822390, 847231, 41142, '<td valign="top">Shame about the extremely high image noise, at least one hot pixel, and muted colours. Otherwise intriguing and nicely framed shot.</td>', 'Shame about the extremely high image noise, at least one hot pixel, and muted colours. Otherwise intriguing and nicely framed shot.', '2010-01-22 01:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822391, 848828, 674, '<td valign="top">focus is not spot on</td>', 'focus is not spot on', '2010-01-22 01:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822392, 847365, 68769, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, kinda like a flies nightmare.</td>', 'Interesting take, kinda like a flies nightmare.', '2010-01-22 01:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822393, 847410, 41142, '<td valign="top">Wow - very insteresting capture. Great gradations in light and dark. I love this, even though it''s quite abstract. Beautiful!</td>', 'Wow - very insteresting capture. Great gradations in light and dark. I love this, even though it''s quite abstract. Beautiful!', '2010-01-22 01:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822395, 848636, 41142, '<td valign="top">I so wish the wings were also in focus. Was this one alive? Great shot. 8.</td>', 'I so wish the wings were also in focus. Was this one alive? Great shot. 8.', '2010-01-22 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822396, 847658, 41142, '<td valign="top">Too abstract for me... And it doesn''t really show photographic excellence to me - it''s too easy to do this. Even though it would look well in an art gallery.</td>', 'Too abstract for me... And it doesn''t really show photographic excellence to me - it''s too easy to do this. Even though it would look well in an art gallery.', '2010-01-22 01:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822398, 848326, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, much more "homely" shot of a church then you usually see in these grand cathedral shots around here, for that reason I like it.<br/> <br/>I would have liked it better if you had waited for the walking girl to leave the scehe, that way you would just have had the zig zag of people all the way down the isle in their various different poses.</td>', 'This is a nice, much more "homely" shot of a church then you usually see in these grand cathedral shots around here, for that reason I like it. I would have liked it better if you had waited for the walking girl to leave the scehe, that way you would just have had the zig zag of people all the way down the isle in their various different poses.', '2010-01-22 01:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822399, 848239, 28476, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2010-01-22 01:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822400, 847598, 68769, '<td valign="top">Your subject, religious excesses, meh, but you captured it well.</td>', 'Your subject, religious excesses, meh, but you captured it well.', '2010-01-22 01:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822402, 847903, 56502, '<td valign="top">Lighting is excellent, good job!</td>', 'Lighting is excellent, good job!', '2010-01-22 01:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822405, 847598, 101117, '<td valign="top">There''s too much cropped out of this for my liking. From the angle you''ve taken this it''s hard to actually tell what I''m looking at. I immediately guessed it was a church or cathedral from the colours and stained glass windows, and your title supports that theory, but apart from that I really don''t know what this is!</td>', 'There''s too much cropped out of this for my liking. From the angle you''ve taken this it''s hard to actually tell what I''m looking at. I immediately guessed it was a church or cathedral from the colours and stained glass windows, and your title supports that theory, but apart from that I really don''t know what this is!', '2010-01-22 01:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822408, 847235, 68769, '<td valign="top">Nicely unpredicted , wonderful image.</td>', 'Nicely unpredicted , wonderful image.', '2010-01-22 02:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822410, 847093, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, very magazinesque. For me There''s been too much PP on the skin down to the point where you''ve lost details, which again is consistent with what you see in magazines. <br/> <br/>My point is, it''s an absolutely perfect shot for glossy mag advertising, but I always think those ones are way over done and the same applies to this one. Still, I''m not going to score it too low because it''s very well done, 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice portrait, very magazinesque. For me There''s been too much PP on the skin down to the point where you''ve lost details, which again is consistent with what you see in magazines.  My point is, it''s an absolutely perfect shot for glossy mag advertising, but I always think those ones are way over done and the same applies to this one. Still, I''m not going to score it too low because it''s very well done, 6 from me.', '2010-01-22 02:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822412, 847760, 101117, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, well caught. For me, not outstanding photographically, but a fun one nonetheless!</td>', 'Cute shot, well caught. For me, not outstanding photographically, but a fun one nonetheless!', '2010-01-22 02:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
