(5822415, 848808, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure where you''re coming form here with the "inspiration".<br/> <br/>Interesting colours and angles all over. I do find myself taking more interest in the designs to the left and right corners, which I''m guessing wasn''t the intention of shot.<br/> <br/>Despite the colours and patters, I don''t think the shot holds a whole amount of interest overall.</td>', 'Not entirely sure where you''re coming form here with the "inspiration". Interesting colours and angles all over. I do find myself taking more interest in the designs to the left and right corners, which I''m guessing wasn''t the intention of shot. Despite the colours and patters, I don''t think the shot holds a whole amount of interest overall.', '2010-01-22 02:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822417, 847847, 112798, '<td valign="top">The colors look a tad bit over-processed, but I can''t tell if that''s what you were going for...<br/>Still a captivating picture!</td>', 'The colors look a tad bit over-processed, but I can''t tell if that''s what you were going for...Still a captivating picture!', '2010-01-22 02:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
