(5822525, 848548, 101117, '<td valign="top">Like the B&amp;W conversion here, it works well and makes the petals look almost translucent. <br/> <br/>The only thing I think I would have liked to see here would have been a little more empty space, as it is the flower is quite "in your face" and I think some more white would have balanced the delicateness.</td>', 'Like the B&W conversion here, it works well and makes the petals look almost translucent.  The only thing I think I would have liked to see here would have been a little more empty space, as it is the flower is quite "in your face" and I think some more white would have balanced the delicateness.', '2010-01-22 04:31:52.000000', NULL, 1);
