(5822526, 847108, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice detailed shot. A little centered and a little harsh for such a "delicate" shot, I think this is the sort of shot that would benefit from a softening rather than a sharpening. <br/> <br/>Of course the majority of voters would probably disagree with me, people like thinks to be sharp and clear :)</td>', 'Nice detailed shot. A little centered and a little harsh for such a "delicate" shot, I think this is the sort of shot that would benefit from a softening rather than a sharpening.  Of course the majority of voters would probably disagree with me, people like thinks to be sharp and clear :)', '2010-01-22 04:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822527, 847831, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2010-01-22 04:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822528, 848357, 58678, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colours a little muted for my taste</td>', 'Nice composition, colours a little muted for my taste', '2010-01-22 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822529, 847762, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great capture of limbs of sorts (not voting)</td>', 'Great capture of limbs of sorts (not voting)', '2010-01-22 04:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822532, 848519, 101117, '<td valign="top">I can see the reason you would go B&amp;W here, and I may well have done the same thing myself, but I''m not sure this particular conversion is the best one. <br/> <br/>You have some great rugged scenery here but the B&amp;W seems to have reduced the contrast and the shot kind of just blends together despite the actual harsh landscapes.</td>', 'I can see the reason you would go B&W here, and I may well have done the same thing myself, but I''m not sure this particular conversion is the best one.  You have some great rugged scenery here but the B&W seems to have reduced the contrast and the shot kind of just blends together despite the actual harsh landscapes.', '2010-01-22 04:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822536, 847465, 79141, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2010-01-22 04:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822537, 848830, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great colours all over. I like the little strips of red against all the overwhelming green! It''s good that you can also see the starts in the background as well, nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice, great colours all over. I like the little strips of red against all the overwhelming green! It''s good that you can also see the starts in the background as well, nice touch.', '2010-01-22 04:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822538, 848105, 79141, '<td valign="top">brilliant  love  it</td>', 'brilliant  love  it', '2010-01-22 04:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822541, 847833, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice scene with nice pastel colours. I like the fact that you haven''t gone overboard on the processing and it all still looks quite natural.</td>', 'Nice scene with nice pastel colours. I like the fact that you haven''t gone overboard on the processing and it all still looks quite natural.', '2010-01-22 04:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822542, 847220, 79141, '<td valign="top">interesting  image  for  something so bland   color wise  it has a lot of  mood   well done</td>', 'interesting  image  for  something so bland   color wise  it has a lot of  mood   well done', '2010-01-22 04:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822543, 848838, 79141, '<td valign="top">vibrant colors   nice  work</td>', 'vibrant colors   nice  work', '2010-01-22 04:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822544, 848683, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice  work</td>', 'nice  work', '2010-01-22 04:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822545, 848921, 79141, '<td valign="top">love the DOF and  the colors</td>', 'love the DOF and  the colors', '2010-01-22 04:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822547, 847798, 79141, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W really made  this work</td>', 'B&W really made  this work', '2010-01-22 04:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822548, 847124, 79141, '<td valign="top">interesting location</td>', 'interesting location', '2010-01-22 04:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822549, 848869, 101117, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some really nice scenery here and a well taken shot but it''s just lacking a touch of "something". Not entirely sure what, I think it might be something to do with the colours looking a tiny bit washed out.<br/> <br/>I do like the fact that you''ve kept the shutter speed to a point where you can see it''s rushing water and not some strange smoke looking thing, well done for not going down the obvious path!</td>', 'You''ve got some really nice scenery here and a well taken shot but it''s just lacking a touch of "something". Not entirely sure what, I think it might be something to do with the colours looking a tiny bit washed out. I do like the fact that you''ve kept the shutter speed to a point where you can see it''s rushing water and not some strange smoke looking thing, well done for not going down the obvious path!', '2010-01-22 04:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822550, 848759, 79141, '<td valign="top">looks  a tad  over  done   to me</td>', 'looks  a tad  over  done   to me', '2010-01-22 04:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822551, 848247, 58678, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2010-01-22 04:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822552, 848183, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great colours, it''s like a watercolour painting! I imagine this would look really nice on print too.</td>', 'Great colours, it''s like a watercolour painting! I imagine this would look really nice on print too.', '2010-01-22 04:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822554, 847691, 92577, '<td valign="top">this is great - the incongruous metal ramp gives it a sci-fi vibe</td>', 'this is great - the incongruous metal ramp gives it a sci-fi vibe', '2010-01-22 04:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822556, 847069, 61396, '<td valign="top">She can also play in "Alice in Wonderlands" as she fades away leaving her smile behind. (not voting)</td>', 'She can also play in "Alice in Wonderlands" as she fades away leaving her smile behind. (not voting)', '2010-01-22 04:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822557, 848834, 101117, '<td valign="top">Here''s a nice little slice of life, I like watching these moments. It''s an interesting scene, but not particularly outstanding in a photographic sense.</td>', 'Here''s a nice little slice of life, I like watching these moments. It''s an interesting scene, but not particularly outstanding in a photographic sense.', '2010-01-22 04:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822558, 847812, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like the angle here, it''s different from all the usual head on shots and the sky as a background makes a nice difference. The inclusion of a little snowy ground in the foreground gives some context and finishes the scene well.</td>', 'I like the angle here, it''s different from all the usual head on shots and the sky as a background makes a nice difference. The inclusion of a little snowy ground in the foreground gives some context and finishes the scene well.', '2010-01-22 04:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822560, 847046, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice   colors    the clouds  look really well done <br/>did you HDR this?</td>', 'nice   colors    the clouds  look really well done did you HDR this?', '2010-01-22 04:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822561, 847906, 92577, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the whites looking whiter</td>', 'I''d like to see the whites looking whiter', '2010-01-22 04:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822562, 848447, 79141, '<td valign="top">a little  dark but has  a mood  to it</td>', 'a little  dark but has  a mood  to it', '2010-01-22 04:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822563, 848239, 92577, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2010-01-22 04:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822565, 848514, 101117, '<td valign="top">I sense some HDR at work here, which if it is the case you have controlled well, though it has left the branches looking just a touch luminous.<br/> <br/>I do think there''s something a touch odd about the sky, I can''t quite place what it is, but something about it doesn''t look quite right. Perhaps it''s just the way the smaller branches are sitting against it.</td>', 'I sense some HDR at work here, which if it is the case you have controlled well, though it has left the branches looking just a touch luminous. I do think there''s something a touch odd about the sky, I can''t quite place what it is, but something about it doesn''t look quite right. Perhaps it''s just the way the smaller branches are sitting against it.', '2010-01-22 04:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822566, 847041, 92577, '<td valign="top">great colours - nice and sharp</td>', 'great colours - nice and sharp', '2010-01-22 04:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822567, 847034, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great details, especially in the eyes. I like the intense stare, sort of like "any second, that''s going to be my dinner".</td>', 'Great details, especially in the eyes. I like the intense stare, sort of like "any second, that''s going to be my dinner".', '2010-01-22 04:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822570, 848551, 92577, '<td valign="top">very busy but impressive all the same - good luck</td>', 'very busy but impressive all the same - good luck', '2010-01-22 04:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822572, 847232, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice architecture, and you''ve exposed it well. <br/> <br/>The problem with shots of buildings is that people looking at the photo never seem to take in the grandeur of the building the same way you did when you were there, and I think this is one of those that fall into that category.</td>', 'Nice architecture, and you''ve exposed it well.  The problem with shots of buildings is that people looking at the photo never seem to take in the grandeur of the building the same way you did when you were there, and I think this is one of those that fall into that category.', '2010-01-22 04:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822574, 848818, 101117, '<td valign="top">That is one very calm piece of water! <br/> <br/>It''s a shame you didn''t get this on a better day, the grandness of the scene is somewhat spoiled by the fact that you can''t see the mountain tops and the greyness of it all.</td>', 'That is one very calm piece of water!  It''s a shame you didn''t get this on a better day, the grandness of the scene is somewhat spoiled by the fact that you can''t see the mountain tops and the greyness of it all.', '2010-01-22 04:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822575, 848500, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, remarkably clear and well caught.</td>', 'Good action shot, remarkably clear and well caught.', '2010-01-22 04:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822576, 848883, 79141, '<td valign="top">what a great street scene</td>', 'what a great street scene', '2010-01-22 04:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822577, 848923, 79141, '<td valign="top">like the curves  in this</td>', 'like the curves  in this', '2010-01-22 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822578, 847745, 79141, '<td valign="top">a tad  dark for me</td>', 'a tad  dark for me', '2010-01-22 04:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822579, 847828, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice  mood   to match the  house i like how it appears  to illuminate</td>', 'nice  mood   to match the  house i like how it appears  to illuminate', '2010-01-22 05:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822581, 848132, 79141, '<td valign="top">dont they seem so cuddly  great capture</td>', 'dont they seem so cuddly  great capture', '2010-01-22 05:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822582, 848675, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice  water  movement  i love these  kind of images</td>', 'nice  water  movement  i love these  kind of images', '2010-01-22 05:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822583, 847090, 101117, '<td valign="top">That is something to sit and stare in awe at, though maybe not in the middle of the road or some large truck might just come thundering up and flatten you! Of course with you lot driving on the wrong side of the road I suppose in that lane you would see it coming :)<br/> <br/>As for the shot, I really like it. I love the way the road runs off into the distance until it''s almost just a line, yet you can tell it''s still nowhere near reaching the horizon. The person on the foreground breaks up the bleakness of the road very well and I think is a very nice inclusion.</td>', 'That is something to sit and stare in awe at, though maybe not in the middle of the road or some large truck might just come thundering up and flatten you! Of course with you lot driving on the wrong side of the road I suppose in that lane you would see it coming :) As for the shot, I really like it. I love the way the road runs off into the distance until it''s almost just a line, yet you can tell it''s still nowhere near reaching the horizon. The person on the foreground breaks up the bleakness of the road very well and I think is a very nice inclusion.', '2010-01-22 05:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822584, 847063, 79141, '<td valign="top">i wonder why you submitted  this  one?<br/>technically its  pretty good</td>', 'i wonder why you submitted  this  one?technically its  pretty good', '2010-01-22 05:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822585, 847411, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice  leading lines</td>', 'nice  leading lines', '2010-01-22 05:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822586, 847036, 79141, '<td valign="top">great shot lots of  good detail</td>', 'great shot lots of  good detail', '2010-01-22 05:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822590, 847222, 101117, '<td valign="top">A cliched shot here, but a very well executed version of it :)<br/> <br/>I like the contrasts of colours, the red then the green then the red again in the middle.</td>', 'A cliched shot here, but a very well executed version of it :) I like the contrasts of colours, the red then the green then the red again in the middle.', '2010-01-22 05:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822592, 848921, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ahh, very nicely don<br/> <br/>e! This is the sort of image that just makes you smile the second you open it. I think this one is particularly good because of the two layers of flower and then the medley of different colours in the out of focus background!</td>', 'Ahh, very nicely don e! This is the sort of image that just makes you smile the second you open it. I think this one is particularly good because of the two layers of flower and then the medley of different colours in the out of focus background!', '2010-01-22 05:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822595, 848915, 60173, '<td valign="top">That''s about as cute as cute gets. It works great as a black and white, but I bet it works very well in color too.</td>', 'That''s about as cute as cute gets. It works great as a black and white, but I bet it works very well in color too.', '2010-01-22 05:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822598, 847032, 99263, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Love the "liquidness" of the water. This shot could be by Mr. Perold as he has entered an image taken here once before called ''Infinite Possibilities" but I notice another entry in this challenge taken at Kogel Bay with the 12 Apostles in the background and that I know is another favorite place for Mr. Perold. Obviously Mr. Perold could not have entered both images so which one of the 2 is by Mr. Perold? <br/>Aha...I think I worked it out....this one is by Mr.Konrad Blum who has taken quite a number of shots at this spot. The "Kogel Bay" shot was taken by Mr. Perold.</td>', 'Stunning image. Love the "liquidness" of the water. This shot could be by Mr. Perold as he has entered an image taken here once before called ''Infinite Possibilities" but I notice another entry in this challenge taken at Kogel Bay with the 12 Apostles in the background and that I know is another favorite place for Mr. Perold. Obviously Mr. Perold could not have entered both images so which one of the 2 is by Mr. Perold? Aha...I think I worked it out....this one is by Mr.Konrad Blum who has taken quite a number of shots at this spot. The "Kogel Bay" shot was taken by Mr. Perold.', '2010-01-22 05:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822601, 848022, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like the humor angle of this. These photos are usually the sappy kind, which is fine, but honestly a bit cliche. This tells a story that''s more realistic. It''s a busy photo, but it''s all put together very well. I especially like the bit of vibrant photo coming in from above that''s balanced by the similar colored book on the other side.<br/> <br/>To be honest though, what caught my eye in this photo that made me keep looking was the cabinet in the background. That''s an awesome piece of furniture, heh.</td>', 'I like the humor angle of this. These photos are usually the sappy kind, which is fine, but honestly a bit cliche. This tells a story that''s more realistic. It''s a busy photo, but it''s all put together very well. I especially like the bit of vibrant photo coming in from above that''s balanced by the similar colored book on the other side. To be honest though, what caught my eye in this photo that made me keep looking was the cabinet in the background. That''s an awesome piece of furniture, heh.', '2010-01-22 05:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822604, 847463, 60173, '<td valign="top">Absolutely elegant. The tones are perfect, the smile is perfect, her hair is perfect... DOF, exposure... perfect. Ya, I think I''ll stick with perfect.</td>', 'Absolutely elegant. The tones are perfect, the smile is perfect, her hair is perfect... DOF, exposure... perfect. Ya, I think I''ll stick with perfect.', '2010-01-22 05:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822608, 847060, 674, '<td valign="top">the light in this is exquisite</td>', 'the light in this is exquisite', '2010-01-22 05:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822610, 848183, 674, '<td valign="top">one of the best sunset shots i have seen</td>', 'one of the best sunset shots i have seen', '2010-01-22 05:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822612, 848239, 102519, '<td valign="top">hillarious</td>', 'hillarious', '2010-01-22 05:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822617, 847038, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery and good details. I think I would like to be able to see a bit wider, a bit more into the water and sky.</td>', 'Nice scenery and good details. I think I would like to be able to see a bit wider, a bit more into the water and sky.', '2010-01-22 05:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822618, 848887, 101117, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully detailed shot especially around the white feathers. It has an almost painting feel about it, perhaps because of the colours and the softness of large parts of the image.</td>', 'Wonderfully detailed shot especially around the white feathers. It has an almost painting feel about it, perhaps because of the colours and the softness of large parts of the image.', '2010-01-22 05:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822620, 848532, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on a standard beach scene. I think the fisheye has worked well for you here, it''s turned what otherwise would be a fairly normal shot into something much more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting take on a standard beach scene. I think the fisheye has worked well for you here, it''s turned what otherwise would be a fairly normal shot into something much more interesting.', '2010-01-22 05:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822622, 848789, 5034, '<td valign="top">Border and colours are nice. To me it''s just the sun shining through some trees with a reflection.  It''s technically very well shot but it just doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Border and colours are nice. To me it''s just the sun shining through some trees with a reflection.  It''s technically very well shot but it just doesn''t grab me.', '2010-01-22 05:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822623, 848367, 101117, '<td valign="top">They''re such happy flowers! I think this shot might just be lacking a bit of punch, it''s not the colours which are really strong and vibrant, I think instead it''s the light, which feels very flat, like you''ve taken it on an overcast day.</td>', 'They''re such happy flowers! I think this shot might just be lacking a bit of punch, it''s not the colours which are really strong and vibrant, I think instead it''s the light, which feels very flat, like you''ve taken it on an overcast day.', '2010-01-22 05:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822625, 848412, 5034, '<td valign="top">Why, what happened to her?  You picture tells part of the story, not the whole thing.</td>', 'Why, what happened to her?  You picture tells part of the story, not the whole thing.', '2010-01-22 05:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822628, 847243, 674, '<td valign="top">a little bit soft was it shot through glass 7</td>', 'a little bit soft was it shot through glass 7', '2010-01-22 05:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822630, 847200, 5034, '<td valign="top">Awww, how cute!  Mum seems a bit bright but apart from that you''ve got a stunner here.</td>', 'Awww, how cute!  Mum seems a bit bright but apart from that you''ve got a stunner here.', '2010-01-22 05:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822631, 848728, 101117, '<td valign="top">I was looking at this thinking, it must have been taken from really high up, then I saw your title and went, "ahh".<br/> <br/>I like this because of the almost abstract nature of it. On first glace it isn''t exactly clear what it is, it looks like painted colours with a sort of scattered line running through it. It''s only after a few seconds that you start to make out the details of the birds, then after that the rest of the scene is given a sense of scale and it all starts to make sense.</td>', 'I was looking at this thinking, it must have been taken from really high up, then I saw your title and went, "ahh". I like this because of the almost abstract nature of it. On first glace it isn''t exactly clear what it is, it looks like painted colours with a sort of scattered line running through it. It''s only after a few seconds that you start to make out the details of the birds, then after that the rest of the scene is given a sense of scale and it all starts to make sense.', '2010-01-22 05:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822636, 847147, 101117, '<td valign="top">Man that looks cold, I really hope you weren''t standing in the middle of ice filled water to take that, that would be WAY too much dedication!<br/> <br/>I like the shot, but the big bit of ice in the bottom centre just keeps drawing my attention and stops me really getting into it properly. I think if it were more to the left or right (or not there at all) I would like it more.</td>', 'Man that looks cold, I really hope you weren''t standing in the middle of ice filled water to take that, that would be WAY too much dedication! I like the shot, but the big bit of ice in the bottom centre just keeps drawing my attention and stops me really getting into it properly. I think if it were more to the left or right (or not there at all) I would like it more.', '2010-01-22 06:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822637, 848812, 5034, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus but it takes away from her eyes imo.  I''ve been told eyes are the most important thing in a portrait.</td>', 'Nice soft focus but it takes away from her eyes imo.  I''ve been told eyes are the most important thing in a portrait.', '2010-01-22 06:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822641, 847235, 5034, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what you did in editing but for some reason this just doesn''t feel right, like there''s some sort of haze there.</td>', 'Don''t know what you did in editing but for some reason this just doesn''t feel right, like there''s some sort of haze there.', '2010-01-22 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822642, 847041, 674, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour</td>', 'beautiful colour', '2010-01-22 06:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822644, 848775, 5034, '<td valign="top">Looking at her I don''t get the feeling she is being torn.  She''s just looking at something, no expression.  Very competent portrait, awesome work on the skin.</td>', 'Looking at her I don''t get the feeling she is being torn.  She''s just looking at something, no expression.  Very competent portrait, awesome work on the skin.', '2010-01-22 06:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822645, 848880, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2010-01-22 06:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822646, 847742, 5034, '<td valign="top">Now that''s nice.  Great dof, perrrrrrfect focus on the eyes, great skin work.</td>', 'Now that''s nice.  Great dof, perrrrrrfect focus on the eyes, great skin work.', '2010-01-22 06:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822648, 848831, 5034, '<td valign="top">He''s trying but failing on me.  Needs to grow a bit.  Great shot, good focus on the eyes.</td>', 'He''s trying but failing on me.  Needs to grow a bit.  Great shot, good focus on the eyes.', '2010-01-22 06:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822649, 847476, 105130, '<td valign="top">Stunning.</td>', 'Stunning.', '2010-01-22 06:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822650, 847046, 5034, '<td valign="top">Too many items of interest competing for attention.  The life ring, the pier sign, the boat and the bridge.  Too complex and not aided by the lens effect.</td>', 'Too many items of interest competing for attention.  The life ring, the pier sign, the boat and the bridge.  Too complex and not aided by the lens effect.', '2010-01-22 06:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822651, 848675, 5034, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer colour or partial desaturation, just to see the colours of the rocks.</td>', 'I''d prefer colour or partial desaturation, just to see the colours of the rocks.', '2010-01-22 06:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822652, 848854, 5034, '<td valign="top">I find myself looking pas the seaweed to the end of the jetty and the sun.  Nice leading lines.  For such a prominent foreground subject, well, it seems a bit wasted being there to me.</td>', 'I find myself looking pas the seaweed to the end of the jetty and the sun.  Nice leading lines.  For such a prominent foreground subject, well, it seems a bit wasted being there to me.', '2010-01-22 06:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822653, 847472, 674, '<td valign="top">how do those spindly little legs hold up those big ears! lovely angle for tis shot.</td>', 'how do those spindly little legs hold up those big ears! lovely angle for tis shot.', '2010-01-22 06:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822656, 847875, 5034, '<td valign="top">What''s your point here, the sky or the inlet?  With the horizon right at 50% you have to use the title to find out.  I think this''d be better if the horizon was right at the top thirds line.  Still an 8, very good shot.</td>', 'What''s your point here, the sky or the inlet?  With the horizon right at 50% you have to use the title to find out.  I think this''d be better if the horizon was right at the top thirds line.  Still an 8, very good shot.', '2010-01-22 06:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822657, 848680, 5034, '<td valign="top">You get an 8 - 7 for the shot and 1 for making me laugh.</td>', 'You get an 8 - 7 for the shot and 1 for making me laugh.', '2010-01-22 06:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822658, 848040, 5034, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped in closer to really focus on the girl and the horse.  As they are it''s just the colour in the dress that stops her blending in.</td>', 'I''d have cropped in closer to really focus on the girl and the horse.  As they are it''s just the colour in the dress that stops her blending in.', '2010-01-22 06:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822661, 848338, 5034, '<td valign="top">Too much HDR for my liking.</td>', 'Too much HDR for my liking.', '2010-01-22 06:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822662, 847726, 5034, '<td valign="top">Good one, not trying to show it twice, using the reflection to show that can''t be seen at the top.  I like it!</td>', 'Good one, not trying to show it twice, using the reflection to show that can''t be seen at the top.  I like it!', '2010-01-22 06:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822664, 847030, 5034, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the trees being there, good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Bummer about the trees being there, good use of the rule of thirds.', '2010-01-22 06:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822666, 848021, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene! He looks happy there just munching on the grass! <br/> <br/>I''m not sure the B&amp;W, or at least this B&amp;W conversion, was the best choice here. All the details have kind of blended together in the greyness.</td>', 'Interesting scene! He looks happy there just munching on the grass!  I''m not sure the B&W, or at least this B&W conversion, was the best choice here. All the details have kind of blended together in the greyness.', '2010-01-22 06:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822668, 847252, 5034, '<td valign="top">Very noisy, also almost looks like it could be a diorama.</td>', 'Very noisy, also almost looks like it could be a diorama.', '2010-01-22 06:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822669, 847875, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice picturesque looking scene, and while it''s a nice enough image, it''s missing a certain something, it all feels a little flat. <br/> <br/>Also, that dust dot just right of centre keeps catching my attention, I keep thinking it''s on my screen but then I see it scrolls with the shot!</td>', 'Nice picturesque looking scene, and while it''s a nice enough image, it''s missing a certain something, it all feels a little flat.  Also, that dust dot just right of centre keeps catching my attention, I keep thinking it''s on my screen but then I see it scrolls with the shot!', '2010-01-22 06:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822671, 848338, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but for me you''ve gone a bit over the top on the processing across the sky. The green area and the tree are well done, but the clouds, especially the yellow area and the ones along the horizon, have begun to look a bit weird.<br/> <br/>The other telling factor is that the area behind the tree is much smoother and appears to glow in comparison.</td>', 'This is nice, but for me you''ve gone a bit over the top on the processing across the sky. The green area and the tree are well done, but the clouds, especially the yellow area and the ones along the horizon, have begun to look a bit weird. The other telling factor is that the area behind the tree is much smoother and appears to glow in comparison.', '2010-01-22 06:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822672, 848770, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great details, love the way the backlighting is highlighting all the individual little water drops!</td>', 'Great details, love the way the backlighting is highlighting all the individual little water drops!', '2010-01-22 06:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822673, 848880, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is quite a nice scene with some really good colours, but since the foreground tree for me is the main subject, it just doesn''t work to have the top cropped off like that!</td>', 'This is quite a nice scene with some really good colours, but since the foreground tree for me is the main subject, it just doesn''t work to have the top cropped off like that!', '2010-01-22 06:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822675, 847726, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece of street photography, I often go looking for stuff like this after it rains (or sometimes during).<br/> <br/>For me the top of the shot is a little low, I would like to see a bit more of the building we are seeing the reflection of, so that it would be like one big continued line from reflection into actual building.</td>', 'Interesting piece of street photography, I often go looking for stuff like this after it rains (or sometimes during). For me the top of the shot is a little low, I would like to see a bit more of the building we are seeing the reflection of, so that it would be like one big continued line from reflection into actual building.', '2010-01-22 06:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822680, 848804, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is really nice but on viewing I''m instantly annoyed by the section of material coming from the right and running across the top. Because it''s out of focus and has bright areas it''s impossible to look at any other part of the shot without that competing for attention.<br/> <br/>Ignoring that, it''s a very nice shot with great tones and lighting. I love the way the pattern is shone onto the face of the model, and the model herself has an almost porcelain look to her skin. It''s a really nicely composed shot, but I''m so put off by the bit at the top that I''m afraid I can only give this a 5.</td>', 'This is really nice but on viewing I''m instantly annoyed by the section of material coming from the right and running across the top. Because it''s out of focus and has bright areas it''s impossible to look at any other part of the shot without that competing for attention. Ignoring that, it''s a very nice shot with great tones and lighting. I love the way the pattern is shone onto the face of the model, and the model herself has an almost porcelain look to her skin. It''s a really nicely composed shot, but I''m so put off by the bit at the top that I''m afraid I can only give this a 5.', '2010-01-22 06:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822687, 847026, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great fisheye.  Gotta be Fetor w/ the 8mm.</td>', 'Great fisheye.  Gotta be Fetor w/ the 8mm.', '2010-01-22 06:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822692, 847390, 103032, '<td valign="top">Must be inside a rock out cropping...?  I like the silhouetted framing.  Great colors.  Nice relaxing image to look at after a hard week at work.</td>', 'Must be inside a rock out cropping...?  I like the silhouetted framing.  Great colors.  Nice relaxing image to look at after a hard week at work.', '2010-01-22 07:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822697, 848316, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure shot, but the problem with this sort of shot is that we see a lot of them here, and so it raises the bar very high.<br/> <br/>This one while being very pretty and very well done, doesn''t offer anything outstanding that sets it apart from the others.</td>', 'Nice long exposure shot, but the problem with this sort of shot is that we see a lot of them here, and so it raises the bar very high. This one while being very pretty and very well done, doesn''t offer anything outstanding that sets it apart from the others.', '2010-01-22 07:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822699, 847780, 73942, '<td valign="top">love this</td>', 'love this', '2010-01-22 07:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822701, 847394, 101117, '<td valign="top">I sense some HDR work here, which if that is the case is fairly well controlled, but for me, while not quite there yet, is approaching the overdone.<br/> <br/>It''s really interesting scenery, the way you have done it just makes it look hot! For some reason I also get the impression that this is a miniature scene, no idea why!</td>', 'I sense some HDR work here, which if that is the case is fairly well controlled, but for me, while not quite there yet, is approaching the overdone. It''s really interesting scenery, the way you have done it just makes it look hot! For some reason I also get the impression that this is a miniature scene, no idea why!', '2010-01-22 07:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822702, 848922, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful, stunning 10</td>', 'beautiful, stunning 10', '2010-01-22 07:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822703, 848893, 103032, '<td valign="top">Pretty crisp image.  I like the "layers" of distinct foreground, middle ground, and background, and then the sky.  However you processed this, I like the colors and tones.  The coyote really puts into context the expanse of this wilderness, if that make sense.</td>', 'Pretty crisp image.  I like the "layers" of distinct foreground, middle ground, and background, and then the sky.  However you processed this, I like the colors and tones.  The coyote really puts into context the expanse of this wilderness, if that make sense.', '2010-01-22 07:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
