(5822746, 848324, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice balance to this pic.  Like the details of the rocks in the foreground/left, a static subject  Nicely balanced by the falls on the right, a dynamic subject.  I find it interesting that you chose to go B&amp;W, but then again, it makes the viewer focus on the main elements of the image.  Nicely presented, well done.</td>', 'Nice balance to this pic.  Like the details of the rocks in the foreground/left, a static subject  Nicely balanced by the falls on the right, a dynamic subject.  I find it interesting that you chose to go B&W, but then again, it makes the viewer focus on the main elements of the image.  Nicely presented, well done.', '2010-01-22 07:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822749, 847233, 103032, '<td valign="top">For reasons I can''t articulate, I really like this pic.  Maybe its the "bug" eyes of the fish...  I like the centered composition, B&amp;W treatment, DOF, and the graininess to it.</td>', 'For reasons I can''t articulate, I really like this pic.  Maybe its the "bug" eyes of the fish...  I like the centered composition, B&W treatment, DOF, and the graininess to it.', '2010-01-22 07:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822752, 847314, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset pic.  Like the blues of the sky and in the reflection.  Like the gold tones of the sun.  Great reflection, great clouds, great rays of the sun.</td>', 'Very nice sunset pic.  Like the blues of the sky and in the reflection.  Like the gold tones of the sun.  Great reflection, great clouds, great rays of the sun.', '2010-01-22 07:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
