(5822755, 848706, 101117, '<td valign="top">I can feel the cold just looking at this!<br/> <br/>There''s something a bit strange going on with this. The hills in the background seem very washed out compared to not only the foreground but also the clouds behind them.</td>', 'I can feel the cold just looking at this! There''s something a bit strange going on with this. The hills in the background seem very washed out compared to not only the foreground but also the clouds behind them.', '2010-01-22 07:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
