(5822763, 847033, 101117, '<td valign="top">This feels oversaturated and a bit out of focus as well. The subject choice isn''t the most pleasing either, the background flowers look wilted and the foreground one looks like it''s on its way too.</td>', 'This feels oversaturated and a bit out of focus as well. The subject choice isn''t the most pleasing either, the background flowers look wilted and the foreground one looks like it''s on its way too.', '2010-01-22 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
