(5822766, 848846, 5034, '<td valign="top">Bit too bright.  All I can see of her nose is the part around her nostrils.  Not really that great an effect.  Great expression and focusa though.</td>', 'Bit too bright.  All I can see of her nose is the part around her nostrils.  Not really that great an effect.  Great expression and focusa though.', '2010-01-22 07:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822768, 848030, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very cute, they all look like they have different personalities with the top one being the curious one, the one to the right being the oddball and the one at the front being the mean angry one!<br/> <br/>Photographically, it''s not outstanding, the front light is harsh and the surrounding items are just distracting.</td>', 'Very cute, they all look like they have different personalities with the top one being the curious one, the one to the right being the oddball and the one at the front being the mean angry one! Photographically, it''s not outstanding, the front light is harsh and the surrounding items are just distracting.', '2010-01-22 07:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822769, 847905, 103048, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s a beauty! Great choice of photograph for the best of 2009. Love the rich tones.</td>', 'Wow that''s a beauty! Great choice of photograph for the best of 2009. Love the rich tones.', '2010-01-22 07:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822773, 848640, 101117, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought you had gone crazy with the topaz, but now I''m thinking that the background scene may actually be a drawing.<br/> <br/>You have good details in the bird, but when I look closely there''s something strange going on where the bird meets the background, it may be as a result of some editing you have done but it almost looks like you have superimposed the picture of the bird onto the picture of the background!</td>', 'At first glance I thought you had gone crazy with the topaz, but now I''m thinking that the background scene may actually be a drawing. You have good details in the bird, but when I look closely there''s something strange going on where the bird meets the background, it may be as a result of some editing you have done but it almost looks like you have superimposed the picture of the bird onto the picture of the background!', '2010-01-22 07:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822775, 847598, 43463, '<td valign="top">There is just too much going on in this composition. While the colors in the arches in the foreground are appealing the stained glass windows in the backdrop have a processed look that is way over saturated in the reds and blues. There is also way too many shapes and patterns that with the arcs and windows that it overwhelms the eye. Helping the viewer to focus what you want them to see as the main subject would help this photo greatly. A vertical crop that mimics and complements the vertical lines/shape of the ''box''/domed arced roof structure would improve the composition greatly. Not only that but a vertical crop would also follow the lines and shape of those stained glass windows.</td>', 'There is just too much going on in this composition. While the colors in the arches in the foreground are appealing the stained glass windows in the backdrop have a processed look that is way over saturated in the reds and blues. There is also way too many shapes and patterns that with the arcs and windows that it overwhelms the eye. Helping the viewer to focus what you want them to see as the main subject would help this photo greatly. A vertical crop that mimics and complements the vertical lines/shape of the ''box''/domed arced roof structure would improve the composition greatly. Not only that but a vertical crop would also follow the lines and shape of those stained glass windows.', '2010-01-22 07:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822777, 848928, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here, I like the yellow against the red. I think you''ve chosen the right focus and perspective here, it makes it that much more interesting than all the front on flower shots you usually see.<br/> <br/>You have however been let down by the condition of the flowers themselves, they look as if they are starting to wilt and die with the edges of the petals starting to curl. I''ll bet they were brighter and more vibrant originally.</td>', 'Nice colours here, I like the yellow against the red. I think you''ve chosen the right focus and perspective here, it makes it that much more interesting than all the front on flower shots you usually see. You have however been let down by the condition of the flowers themselves, they look as if they are starting to wilt and die with the edges of the petals starting to curl. I''ll bet they were brighter and more vibrant originally.', '2010-01-22 07:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822779, 848373, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but that''s about all you have here, there''s no real detail in the ground other than the partial tree over to the left.<br/> <br/>I have nothing against silhouettes, but I do feel you have to have something interesting in them.</td>', 'Nice sky, but that''s about all you have here, there''s no real detail in the ground other than the partial tree over to the left. I have nothing against silhouettes, but I do feel you have to have something interesting in them.', '2010-01-22 08:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822780, 847620, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this shot of the jellyfish - title is humorous too! Those amber yellows really pop off the dark backdrop and draw the eye. I was going to complain that the image clarity is a tad soft, but now I think it works a bit in this composition''s favor. The reason is that it gives it a touch of a dreamy look - not to mention gives the jelly''s a ''feel'' that they would be soft to the touch ...if one dared to do so.</td>', 'Love the colors in this shot of the jellyfish - title is humorous too! Those amber yellows really pop off the dark backdrop and draw the eye. I was going to complain that the image clarity is a tad soft, but now I think it works a bit in this composition''s favor. The reason is that it gives it a touch of a dreamy look - not to mention gives the jelly''s a ''feel'' that they would be soft to the touch ...if one dared to do so.', '2010-01-22 08:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822785, 848721, 43463, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coloration captured of this insect in it''s natural environment. Love the level of detail we can see in the latices of the dragonfly''s wings. Great close-up shot.</td>', 'Beautiful coloration captured of this insect in it''s natural environment. Love the level of detail we can see in the latices of the dragonfly''s wings. Great close-up shot.', '2010-01-22 08:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
