(5822802, 847296, 43463, '<td valign="top">With that majestic mountain in the backdrop and the lovely colors of the plantlife spread out before us this is just a downright beautiful place to sit and drink it all in. It is also a wonderful place to hike and explore. Colors and detail are fabulous! A shoot worthy of a calendar.</td>', 'With that majestic mountain in the backdrop and the lovely colors of the plantlife spread out before us this is just a downright beautiful place to sit and drink it all in. It is also a wonderful place to hike and explore. Colors and detail are fabulous! A shoot worthy of a calendar.', '2010-01-22 08:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
