(5822825, 847576, 43463, '<td valign="top">The cool blue hues in the composition really projects the feeling of a cold and chilly night rolling in with the fog. Love the dark silhouette of the barren tree. It''s branches undulate and stretch not just skyward but down towards the water as we see it''s reflection.  Beautiful, simple and poetic in this capture - 9</td>', 'The cool blue hues in the composition really projects the feeling of a cold and chilly night rolling in with the fog. Love the dark silhouette of the barren tree. It''s branches undulate and stretch not just skyward but down towards the water as we see it''s reflection.  Beautiful, simple and poetic in this capture - 9', '2010-01-22 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
