(5822857, 847305, 103142, '<td valign="top">Loved this when I saw your other one. Very cool idea. For some reason I want the leaves on the ground in focus as well, but it''s not affecting the vote one way or another.  -8-</td>', 'Loved this when I saw your other one. Very cool idea. For some reason I want the leaves on the ground in focus as well, but it''s not affecting the vote one way or another.  -8-', '2010-01-22 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
