(5822862, 848885, 103142, '<td valign="top">fun shot, wonderful expressions, trepidation, excitement? However, there seems to be a strange glow around them, and it''s a tad oversaturated. -7-</td>', 'fun shot, wonderful expressions, trepidation, excitement? However, there seems to be a strange glow around them, and it''s a tad oversaturated. -7-', '2010-01-22 08:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822865, 848869, 103048, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Great capture on the flowing water there...though maybe you could''ve stooped lower to capture the movement of the water better.</td>', 'Oh wow. Great capture on the flowing water there...though maybe you could''ve stooped lower to capture the movement of the water better.', '2010-01-22 08:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822870, 848312, 73942, '<td valign="top">great street photography, must be Deb''s, she does it best, love the pose on the guy in the center and the color of the skirt is perfect, plenty to keep the eye busy in this one</td>', 'great street photography, must be Deb''s, she does it best, love the pose on the guy in the center and the color of the skirt is perfect, plenty to keep the eye busy in this one', '2010-01-22 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822876, 848551, 43463, '<td valign="top">Ah, someone has been into the Tolkien:-) But isn''t it spelled with an ''e'' LaurelindorEnan? Yes, this is very lovely scene that dazzles our eyes with the natural beauty. Colors are beautiful and the soft flow capture of the waterfall makes it look surreal. One odd thing is that there is an odd curvature in the scene - the trees to the left are bending inward as well as the rock face of the mountain on the right. The mountain cliff leaning forward towards us seems to be looming and almost pressing it''s weight forward to propel us past the waterfall. A very beautiful and enchanting place you have captured.</td>', 'Ah, someone has been into the Tolkien:-) But isn''t it spelled with an ''e'' LaurelindorEnan? Yes, this is very lovely scene that dazzles our eyes with the natural beauty. Colors are beautiful and the soft flow capture of the waterfall makes it look surreal. One odd thing is that there is an odd curvature in the scene - the trees to the left are bending inward as well as the rock face of the mountain on the right. The mountain cliff leaning forward towards us seems to be looming and almost pressing it''s weight forward to propel us past the waterfall. A very beautiful and enchanting place you have captured.', '2010-01-22 08:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822878, 848643, 32011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and use of sepia... fits the subject and scene well.<br/> <br/> <br/><i>Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97166" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">K10DGuy</a>''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is first cab off the rank</i> <br/> <br/>----------<br/> <br/>The storm final passed and the pounding waves left little of the seaside village that hundreds had once called home.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and use of sepia... fits the subject and scene well.  Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like  K10DGuy''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is first cab off the rank  ---------- The storm final passed and the pounding waves left little of the seaside village that hundreds had once called home.', '2010-01-22 08:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822879, 848495, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent street shot - perfect placement of the child - and really nice tones!</td>', 'Excellent street shot - perfect placement of the child - and really nice tones!', '2010-01-22 08:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822880, 848728, 73942, '<td valign="top">a rare capture done really well</td>', 'a rare capture done really well', '2010-01-22 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822882, 848008, 100831, '<td valign="top">terrific portrait - colors and composition are spot on! Love the betel nuts, but I can''t imagine what it does to the teeth!</td>', 'terrific portrait - colors and composition are spot on! Love the betel nuts, but I can''t imagine what it does to the teeth!', '2010-01-22 08:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822883, 848454, 100831, '<td valign="top">that''s one courageous lady!</td>', 'that''s one courageous lady!', '2010-01-22 08:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822885, 848856, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  The expression is great, and it works really nicely in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very cute!  The expression is great, and it works really nicely in B&W.', '2010-01-22 08:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822888, 847567, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like shots that tell a story, and this one does that really well.  Maybe a little puddle of blood would make it more convincing :)</td>', 'I like shots that tell a story, and this one does that really well.  Maybe a little puddle of blood would make it more convincing :)', '2010-01-22 08:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822889, 848766, 43463, '<td valign="top">Together against the elements - what a stunningly minimal nature shot. Great capture of this family of deer huddled together for warmth against the chill of the blanket of snow. I don''t know if others are judging it harshly because of the amount of negative/white space but I think it works beautifully to capture the mood and feel of the moment. As I mentioned, the eye immediately drawn to the deer family in their struggle to keep warm in the great white wilderness. Love this - 9</td>', 'Together against the elements - what a stunningly minimal nature shot. Great capture of this family of deer huddled together for warmth against the chill of the blanket of snow. I don''t know if others are judging it harshly because of the amount of negative/white space but I think it works beautifully to capture the mood and feel of the moment. As I mentioned, the eye immediately drawn to the deer family in their struggle to keep warm in the great white wilderness. Love this - 9', '2010-01-22 08:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822890, 847555, 3102, '<td valign="top">Is this guy for real?  He''s gonna run out of places for buttons.</td>', 'Is this guy for real?  He''s gonna run out of places for buttons.', '2010-01-22 08:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822891, 847831, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice scene!  The lighting seems a little flat to me, and it looks like the moon was burned a bit.</td>', 'Nice scene!  The lighting seems a little flat to me, and it looks like the moon was burned a bit.', '2010-01-22 08:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822892, 848516, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene!  I like the way the clouds are hugging the mountains.</td>', 'Very pretty scene!  I like the way the clouds are hugging the mountains.', '2010-01-22 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822899, 847556, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I always thought poses like this were just a little awkward, though, as if she had just gotten stung by a bee on her neck or something.  It would have been cool to see her up against a different colored background... something that would have complimented her hair color.</td>', 'Very nice!  I always thought poses like this were just a little awkward, though, as if she had just gotten stung by a bee on her neck or something.  It would have been cool to see her up against a different colored background... something that would have complimented her hair color.', '2010-01-22 08:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822901, 847246, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like something that would work well as a stock photo.  I''m not sure i get too much of a vibe/emotion from it otherwise.</td>', 'Looks like something that would work well as a stock photo.  I''m not sure i get too much of a vibe/emotion from it otherwise.', '2010-01-22 08:59:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5822902, 847060, 43463, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this somewhere and thinking to come back and leave a comment - only I could not remember where to find it. Now, I happily have the opportunity. Love the title - plays directly with the actions of the horse. I wonder what he/she heard that made him/her look back over the shoulder? Love the soft morning light that plays of the field - it gives the meadow grass a soft feel and a gentle glow. A lovely moment captured - 9</td>', 'I remember seeing this somewhere and thinking to come back and leave a comment - only I could not remember where to find it. Now, I happily have the opportunity. Love the title - plays directly with the actions of the horse. I wonder what he/she heard that made him/her look back over the shoulder? Love the soft morning light that plays of the field - it gives the meadow grass a soft feel and a gentle glow. A lovely moment captured - 9', '2010-01-22 08:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822905, 847556, 61396, '<td valign="top">Botticelli I presume. (not voting)</td>', 'Botticelli I presume. (not voting)', '2010-01-22 09:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822907, 848456, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment of B&amp;W toning here.  I think the girl in the front seems to be centered a little too much for my taste, but it''s a shot that makes you wonder what they''re being told.</td>', 'Nice treatment of B&W toning here.  I think the girl in the front seems to be centered a little too much for my taste, but it''s a shot that makes you wonder what they''re being told.', '2010-01-22 09:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822909, 847039, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  The guy has a look on his face as if to say, "Would you put the stinkin'' camera down, and pick up the oars!"</td>', 'Beautiful!  The guy has a look on his face as if to say, "Would you put the stinkin'' camera down, and pick up the oars!"', '2010-01-22 09:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822912, 847780, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen many similar shots of this scene... makes me want to go there (upper peninsula of Michigan?)</td>', 'I''ve seen many similar shots of this scene... makes me want to go there (upper peninsula of Michigan?)', '2010-01-22 09:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822915, 847905, 3102, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Beautiful colors.  I''m sure that was a tricky one to expose properly.</td>', 'Awesome!  Beautiful colors.  I''m sure that was a tricky one to expose properly.', '2010-01-22 09:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822920, 847069, 3102, '<td valign="top">A rather strange shot... not sure I quite get it to be honest.</td>', 'A rather strange shot... not sure I quite get it to be honest.', '2010-01-22 09:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822922, 848647, 3102, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene... it just looks a little too HDR''d or something.  Could use a little better contrast, in my opinion.</td>', 'A beautiful scene... it just looks a little too HDR''d or something.  Could use a little better contrast, in my opinion.', '2010-01-22 09:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822924, 847116, 17851, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far, I love the color saturation and sharpness!</td>', 'One of my favorites so far, I love the color saturation and sharpness!', '2010-01-22 09:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822926, 848239, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not a *bad* shot, but I''m not sure I would have considered this a "best of" candidate.  Seems a little grainy, and perhaps not the most unique or interesting choice.  I like the humor of it, given where he''s looking :)</td>', 'Not a *bad* shot, but I''m not sure I would have considered this a "best of" candidate.  Seems a little grainy, and perhaps not the most unique or interesting choice.  I like the humor of it, given where he''s looking :)', '2010-01-22 09:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822927, 848561, 43463, '<td valign="top">One of my highest rated photos in the bunch. This dinner scene captures the look and feel of the old world that has long gone by. I think of an irish family back in the early 1800''s before the potato famine hit. I just find this so appealing in it''s capture of what was just any every day occurence and to do it so well that it looks like a scene from a painting. Lighting, composition, and detail are all spectacular in this capture - 10 and a favorite.</td>', 'One of my highest rated photos in the bunch. This dinner scene captures the look and feel of the old world that has long gone by. I think of an irish family back in the early 1800''s before the potato famine hit. I just find this so appealing in it''s capture of what was just any every day occurence and to do it so well that it looks like a scene from a painting. Lighting, composition, and detail are all spectacular in this capture - 10 and a favorite.', '2010-01-22 09:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822937, 848822, 3102, '<td valign="top">A great moment!  I might have bumped up the contrast a bit and maybe would have cropped in a little tighter to bring the bear''s head out a little more, but this is a very cool shot.</td>', 'A great moment!  I might have bumped up the contrast a bit and maybe would have cropped in a little tighter to bring the bear''s head out a little more, but this is a very cool shot.', '2010-01-22 09:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822945, 848317, 3102, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like the bow of a boat... cool.</td>', 'Almost looks like the bow of a boat... cool.', '2010-01-22 09:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822946, 847420, 3102, '<td valign="top">A little too HDR-ish for my taste.</td>', 'A little too HDR-ish for my taste.', '2010-01-22 09:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822948, 847046, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of HDR... this looks a little over the top to me.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of HDR... this looks a little over the top to me.', '2010-01-22 09:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822952, 847854, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this style of photo and I''m enjoying the composition.  This shot seems to have suffered a tad in post-processing with oversharpening.  Could also use a slight hit in contrast to richen up the shadows (although that would send the borderline highlights over the edge to for sure blowouts I''m afraid).  This would be a good candidate to share in the forums after the challenge and ask "what would you do with this?"...maybe share a small copy of the original for various edits.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this style of photo and I''m enjoying the composition.  This shot seems to have suffered a tad in post-processing with oversharpening.  Could also use a slight hit in contrast to richen up the shadows (although that would send the borderline highlights over the edge to for sure blowouts I''m afraid).  This would be a good candidate to share in the forums after the challenge and ask "what would you do with this?"...maybe share a small copy of the original for various edits.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-22 09:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822955, 848725, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit snapshot-ish to me. The colors seem to be a bit too harsh with a lot of grain, and the composition seems a little off the mark.  Sorry to sound critical on this one... it just doesn''t seem like a very compelling entry for a "best of" challenge.</td>', 'Seems a bit snapshot-ish to me. The colors seem to be a bit too harsh with a lot of grain, and the composition seems a little off the mark.  Sorry to sound critical on this one... it just doesn''t seem like a very compelling entry for a "best of" challenge.', '2010-01-22 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822964, 848482, 3102, '<td valign="top">Portland Head Light in Maine!  We visited this spot this summer.  I wasn''t ambitious enough to be there at dawn though :)  Nicely done!</td>', 'Portland Head Light in Maine!  We visited this spot this summer.  I wasn''t ambitious enough to be there at dawn though :)  Nicely done!', '2010-01-22 09:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
