(5822971, 848340, 67579, '<td valign="top">Not sure if Im going to vote but I know this location well and you captured it beautifully, well done!</td>', 'Not sure if Im going to vote but I know this location well and you captured it beautifully, well done!', '2010-01-22 09:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822975, 848478, 3102, '<td valign="top">This shot strikes me as being kinda random, with a bit too much going on.  What is the subject?  Is it the girl?  Or Abraham Lincoln with the bike?  The two women seem to be stuck in there for no reason, and we''ve got the van driving by.  The scene just seems a bit too haphazard for me.  I think I would have tried to capture just one of these elements.  For me, the most interesting thing would have been to get a nice, tight and candid shot of Abe and his bike.</td>', 'This shot strikes me as being kinda random, with a bit too much going on.  What is the subject?  Is it the girl?  Or Abraham Lincoln with the bike?  The two women seem to be stuck in there for no reason, and we''ve got the van driving by.  The scene just seems a bit too haphazard for me.  I think I would have tried to capture just one of these elements.  For me, the most interesting thing would have been to get a nice, tight and candid shot of Abe and his bike.', '2010-01-22 09:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822978, 848552, 43463, '<td valign="top">A contrast in ironies/stereotypes and emotion is what this photo captures best. The tough guy with the imposing tattoos which make one think of the rough crowd or gangster. Then the tiny life of the small baby; an innocent a helpless little one in need of protection. This tough man gently cradles the small baby a look of affection in his features and his body posture. The child reaches out to touch the heart of this gentle giant of a man - this man who pledges to be this child''s protector. All the technicals aside (lighting, composition, and detail are perfect btw) this is a very strong human interest photo. An absolute 10.</td>', 'A contrast in ironies/stereotypes and emotion is what this photo captures best. The tough guy with the imposing tattoos which make one think of the rough crowd or gangster. Then the tiny life of the small baby; an innocent a helpless little one in need of protection. This tough man gently cradles the small baby a look of affection in his features and his body posture. The child reaches out to touch the heart of this gentle giant of a man - this man who pledges to be this child''s protector. All the technicals aside (lighting, composition, and detail are perfect btw) this is a very strong human interest photo. An absolute 10.', '2010-01-22 09:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822979, 847026, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool stuff.  I suspect I know who took this, because I''ve admired similar shots in the past.  I''m not sure I''d have the kahonas (sp?) to be hanging out by that opening :)</td>', 'Very, very cool stuff.  I suspect I know who took this, because I''ve admired similar shots in the past.  I''m not sure I''d have the kahonas (sp?) to be hanging out by that opening :)', '2010-01-22 09:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822980, 848495, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice timing to catch the shot, good composition. Good eye too. nice conversion to mono. 6</td>', 'Nice timing to catch the shot, good composition. Good eye too. nice conversion to mono. 6', '2010-01-22 09:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
