(5822989, 848818, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this, but it feels like there''s way too much of the foreground water in here.  That would have been ok if there had been some cool rocks to add more visual interest, but there are just kinda boring pebbles there.  It also feels like it should be rotated slightly clockwise, but just a couple degrees.  I probably would have cropped this as a horizontal shot, ending the water where the reflection stops.</td>', 'I like this, but it feels like there''s way too much of the foreground water in here.  That would have been ok if there had been some cool rocks to add more visual interest, but there are just kinda boring pebbles there.  It also feels like it should be rotated slightly clockwise, but just a couple degrees.  I probably would have cropped this as a horizontal shot, ending the water where the reflection stops.', '2010-01-22 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822991, 847480, 79955, '<td valign="top">nice timing ! overall image a little too bland for me , not enough excitement more a very nice snapshot. 5</td>', 'nice timing ! overall image a little too bland for me , not enough excitement more a very nice snapshot. 5', '2010-01-22 09:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822992, 848340, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is without a doubt a truly gorgeous shot!It is truly a shame one cannot just jump into the picture like they do in the Mary Poppins film of this would be a wonderful place to explore. Composition and lighting and detailed DOF are just stunning. Love how the flowing river is in the center and acts as a curving road that the eye travels upon to arrive at the majestic mountain beyond the canopy of pines.</td>', 'This is without a doubt a truly gorgeous shot!It is truly a shame one cannot just jump into the picture like they do in the Mary Poppins film of this would be a wonderful place to explore. Composition and lighting and detailed DOF are just stunning. Love how the flowing river is in the center and acts as a curving road that the eye travels upon to arrive at the majestic mountain beyond the canopy of pines.', '2010-01-22 09:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822995, 848702, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent capture , nice processing to make this "pop". 7</td>', 'excellent capture , nice processing to make this "pop". 7', '2010-01-22 09:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822997, 848839, 3102, '<td valign="top">Probably a bit too snapshot-ish for a "best of" challenge.  It''s certainly a cute shot for a family album, but artistically it seems a little lacking.  In particular, he''s out of focus and probably should have had a bit more fill lighting on his face.</td>', 'Probably a bit too snapshot-ish for a "best of" challenge.  It''s certainly a cute shot for a family album, but artistically it seems a little lacking.  In particular, he''s out of focus and probably should have had a bit more fill lighting on his face.', '2010-01-22 09:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5822998, 847358, 28564, '<td valign="top">i like it very very much! but, why not in colors?</td>', 'i like it very very much! but, why not in colors?', '2010-01-22 09:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823002, 847854, 79955, '<td valign="top">I wish you did not oversharpen this. The oversharpening halo is too obvious. A little too much detail lost in the highlights. Composition is very good. 6</td>', 'I wish you did not oversharpen this. The oversharpening halo is too obvious. A little too much detail lost in the highlights. Composition is very good. 6', '2010-01-22 09:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823004, 847223, 3102, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit harsh on this one.  So many of the petals are just a bit overblown.  On a sunny day like this (assuming that''s from sunshine), you might hang a sheet in such a way that it softens the light on the flowers.  Or shoot them on a day where it''s slightly overcast.</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit harsh on this one.  So many of the petals are just a bit overblown.  On a sunny day like this (assuming that''s from sunshine), you might hang a sheet in such a way that it softens the light on the flowers.  Or shoot them on a day where it''s slightly overcast.', '2010-01-22 09:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823006, 848367, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant yellows and oranges that visually pop of the page. This sunflowers are lovely to look upon. My only critique (a small one at that) is that I wish the sunflower in the forefront was in the same sharp focus as all the others. Increasing the F-stop (8 or even higher) and slower shutter speed to let enough light in would greatly increase your DOF (Depth of Field) for both the background and foreground.</td>', 'Love the vibrant yellows and oranges that visually pop of the page. This sunflowers are lovely to look upon. My only critique (a small one at that) is that I wish the sunflower in the forefront was in the same sharp focus as all the others. Increasing the F-stop (8 or even higher) and slower shutter speed to let enough light in would greatly increase your DOF (Depth of Field) for both the background and foreground.', '2010-01-22 09:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823007, 847472, 79955, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! great shot a lot of humour , excellent detail and I love the composition. Great job here , 8</td>', 'LOL!!! great shot a lot of humour , excellent detail and I love the composition. Great job here , 8', '2010-01-22 09:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
