(5823119, 847780, 28564, '<td valign="top">it seems to be like the red ribbon of 2008 best challenge (in my fav)... maybe i prefer this composition, so i give you an high vote... the place is fantastic!</td>', 'it seems to be like the red ribbon of 2008 best challenge (in my fav)... maybe i prefer this composition, so i give you an high vote... the place is fantastic!', '2010-01-22 10:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823120, 848872, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this for the wonderful colors, reflections, and calm overall feel to it.  Can''t help but lean to the right to view it...have you tried straightening the horizon some?  Hmmm...after further viewing maybe it''s just the angle the photo was taken from.  Still, that first reaction is hard to shake off.  I think if you used a perspective tool and got the verticals on the front of the house to be, well, vertical, it could help.  :-)</td>', 'I like this for the wonderful colors, reflections, and calm overall feel to it.  Can''t help but lean to the right to view it...have you tried straightening the horizon some?  Hmmm...after further viewing maybe it''s just the angle the photo was taken from.  Still, that first reaction is hard to shake off.  I think if you used a perspective tool and got the verticals on the front of the house to be, well, vertical, it could help.  :-)', '2010-01-22 10:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823128, 847090, 43774, '<td valign="top">The idea behind this is pretty good. I like the silhouette and the hat. The clouds are really neat. The photo looks tilted to the left though and I think it would be much stronger if the road were centered in the composition. The light is a bit too harsh as well.</td>', 'The idea behind this is pretty good. I like the silhouette and the hat. The clouds are really neat. The photo looks tilted to the left though and I think it would be much stronger if the road were centered in the composition. The light is a bit too harsh as well.', '2010-01-22 10:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
