(5823142, 848518, 28564, '<td valign="top">i gave you a low score (4), why?<br/> <br/>''cause the subject is too centered, and the contrasts are too net here so i can''t see details in the lower part of this butterfly. <br/> <br/>Maybe ambient light was too hard, i know that take photograph of butterflies isn''t so easy, but at least the composition could be better, i do not know your macro skills, so take my words "as are", is only my vision of this shot.</td>', 'i gave you a low score (4), why? ''cause the subject is too centered, and the contrasts are too net here so i can''t see details in the lower part of this butterfly.  Maybe ambient light was too hard, i know that take photograph of butterflies isn''t so easy, but at least the composition could be better, i do not know your macro skills, so take my words "as are", is only my vision of this shot.', '2010-01-22 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
