(5823197, 848646, 92577, '<td valign="top">I''d crop the bottom third so that the foreground rocks become a frame, rather than a distraction, for the main, sunlit rocks. Then crop a third of the right side of what''s left to give more depth and balance. It then needs a touch of sharpening. - Just a suggestion - good luck.</td>', 'I''d crop the bottom third so that the foreground rocks become a frame, rather than a distraction, for the main, sunlit rocks. Then crop a third of the right side of what''s left to give more depth and balance. It then needs a touch of sharpening. - Just a suggestion - good luck.', '2010-01-22 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
