(5823220, 848519, 43774, '<td valign="top">Amazing scene, I think it would be just as good without the girl. Would love to see it in colour as I don''t think the B&amp;W is doing the photo any favours.</td>', 'Amazing scene, I think it would be just as good without the girl. Would love to see it in colour as I don''t think the B&W is doing the photo any favours.', '2010-01-22 10:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
