(5823233, 848420, 43463, '<td valign="top">The details of the cracks and crevices of the rocks in the foreground is great - one can see and almost feel the wet surface those rocks on the beach. Colors of the twilight sky is gorgeous. The mountain range in the distance just completes this beautiful beach scene. Nicely captured - 8</td>', 'The details of the cracks and crevices of the rocks in the foreground is great - one can see and almost feel the wet surface those rocks on the beach. Colors of the twilight sky is gorgeous. The mountain range in the distance just completes this beautiful beach scene. Nicely captured - 8', '2010-01-22 10:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823248, 847041, 43463, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Just look at the details and iridescent green color on that beetle! You can see hairs on this insect - that is how sharp as a tack this is. We can truly appreciate all the details of this creature rather than be just mesmirized by it colorful iridescent topshell. Love the bokeh effect where there is a warm orange &amp; yellow background to complement the colors of this beetle.</td>', 'Whoa! Just look at the details and iridescent green color on that beetle! You can see hairs on this insect - that is how sharp as a tack this is. We can truly appreciate all the details of this creature rather than be just mesmirized by it colorful iridescent topshell. Love the bokeh effect where there is a warm orange & yellow background to complement the colors of this beetle.', '2010-01-22 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823265, 847530, 28564, '<td valign="top">original and beautiful macro, only a Q: why in b/w? However i like it, good composition.</td>', 'original and beautiful macro, only a Q: why in b/w? However i like it, good composition.', '2010-01-22 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823269, 847914, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors of the costumes and the expression of the man you captured in the forground. Open mouth in mid battle cry/whoop such that I can almost hear the noise and spectacle. Great detail and well composed. Not only is my eye captured by the man in festival garb in front but I can see the procession of other like dressed festival goers in the background. I would be curious to learn the details as to what and where this festival took place after the challenge rollsover.</td>', 'Love the colors of the costumes and the expression of the man you captured in the forground. Open mouth in mid battle cry/whoop such that I can almost hear the noise and spectacle. Great detail and well composed. Not only is my eye captured by the man in festival garb in front but I can see the procession of other like dressed festival goers in the background. I would be curious to learn the details as to what and where this festival took place after the challenge rollsover.', '2010-01-22 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823272, 847866, 28564, '<td valign="top">incredible... is the lightning real? Beautiful shot, i''d like to take photograph of lightning as this one...</td>', 'incredible... is the lightning real? Beautiful shot, i''d like to take photograph of lightning as this one...', '2010-01-22 11:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823277, 848883, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - I have to hand it to that guy to play in that weather.  I''m shivering, just looking.  Is that Paris?</td>', 'Wow - I have to hand it to that guy to play in that weather.  I''m shivering, just looking.  Is that Paris?', '2010-01-22 11:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823279, 847242, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can hear that epic music playing in the background as we see the credits roll on a swashbuckler movie. :)</td>', 'I can hear that epic music playing in the background as we see the credits roll on a swashbuckler movie. :)', '2010-01-22 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823280, 848683, 43463, '<td valign="top">Ah the sites, sounds, games and rides of a faire! Love how you captured this one boy looking at the ride. Love that you captured the movement of the ride rather than it being static. For now, like the boy, I get to see this ride in action...and also like this child I will then decide if I want to ride it or not:-) Love the colors too - all objects within the composition are excellently illuminated. Wonderful photo that captures the feel and mood of a local faire.</td>', 'Ah the sites, sounds, games and rides of a faire! Love how you captured this one boy looking at the ride. Love that you captured the movement of the ride rather than it being static. For now, like the boy, I get to see this ride in action...and also like this child I will then decide if I want to ride it or not:-) Love the colors too - all objects within the composition are excellently illuminated. Wonderful photo that captures the feel and mood of a local faire.', '2010-01-22 11:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823281, 848379, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is just gorgeous.  I love the bokeh and narrow DOF.  Perfect focus.</td>', 'Oh this is just gorgeous.  I love the bokeh and narrow DOF.  Perfect focus.', '2010-01-22 11:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823283, 848356, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh the tilt of that head just makes the shot.  Love the feathery textures.  Great focus.</td>', 'Oh the tilt of that head just makes the shot.  Love the feathery textures.  Great focus.', '2010-01-22 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823284, 848229, 15711, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  The way the silhouettes stand out amidst the fog and that red roofed house.  I remember seeing this earlier in the year but can''t remember who took it. It''s one of my favorites. 9</td>', 'Brilliant.  The way the silhouettes stand out amidst the fog and that red roofed house.  I remember seeing this earlier in the year but can''t remember who took it. It''s one of my favorites. 9', '2010-01-22 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823285, 847191, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great focus. I find that red feather thing a real distraction.</td>', 'Great focus. I find that red feather thing a real distraction.', '2010-01-22 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823286, 847308, 15711, '<td valign="top">OMG!!!  This is just stellar.  The colors and textures - WOWZA.  What an incredible find. 10</td>', 'OMG!!!  This is just stellar.  The colors and textures - WOWZA.  What an incredible find. 10', '2010-01-22 11:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823289, 848549, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great.  The trees balance each other, the balloons balance each other and the color scheme ties them all together.  I love the guys jeans being the same color as the upper sky.  It''s kind of busy but yet it all works.  Nicely done. If I could nit anything, it might be that house in the left along the horizon, but no big deal. 8</td>', 'This is great.  The trees balance each other, the balloons balance each other and the color scheme ties them all together.  I love the guys jeans being the same color as the upper sky.  It''s kind of busy but yet it all works.  Nicely done. If I could nit anything, it might be that house in the left along the horizon, but no big deal. 8', '2010-01-22 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823290, 847246, 15711, '<td valign="top">Susan, is that yours?  I like the ust of line in this shot.  Not only the pin stripes but the angle he is tilted. I''m wishing I could see more of his eyes.</td>', 'Susan, is that yours?  I like the ust of line in this shot.  Not only the pin stripes but the angle he is tilted. I''m wishing I could see more of his eyes.', '2010-01-22 11:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823291, 848917, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  Borzoi???  I might have cropped out most of the lower and upper areas and made it in landscape mode, so we can zoom in on her face.</td>', 'Oh I love this.  Borzoi???  I might have cropped out most of the lower and upper areas and made it in landscape mode, so we can zoom in on her face.', '2010-01-22 11:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823292, 848888, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWW. Sad.  I can hear Swan Lake playing in the background.</td>', 'AWW. Sad.  I can hear Swan Lake playing in the background.', '2010-01-22 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823293, 847760, 15711, '<td valign="top">What an unusual pair. :)</td>', 'What an unusual pair. :)', '2010-01-22 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823294, 847090, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like all the layers of this - the swirly clouded sky, the silhouettes of the mountain range, the sparkly of the ground reflecting the sun.  Not sure what your cowboy is doing there - photography, maybe? - but he does add scale which is always nice in a shot like this.  The B&amp;W renders the layers more apparent than would be in color, I suspect - good choice.</td>', 'I like all the layers of this - the swirly clouded sky, the silhouettes of the mountain range, the sparkly of the ground reflecting the sun.  Not sure what your cowboy is doing there - photography, maybe? - but he does add scale which is always nice in a shot like this.  The B&W renders the layers more apparent than would be in color, I suspect - good choice.', '2010-01-22 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823295, 847467, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this train with the orientation that the train seems to be coming at you as one stands just off to the far side of the tracks. Details are great as is the lighting. The thing that is holding back this shot from moving up into the above average category is that the contrasts are a bit flat and could be more dynamic. There is a lot of mid-grey tones here that could use a boost in the contrast such that there is more of a dynamic range of whites, greys and blacks. Sometimes just a straight greyscale or a colorize set at 0,0 is not enough and you have to play around with the brightness/contrast levels or shadow/midtone/highlights to get a greater dynamic range of tones.</td>', 'I like the composition of this train with the orientation that the train seems to be coming at you as one stands just off to the far side of the tracks. Details are great as is the lighting. The thing that is holding back this shot from moving up into the above average category is that the contrasts are a bit flat and could be more dynamic. There is a lot of mid-grey tones here that could use a boost in the contrast such that there is more of a dynamic range of whites, greys and blacks. Sometimes just a straight greyscale or a colorize set at 0,0 is not enough and you have to play around with the brightness/contrast levels or shadow/midtone/highlights to get a greater dynamic range of tones.', '2010-01-22 11:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823296, 847379, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of wide and B&amp;W.  The detail and the majesty come through very nicely in this!</td>', 'Very nice use of wide and B&W.  The detail and the majesty come through very nicely in this!', '2010-01-22 11:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823297, 848901, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice engagement photo that I''m sure pleased the giver and recipient!  Works well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very nice engagement photo that I''m sure pleased the giver and recipient!  Works well in B&W.', '2010-01-22 11:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823299, 847069, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of a cat come back to visit after having departed this earth.  The warmth of the color tone makes it a friendly visit, too.</td>', 'Makes me think of a cat come back to visit after having departed this earth.  The warmth of the color tone makes it a friendly visit, too.', '2010-01-22 11:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823300, 848828, 28564, '<td valign="top">i see too much blur on the subject, with a higher shutter speed could be better i think... is also a little underexposed, so i gave you a low score, 4.</td>', 'i see too much blur on the subject, with a higher shutter speed could be better i think... is also a little underexposed, so i gave you a low score, 4.', '2010-01-22 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
