(5823303, 847467, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good use of a square crop, and I like being able to see the folks leaning out the windows!  Nice sense of nostalgia to this.</td>', 'Good use of a square crop, and I like being able to see the folks leaning out the windows!  Nice sense of nostalgia to this.', '2010-01-22 11:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823305, 847618, 43463, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the bokeh effect that creates this dramatic golden/orange backdrop for this white wolf. Love the details I can see in the fur coat and rich brown color of his eyes as he stare down at me. I get the feeling he is definately surveying his domain and watching for intruders!</td>', 'I absolutely love the bokeh effect that creates this dramatic golden/orange backdrop for this white wolf. Love the details I can see in the fur coat and rich brown color of his eyes as he stare down at me. I get the feeling he is definately surveying his domain and watching for intruders!', '2010-01-22 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823308, 847222, 30982, '<td valign="top">The first thought that came to mind, believe it or not, is "graceful".  So light and colorful and really does for some reason impart grace and beauty.</td>', 'The first thought that came to mind, believe it or not, is "graceful".  So light and colorful and really does for some reason impart grace and beauty.', '2010-01-22 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823310, 848514, 30982, '<td valign="top">First thought - what gorgeous light and color!  Nicely edited (though perhaps a bit oversharpened at DPC-size - it would be fine at full size) to bring out the warmth of the light and stone here.</td>', 'First thought - what gorgeous light and color!  Nicely edited (though perhaps a bit oversharpened at DPC-size - it would be fine at full size) to bring out the warmth of the light and stone here.', '2010-01-22 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823311, 848538, 113278, '<td valign="top">I love this. Beautiful to look at, the only thing distracting for me is the dark cloud in the upper left. For some reason my eyes keep getting drawn to it. Still a 9 for me.</td>', 'I love this. Beautiful to look at, the only thing distracting for me is the dark cloud in the upper left. For some reason my eyes keep getting drawn to it. Still a 9 for me.', '2010-01-22 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823313, 847905, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love the warm, rich tones of orange and yellows in this sunset shoot. What really sets this apart from just another sunset over the mountains is the compositional framing. You included the trees to act as a natural frame to add dimension and interest to your shot. Not to mention that you have some interesting rolling hillsides to frame the bottom portion of the composition. Lighting and silhouetting of the trees also adds a great amount of visual appeal. Lovely.</td>', 'I love the warm, rich tones of orange and yellows in this sunset shoot. What really sets this apart from just another sunset over the mountains is the compositional framing. You included the trees to act as a natural frame to add dimension and interest to your shot. Not to mention that you have some interesting rolling hillsides to frame the bottom portion of the composition. Lighting and silhouetting of the trees also adds a great amount of visual appeal. Lovely.', '2010-01-22 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823315, 847425, 28564, '<td valign="top">wow... awesome details here... i like the composition very very much, and i like your editing work, great photograph=high score! :-)</td>', 'wow... awesome details here... i like the composition very very much, and i like your editing work, great photograph=high score! :-)', '2010-01-22 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
