(5823344, 848935, 113278, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and thoses eyes are excellent. I personally would have liked it to be more of head shot and not have as much of her torso.</td>', 'I really like the light and thoses eyes are excellent. I personally would have liked it to be more of head shot and not have as much of her torso.', '2010-01-22 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823345, 848348, 43463, '<td valign="top">I see this as a very poetic photo in mood and feel. Actually, this instantly reminded me of a haiku I wrote years ago and had it had tree branches instead of bars it would match perfectly<br/> <br/><i>Tree branch curves skyward<br/>Reaching low to snare the moon<br/>Echo bathed beauty </i> <br/> <br/>Nonetheless the moon is an echo bathed beauty here but it is ensnared or trapped by the bars that invokes imagery of imprisonment. That the moon is no longer free to roam the sky but trapped earthbound is a very powerful image. My only plaint is that I wish that the rock did not obscure the surface of the moon (and if this is not a moon but a streetlight don''t tell me please for it will destroy the imagery) This is a very artistic and visual poetry shot. Bumping up.</td>', 'I see this as a very poetic photo in mood and feel. Actually, this instantly reminded me of a haiku I wrote years ago and had it had tree branches instead of bars it would match perfectly Tree branch curves skywardReaching low to snare the moonEcho bathed beauty   Nonetheless the moon is an echo bathed beauty here but it is ensnared or trapped by the bars that invokes imagery of imprisonment. That the moon is no longer free to roam the sky but trapped earthbound is a very powerful image. My only plaint is that I wish that the rock did not obscure the surface of the moon (and if this is not a moon but a streetlight don''t tell me please for it will destroy the imagery) This is a very artistic and visual poetry shot. Bumping up.', '2010-01-22 11:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823348, 848162, 113278, '<td valign="top">Well this is different and not really my taste. I think the shadows are a bit harsh and the green in the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Well this is different and not really my taste. I think the shadows are a bit harsh and the green in the background is a bit distracting.', '2010-01-22 11:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823354, 847339, 113278, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked much better if you could have done it without the white streaks, They distract me, but the style for the rest of the image actually works for me.</td>', 'I think this would have worked much better if you could have done it without the white streaks, They distract me, but the style for the rest of the image actually works for me.', '2010-01-22 11:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
