(5823637, 848326, 96881, '<td valign="top">The image is centred, but not quite.  By this I mean you have taken from the middle of the room, and the end of the room is almost in the middle of the image, as are the middle of the roof elements, but it isn''t quite, which makes the image look tilted slightly.  A more dramatic angle and using the brialliant elements of the room to lead the eyes through the image would have worked better.</td>', 'The image is centred, but not quite.  By this I mean you have taken from the middle of the room, and the end of the room is almost in the middle of the image, as are the middle of the roof elements, but it isn''t quite, which makes the image look tilted slightly.  A more dramatic angle and using the brialliant elements of the room to lead the eyes through the image would have worked better.', '2010-01-22 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
