(5823662, 848934, 327, '<td valign="top">Emotional shot for me. Sad, empty, lost and more. The reflection and the branch are reaching..reaching for what? Help? Just beautifully shot and composed. I think its a compliment to envoke reaction with our images and you''ve done that here. This is a good one!!!</td>', 'Emotional shot for me. Sad, empty, lost and more. The reflection and the branch are reaching..reaching for what? Help? Just beautifully shot and composed. I think its a compliment to envoke reaction with our images and you''ve done that here. This is a good one!!!', '2010-01-22 12:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
