(5823720, 847812, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love these snow ponies. Great framing on the composition of elements. Love how the one pony is framed by the body of the pony standing majestically in front. A subtle little visual stating that this is -his- mate or perhaps this is his son in which it is a family connection. Great colors and and lighting!</td>', 'Very nice! Love these snow ponies. Great framing on the composition of elements. Love how the one pony is framed by the body of the pony standing majestically in front. A subtle little visual stating that this is -his- mate or perhaps this is his son in which it is a family connection. Great colors and and lighting!', '2010-01-22 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823722, 847469, 68947, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool SP shot.  Made me smile and that''s worthy of a 9 in my books. :)</td>', 'Pretty cool SP shot.  Made me smile and that''s worthy of a 9 in my books. :)', '2010-01-22 13:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
