(5823735, 847308, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow the colors on this bird are lovely! I didn''t know that they could have such rainbow coloration. Love the bokeh that creates a wonderful golden backdrop for this bird to pop off of. Detail is fabulous as well with it giving me some great details to look at from the feathers to the wings to the beak and eye. Wonderful avian shot!</td>', 'Wow the colors on this bird are lovely! I didn''t know that they could have such rainbow coloration. Love the bokeh that creates a wonderful golden backdrop for this bird to pop off of. Detail is fabulous as well with it giving me some great details to look at from the feathers to the wings to the beak and eye. Wonderful avian shot!', '2010-01-22 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823738, 847847, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great colours on the horizon and interesting shades through the clouds which are a major feature of this photo.  The offset road works really well also</td>', 'Great colours on the horizon and interesting shades through the clouds which are a major feature of this photo.  The offset road works really well also', '2010-01-22 13:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823740, 847530, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the cool duo-tones for they are very dynamic in this composition. The photo really shows off the detail in this dragonfly''s wings. I really can get a nice appreciation of the lactices and delicate nature of the wings. Only plaint is that I ALMOST wish more of the wing was in sharp focus - great DOF with higher aperature and slower shutter speed would accomplish that. I say almost because I don''t know how much improving the DOF would destroy the ''soft'' dreamy quality of the shot - which the more I look at it, the more it grows on me.</td>', 'Love the cool duo-tones for they are very dynamic in this composition. The photo really shows off the detail in this dragonfly''s wings. I really can get a nice appreciation of the lactices and delicate nature of the wings. Only plaint is that I ALMOST wish more of the wing was in sharp focus - great DOF with higher aperature and slower shutter speed would accomplish that. I say almost because I don''t know how much improving the DOF would destroy the ''soft'' dreamy quality of the shot - which the more I look at it, the more it grows on me.', '2010-01-22 13:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823744, 848811, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s cool! I like the smoothness of the water too.</td>', 'Wow that''s cool! I like the smoothness of the water too.', '2010-01-22 13:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823747, 848548, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the detail in the backlit petals. Not too fond of the other flower in the background, it looks like a shadow.</td>', 'Love the detail in the backlit petals. Not too fond of the other flower in the background, it looks like a shadow.', '2010-01-22 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823748, 848474, 96881, '<td valign="top">A different image in the challenge, showing your different style compared to the majority on this site.  The wave is interesting and the use of B&amp;W is good.</td>', 'A different image in the challenge, showing your different style compared to the majority on this site.  The wave is interesting and the use of B&W is good.', '2010-01-22 13:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823754, 848812, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very pretty little girl, I like that you filled the frame. Not quite in focus on her face though, that''s a shame.</td>', 'Very pretty little girl, I like that you filled the frame. Not quite in focus on her face though, that''s a shame.', '2010-01-22 13:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5823755, 848699, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait!  I love the sharpness of her eyes and the soft focus on the rest of the shot.  It''s focused on the Windows Of The Soul.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait!  I love the sharpness of her eyes and the soft focus on the rest of the shot.  It''s focused on the Windows Of The Soul.  Nicely done!', '2010-01-22 13:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
