(5823758, 848640, 96881, '<td valign="top">The processing really emphasizes the bird from the surroundings.  There appears though to be haloing around the bird and the heavy processing of the background is not to my liking</td>', 'The processing really emphasizes the bird from the surroundings.  There appears though to be haloing around the bird and the heavy processing of the background is not to my liking', '2010-01-22 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
