(5823824, 848772, 43774, '<td valign="top">A pretty daffodil. A few hints to make it better - crop off the tree/pole on the left, straighten the horizon, submit a bigger size to challenges.</td>', 'A pretty daffodil. A few hints to make it better - crop off the tree/pole on the left, straighten the horizon, submit a bigger size to challenges.', '2010-01-22 13:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
