(5824059, 848001, 327, '<td valign="top">You can''t help but laugh at this goofy face. Wonderful colors and wonderful humor.</td>', 'You can''t help but laugh at this goofy face. Wonderful colors and wonderful humor.', '2010-01-22 15:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
