(5824062, 848815, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really good and different group capture.  I do like that you intentionally kept them all at the one level, and went for a different crop rather than trying to fit them into the standard........One thing that really annoys me when I look at this is the left most person is not looking at the camera, while the rest are.........</td>', 'A really good and different group capture.  I do like that you intentionally kept them all at the one level, and went for a different crop rather than trying to fit them into the standard........One thing that really annoys me when I look at this is the left most person is not looking at the camera, while the rest are.........', '2010-01-22 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5824063, 848830, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m always a sucker for Northern Lights shots :)  Very dramatic!</td>', 'I''m always a sucker for Northern Lights shots :)  Very dramatic!', '2010-01-22 15:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
