(5824067, 847110, 327, '<td valign="top">She is so sweet and pretty. Love this, the light behind her hair, her expression but the best is the eye contact. Makes the shot for me.</td>', 'She is so sweet and pretty. Love this, the light behind her hair, her expression but the best is the eye contact. Makes the shot for me.', '2010-01-22 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
