(5825175, 847235, 105441, '<td valign="top">Excellent image with a story.  Would like the cow to be a bit more prominent, but so many other elements work very well (including the diagonals in the subdued patterns of the field grass.) 9</td>', 'Excellent image with a story.  Would like the cow to be a bit more prominent, but so many other elements work very well (including the diagonals in the subdued patterns of the field grass.) 9', '2010-01-22 22:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
