(5825179, 848819, 98977, '<td valign="top">I like your blending of flash and ambient here.  Knocking down the ambient as much as you did gives it the edgy that i think you were going for.  Was the flash gelled to match ambient at all?</td>', 'I like your blending of flash and ambient here.  Knocking down the ambient as much as you did gives it the edgy that i think you were going for.  Was the flash gelled to match ambient at all?', '2010-01-22 22:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
