(5825181, 848022, 105441, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Seems a bit soft, and the bright light in the upper left corner is distracting, but I really like the image.</td>', 'Great concept.  Seems a bit soft, and the bright light in the upper left corner is distracting, but I really like the image.', '2010-01-22 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
