(5825231, 848247, 43463, '<td valign="top">Happy, happy, jump for joy is what this photo speaks to me. Love the warm gold and reddish/orange tones which also helps strengthen the happy and sunny mood of this shot. Silhouette of the jumping lady and the fields are nice, dark and deep allowing them to really pop off the background.</td>', 'Happy, happy, jump for joy is what this photo speaks to me. Love the warm gold and reddish/orange tones which also helps strengthen the happy and sunny mood of this shot. Silhouette of the jumping lady and the fields are nice, dark and deep allowing them to really pop off the background.', '2010-01-22 22:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
