(5825302, 848479, 98977, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity with out going over processed. I find myself wishing for a different crop.</td>', 'Nice clarity with out going over processed. I find myself wishing for a different crop.', '2010-01-22 22:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
