(5826158, 848765, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice capture, but the boat is a little too obscured for me, as you cannot see much of the rest of the paddlers.  The crop I think is a little too close to the main paddlers head, as you also are getting a thin run of rocks.........The colour as well could have been processed to make them a bit richer as well</td>', 'A nice capture, but the boat is a little too obscured for me, as you cannot see much of the rest of the paddlers.  The crop I think is a little too close to the main paddlers head, as you also are getting a thin run of rocks.........The colour as well could have been processed to make them a bit richer as well', '2010-01-23 06:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
