(5826165, 848005, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good light management in high contrast conditions, though the foreground is a bit flat and dark.<br/>Good idea to include people, but these ones are definitely too much tourists.<br/>With a little step toward the right, you could have separated more clearly the cross from the bell tower.<br/>Globally, still a nice-looking image.</td>', 'Good light management in high contrast conditions, though the foreground is a bit flat and dark.Good idea to include people, but these ones are definitely too much tourists.With a little step toward the right, you could have separated more clearly the cross from the bell tower.Globally, still a nice-looking image.', '2010-01-23 07:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
