(5826195, 848886, 103142, '<td valign="top">to be honest, I''m not sure that the post and the rope are that interesting of a subject. It doesn''t have much character to it. However, it blurs remarkably beautiful! The two posts in the distance and the distant grasses have such a dream-like quality to them. I wish the front post could somehow be a little less prominent. <br/> <br/>Lovely colors, lovely background, and very good choice of title. -7-</td>', 'to be honest, I''m not sure that the post and the rope are that interesting of a subject. It doesn''t have much character to it. However, it blurs remarkably beautiful! The two posts in the distance and the distant grasses have such a dream-like quality to them. I wish the front post could somehow be a little less prominent.  Lovely colors, lovely background, and very good choice of title. -7-', '2010-01-23 08:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
