(5826291, 848479, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great close-up on this eagle where the details are nice and sharp. The horizontal crop was a good choice for it subtly matches up and complements the leading lines of the side portrait of this majestic bird''s head. Wish the bokeh was a little more stronger in the backdrop such that I then could not see the chain link cross patterns. However, oddly enough, the criss-cross pattern of the chain link is a repeated pattern that you can see in the layering of the brown feathers on the eagle.</td>', 'Great close-up on this eagle where the details are nice and sharp. The horizontal crop was a good choice for it subtly matches up and complements the leading lines of the side portrait of this majestic bird''s head. Wish the bokeh was a little more stronger in the backdrop such that I then could not see the chain link cross patterns. However, oddly enough, the criss-cross pattern of the chain link is a repeated pattern that you can see in the layering of the brown feathers on the eagle.', '2010-01-23 09:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826293, 847314, 100566, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture and just the right amount of post processing.</td>', 'Stunning capture and just the right amount of post processing.', '2010-01-23 09:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
