(5826307, 848539, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice architectural lines the flow up towards the sky. I like how the Needle is centered between the the ribbon-like structures; almost like a curtain being drawn out and the way so the observer can get a better view. Love the colors of the yellows/orange/and dark reds that leap off the grey winter sky. I like how the vertical crop plays into &amp; complements the vertical shapes of the Needle and the ribbon structures. The title does not speak to me like the photo does - when I look at your photo I think ''The Sky Within Our Reach''.</td>', 'Nice architectural lines the flow up towards the sky. I like how the Needle is centered between the the ribbon-like structures; almost like a curtain being drawn out and the way so the observer can get a better view. Love the colors of the yellows/orange/and dark reds that leap off the grey winter sky. I like how the vertical crop plays into & complements the vertical shapes of the Needle and the ribbon structures. The title does not speak to me like the photo does - when I look at your photo I think ''The Sky Within Our Reach''.', '2010-01-23 09:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826316, 847038, 100566, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the subject, but it seems too light in the foreground for where the sun apparently is, giving the picture an unreal quality. Might create more drama and focus on the lighthouse if the foreground was not so bright?</td>', 'I really like the composition and the subject, but it seems too light in the foreground for where the sun apparently is, giving the picture an unreal quality. Might create more drama and focus on the lighthouse if the foreground was not so bright?', '2010-01-23 09:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
