(5826324, 848535, 43774, '<td valign="top">So bright and clear, the bird looks wonderful. Background a bit busy, would like to see more separation between the bird and the man.</td>', 'So bright and clear, the bird looks wonderful. Background a bit busy, would like to see more separation between the bird and the man.', '2010-01-23 09:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826325, 848928, 43463, '<td valign="top">The colors are what instantly attracts the eye towards the composition. The red and yellow hues are vibrant. A slightly above average shot in which the visual appeal could be stronger. The DOF (Depth of Field) so that not only does the flower in the foreground remain in sharp focus but those in the backdrop do too. Going with a higher aperature (8 or higher) and slower shutter speed to let enough light will accomplish that. Your lighting is fine with the flowers nicely illuminated to show varience in the shades of yellow. Lastly, I think the visual appeal would be stronger if the flower in the forefront exactly matched the diagonal lines of the horizontal composition. The stem is right about in the center of the bottom left corner it would be nice if the open face of the flower exactly faced the center top right corner to match; then there would be alignment on the ''unseen'' diagonal line.</td>', 'The colors are what instantly attracts the eye towards the composition. The red and yellow hues are vibrant. A slightly above average shot in which the visual appeal could be stronger. The DOF (Depth of Field) so that not only does the flower in the foreground remain in sharp focus but those in the backdrop do too. Going with a higher aperature (8 or higher) and slower shutter speed to let enough light will accomplish that. Your lighting is fine with the flowers nicely illuminated to show varience in the shades of yellow. Lastly, I think the visual appeal would be stronger if the flower in the forefront exactly matched the diagonal lines of the horizontal composition. The stem is right about in the center of the bottom left corner it would be nice if the open face of the flower exactly faced the center top right corner to match; then there would be alignment on the ''unseen'' diagonal line.', '2010-01-23 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826326, 847033, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice saturated colours, good detail on the flower but background is distracting and the flower is a bit too centered.</td>', 'Nice saturated colours, good detail on the flower but background is distracting and the flower is a bit too centered.', '2010-01-23 09:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
