(5826394, 848886, 43463, '<td valign="top">I was going to say that the colors are slightly muted and that it could do with a touch of saturation and a boost in some contrasts but then I stopped myself. Those slightly muted colors give the sense of age...of a memory recalled of a happy past event. Perfect when playing into the mood of nostalgia and reaching back to happy childhood memories. Some might not like the off kilter composition but I find that it is appealing because you use the ropes and posts on the almost diagonal line that leads my eye to the beachshore. That diagonal could be stronger though if you matched the rope perfectly up with the bottom right corner which would automatically tilt the last post off in the distance to the top left corner. Bumping up to a 7.</td>', 'I was going to say that the colors are slightly muted and that it could do with a touch of saturation and a boost in some contrasts but then I stopped myself. Those slightly muted colors give the sense of age...of a memory recalled of a happy past event. Perfect when playing into the mood of nostalgia and reaching back to happy childhood memories. Some might not like the off kilter composition but I find that it is appealing because you use the ropes and posts on the almost diagonal line that leads my eye to the beachshore. That diagonal could be stronger though if you matched the rope perfectly up with the bottom right corner which would automatically tilt the last post off in the distance to the top left corner. Bumping up to a 7.', '2010-01-23 10:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
