(5826440, 848859, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely cute pic and shows the shyness of these animals. The comp works but unsure about the tree if it maybe needs to be out for this frame. Cant help to think what a portrate would have looked like. Both formats has its merits but this tree is just a bit obstructive for me 6</td>', 'Lovely cute pic and shows the shyness of these animals. The comp works but unsure about the tree if it maybe needs to be out for this frame. Cant help to think what a portrate would have looked like. Both formats has its merits but this tree is just a bit obstructive for me 6', '2010-01-23 10:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
