(5826447, 848792, 23484, '<td valign="top">I recognize this spot Terry. Very nice shot.</td>', 'I recognize this spot Terry. Very nice shot.', '2010-01-23 10:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826448, 848336, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The highlights seem a bit hot.</td>', 'Nice composition. The highlights seem a bit hot.', '2010-01-23 10:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826450, 848186, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Seems a bit soft, but I''m not sure that bothers me too much. I like the cool tones.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Seems a bit soft, but I''m not sure that bothers me too much. I like the cool tones.', '2010-01-23 10:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826451, 848835, 76335, '<td valign="top">The scene alone doesn''t do much for me. Needs some activity or life, I think. Also, I don''t care for the Topaz/HDR. But that''s just me perhaps.</td>', 'The scene alone doesn''t do much for me. Needs some activity or life, I think. Also, I don''t care for the Topaz/HDR. But that''s just me perhaps.', '2010-01-23 10:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826454, 848022, 76335, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t care for pregnancy pics, but this is funny -- if only because it''s novel and unexpected. Extra points for not having an older sibling kissing her belly.</td>', 'I generally don''t care for pregnancy pics, but this is funny -- if only because it''s novel and unexpected. Extra points for not having an older sibling kissing her belly.', '2010-01-23 10:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826456, 847745, 86218, '<td valign="top">Setting nice and the monotone works for this type of pic and the mood created by it. The big shadow tree does not look very sharp but im unsure if this really needs to be for this type shot. I would love to see a couple holding hands walking through this lovely scene. What Im saying is purely personal and for another person solitude would be there preference I presume. Only thing that Bothers me really is the white empty space at the top right. It takes me to much away from the core of this pic. This needs to be enclosed and protected for this mood to be carried stronger...But then we did not choose for these trees to grow the way they have :)</td>', 'Setting nice and the monotone works for this type of pic and the mood created by it. The big shadow tree does not look very sharp but im unsure if this really needs to be for this type shot. I would love to see a couple holding hands walking through this lovely scene. What Im saying is purely personal and for another person solitude would be there preference I presume. Only thing that Bothers me really is the white empty space at the top right. It takes me to much away from the core of this pic. This needs to be enclosed and protected for this mood to be carried stronger...But then we did not choose for these trees to grow the way they have :)', '2010-01-23 10:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826459, 848890, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the bokeh. I wish the shirt were all white or that we could read what''s on it. It''s a minor point though.</td>', 'I like the framing and the bokeh. I wish the shirt were all white or that we could read what''s on it. It''s a minor point though.', '2010-01-23 10:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826460, 848830, 76335, '<td valign="top">This one has a 3D feel to it. Great.</td>', 'This one has a 3D feel to it. Great.', '2010-01-23 10:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826461, 848495, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nicely timed. Funny..most pics Im looking for eye contact but in this one having the girl look up to the painted man would have been nice. Its a candid shot and as such I like it very much</td>', 'Nicely timed. Funny..most pics Im looking for eye contact but in this one having the girl look up to the painted man would have been nice. Its a candid shot and as such I like it very much', '2010-01-23 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826462, 848893, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice earth tones and stacking of layers which culmiates with the animal in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice earth tones and stacking of layers which culmiates with the animal in the foreground.', '2010-01-23 10:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826463, 848552, 76335, '<td valign="top">But who''s saying it! I think the tight DOF and high contrast works to good effect here.</td>', 'But who''s saying it! I think the tight DOF and high contrast works to good effect here.', '2010-01-23 10:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826464, 848355, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting but would prefer the sun to be not as hot as it is now. Im not sure what f stop was but stopping down and getting more of that tree before the sun would really help to cool it down more and you would have a much better pic</td>', 'Lovely setting but would prefer the sun to be not as hot as it is now. Im not sure what f stop was but stopping down and getting more of that tree before the sun would really help to cool it down more and you would have a much better pic', '2010-01-23 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826465, 848895, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition, but something feels unnatural about it. Maybe too much sharpening? I like where you''re taking this theme, however.</td>', 'This is a great composition, but something feels unnatural about it. Maybe too much sharpening? I like where you''re taking this theme, however.', '2010-01-23 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826466, 847847, 76335, '<td valign="top">Colors are garish and it looks like too much noise reduction -- especially in the sky, but I don''t see good textures anywhere really. Good use of thirds.</td>', 'Colors are garish and it looks like too much noise reduction -- especially in the sky, but I don''t see good textures anywhere really. Good use of thirds.', '2010-01-23 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826468, 848535, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the guy with the cigarette is there for. The skin tones (the man''s) look unnatural.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the guy with the cigarette is there for. The skin tones (the man''s) look unnatural.', '2010-01-23 10:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826469, 847130, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not my style of processing, but a good composition and mood anyway.</td>', 'Not my style of processing, but a good composition and mood anyway.', '2010-01-23 10:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826471, 847555, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great character study.</td>', 'Great character study.', '2010-01-23 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826473, 848239, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2010-01-23 10:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826477, 848519, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the soft, mid key processing. Wish we could at least see her (?) profile.</td>', 'I like the soft, mid key processing. Wish we could at least see her (?) profile.', '2010-01-23 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826479, 847937, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, good capture.</td>', 'Good action shot, good capture.', '2010-01-23 10:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826481, 848355, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice scene but a bit overexposed in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice scene but a bit overexposed in my opinion.', '2010-01-23 10:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826486, 848469, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter, a bit noisy perhaps.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter, a bit noisy perhaps.', '2010-01-23 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826487, 848786, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo is a bit dark for my tastes, subject seems too centered. But a good candid moment you caught.</td>', 'Photo is a bit dark for my tastes, subject seems too centered. But a good candid moment you caught.', '2010-01-23 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826493, 848923, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract, cool looking.</td>', 'Very nice abstract, cool looking.', '2010-01-23 10:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826494, 848824, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  ErickV? If not. . . it''s a compliment. 8</td>', 'Very nicely done.  ErickV? If not. . . it''s a compliment. 8', '2010-01-23 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826496, 848922, 103048, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! That''s almost like an oil painting.</td>', 'Beautiful! That''s almost like an oil painting.', '2010-01-23 10:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826498, 847224, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting, unique, good light on her face, would like to see a bit more detail in her hair. Seems to have an orange/greenish glow on her skin. Would like to see it more natural looking.</td>', 'Interesting, unique, good light on her face, would like to see a bit more detail in her hair. Seems to have an orange/greenish glow on her skin. Would like to see it more natural looking.', '2010-01-23 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
