(5826501, 848106, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the boat, maybe try not to center it so much, have it sailing into the frame. Also quite a bit of noise in the sky, you could probably get rid of most of it with some noise reduction.</td>', 'Nice detail on the boat, maybe try not to center it so much, have it sailing into the frame. Also quite a bit of noise in the sky, you could probably get rid of most of it with some noise reduction.', '2010-01-23 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
