(5826655, 847554, 86218, '<td valign="top">I love what you have done here and this is extremely difficult to isolate this tree like you have here. The pic is not sharp though and feel lighting could be better. I would play around with angles and this is an opportunity that could be used more. To get the right light you need time and patience and time. Its worthwile to do that if you live close by. This has winner written all over it with different comps and lighting. You have the location and the setting. Use it now. 6</td>', 'I love what you have done here and this is extremely difficult to isolate this tree like you have here. The pic is not sharp though and feel lighting could be better. I would play around with angles and this is an opportunity that could be used more. To get the right light you need time and patience and time. Its worthwile to do that if you live close by. This has winner written all over it with different comps and lighting. You have the location and the setting. Use it now. 6', '2010-01-23 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
