(5826708, 848790, 68947, '<td valign="top">Striking shot!  It really has appeal in a lot of ways.  The processing makes this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Striking shot!  It really has appeal in a lot of ways.  The processing makes this shot.  Nicely done.', '2010-01-23 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
