(5826710, 848312, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a great candid street scene, it''s almost as if they all posed for you to make it perfect.</td>', 'What a great candid street scene, it''s almost as if they all posed for you to make it perfect.', '2010-01-23 11:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
