(5826729, 847831, 86218, '<td valign="top">Beautifull place and nice mood. Just feel that maybe you have to much in the pic here. Needs simpler composition.</td>', 'Beautifull place and nice mood. Just feel that maybe you have to much in the pic here. Needs simpler composition.', '2010-01-23 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826730, 848163, 15711, '<td valign="top">p-p-p-p-p-paddle face (I hope you know the Lady Gaga song this refers to) :)  This is cool and artsy.</td>', 'p-p-p-p-p-paddle face (I hope you know the Lady Gaga song this refers to) :)  This is cool and artsy.', '2010-01-23 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826731, 847835, 68947, '<td valign="top">I know that many DPCers will likely not take well to a photographed statue but, I look at this as a piece of art.  It has a majestic vantage point and the editing is what really makes this interesting above the angle it was shot on.  8</td>', 'I know that many DPCers will likely not take well to a photographed statue but, I look at this as a piece of art.  It has a majestic vantage point and the editing is what really makes this interesting above the angle it was shot on.  8', '2010-01-23 11:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826732, 847469, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect Street. 10</td>', 'Perfect Street. 10', '2010-01-23 11:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826734, 847087, 86218, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a painting than a picture and although this is beautifull, i would love to see this in a more natural processing.</td>', 'Looks more like a painting than a picture and although this is beautifull, i would love to see this in a more natural processing.', '2010-01-23 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826735, 847312, 15711, '<td valign="top">Outstanding stop action!</td>', 'Outstanding stop action!', '2010-01-23 11:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826736, 847026, 68947, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the far-away look in your subject''s eyes...amost a serene look in the face of something that would absolutely TERRIFY me! LOL  Even the peaceful position of his hand placement.  It''s as though he''s at "peace" somehow for that moment in time and you''ve captured it.  Love it!</td>', 'I think it''s the far-away look in your subject''s eyes...amost a serene look in the face of something that would absolutely TERRIFY me! LOL  Even the peaceful position of his hand placement.  It''s as though he''s at "peace" somehow for that moment in time and you''ve captured it.  Love it!', '2010-01-23 11:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826737, 848822, 68947, '<td valign="top">AMAZING</td>', 'AMAZING', '2010-01-23 11:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826738, 848934, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice mood and simple comp. Crop a bit off at bottom. Dead branch does not look sharp?</td>', 'Nice mood and simple comp. Crop a bit off at bottom. Dead branch does not look sharp?', '2010-01-23 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826742, 848515, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing still life shot...the subject matter, the editing the wonderful sepia tone...everything goes wel together.  What strikes me most is the positioning of the helmut, facing towards the camera....I can almost see someone in it. Nicely done!</td>', 'This is an intriguing still life shot...the subject matter, the editing the wonderful sepia tone...everything goes wel together.  What strikes me most is the positioning of the helmut, facing towards the camera....I can almost see someone in it. Nicely done!', '2010-01-23 11:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826744, 847231, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very noisy picture and not sure if the vertical take on this lizard works entirely for me. Maybe some more light on the eye as well would help lift this shot...thats where the focus is for me</td>', 'Very noisy picture and not sure if the vertical take on this lizard works entirely for me. Maybe some more light on the eye as well would help lift this shot...thats where the focus is for me', '2010-01-23 11:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826745, 848911, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m normally quite tired of seeing wildlife photos, mainly because they are usually zoo shots of pretty, perfectly groomed animals.  I think that''s why this one is an exception for me.  The wet, ruffled bird just somehow really grabs me. :)</td>', 'I''m normally quite tired of seeing wildlife photos, mainly because they are usually zoo shots of pretty, perfectly groomed animals.  I think that''s why this one is an exception for me.  The wet, ruffled bird just somehow really grabs me. :)', '2010-01-23 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826747, 847907, 86218, '<td valign="top">I battle to take nice pictures of anything in this line so im no better at this. Im finding it hard to focus on something and its hard to know where my eyes should rest. Nice effort though</td>', 'I battle to take nice pictures of anything in this line so im no better at this. Im finding it hard to focus on something and its hard to know where my eyes should rest. Nice effort though', '2010-01-23 11:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826748, 848883, 68947, '<td valign="top">Absolutely captivating shot, right down to the snow covered bag and the intensity in the musician''s stance, leaning towards a potential "donor" :)  The editing helps this even further.  Nicely done!  Love it!</td>', 'Absolutely captivating shot, right down to the snow covered bag and the intensity in the musician''s stance, leaning towards a potential "donor" :)  The editing helps this even further.  Nicely done!  Love it!', '2010-01-23 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826749, 848561, 68947, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an old master''s painting.  The lighting, the subject matter...really nice!</td>', 'This reminds me of an old master''s painting.  The lighting, the subject matter...really nice!', '2010-01-23 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826750, 848367, 86218, '<td valign="top">I took of my glasses and this looked like a painting. I love this and would love to know the pp here. Somehow it works for me</td>', 'I took of my glasses and this looked like a painting. I love this and would love to know the pp here. Somehow it works for me', '2010-01-23 11:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826751, 848500, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow...what a capture!  Love the clarity in spite of the action...the lighting and the processing.  One to be appreciated! :)</td>', 'Wow...what a capture!  Love the clarity in spite of the action...the lighting and the processing.  One to be appreciated! :)', '2010-01-23 11:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826753, 848848, 44877, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and detail. Tighter crop would have been beneficial.</td>', 'Excellent exposure and detail. Tighter crop would have been beneficial.', '2010-01-23 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826754, 848770, 68947, '<td valign="top">I was thinking at first glance..."oh great...another spider web shot" but, once I''d clicked the thumbnail, it''s true beauty showed up...not only in subject capture but, angle, composition and DOF.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I was thinking at first glance..."oh great...another spider web shot" but, once I''d clicked the thumbnail, it''s true beauty showed up...not only in subject capture but, angle, composition and DOF.  Nicely done!', '2010-01-23 11:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826755, 847534, 68947, '<td valign="top">It looks like you were getting the "evil eye" from your subject...as though he was saying, "what are you doing taking a picture of me?" :)  Lovely editing! :)</td>', 'It looks like you were getting the "evil eye" from your subject...as though he was saying, "what are you doing taking a picture of me?" :)  Lovely editing! :)', '2010-01-23 11:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826758, 848822, 113634, '<td valign="top">cool picture....but i love the title!</td>', 'cool picture....but i love the title!', '2010-01-23 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826763, 848625, 86218, '<td valign="top">Wow..looks surreal and im not sure if this is a doll or real woman. The eyes give it away though. What really makes this shot for me is the blurred head in back and the black empty eyes that gives no clue however - looking onto the queen. Eary... Me like 8</td>', 'Wow..looks surreal and im not sure if this is a doll or real woman. The eyes give it away though. What really makes this shot for me is the blurred head in back and the black empty eyes that gives no clue however - looking onto the queen. Eary... Me like 8', '2010-01-23 11:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826765, 847109, 45243, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture !!</td>', 'Beautiful capture !!', '2010-01-23 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
