(5826767, 848822, 45243, '<td valign="top">Right time; right place...incredible "critter catch"</td>', 'Right time; right place...incredible "critter catch"', '2010-01-23 11:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826768, 847830, 86218, '<td valign="top">The angle here creates a very strong comp and effect of the SUPER horse carrying the caring rider. Could not be comfortable bare back on the horse but then this is super horse...She does not gallop..she Glides.<br/> <br/>Not sure about how the behind has been cropped? 7</td>', 'The angle here creates a very strong comp and effect of the SUPER horse carrying the caring rider. Could not be comfortable bare back on the horse but then this is super horse...She does not gallop..she Glides. Not sure about how the behind has been cropped? 7', '2010-01-23 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826771, 847247, 45243, '<td valign="top">great action catch</td>', 'great action catch', '2010-01-23 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826773, 847169, 113634, '<td valign="top">what a cool perspective</td>', 'what a cool perspective', '2010-01-23 11:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826774, 847064, 86218, '<td valign="top">lovely cute pic. pity about pink cast found also on the skin. Little hand under chin works great and maybe would love to see more of the hand...but hey, im no pro with portraits. The girl however seems to be a pro at looking natural and relaxed and very charming. No parent could say no to this face 6 because of colour. 8 had it been without the pink cast. im sure this is soemthing that could have been prevented in most PP programs.</td>', 'lovely cute pic. pity about pink cast found also on the skin. Little hand under chin works great and maybe would love to see more of the hand...but hey, im no pro with portraits. The girl however seems to be a pro at looking natural and relaxed and very charming. No parent could say no to this face 6 because of colour. 8 had it been without the pink cast. im sure this is soemthing that could have been prevented in most PP programs.', '2010-01-23 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826779, 847026, 45243, '<td valign="top">Thanks for Serving !!</td>', 'Thanks for Serving !!', '2010-01-23 11:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
