(5826791, 847173, 86218, '<td valign="top">Good enough to eat. Really looks good and as a food shot this gets a thumbs up for me. Gravy is as good as sold 8</td>', 'Good enough to eat. Really looks good and as a food shot this gets a thumbs up for me. Gravy is as good as sold 8', '2010-01-23 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
