(5826797, 848474, 86218, '<td valign="top">Im unsure of what to make of this. Im sorry but I really cant give any comment that I believe that would help. Would love to know the thoughts behind this frame.</td>', 'Im unsure of what to make of this. Im sorry but I really cant give any comment that I believe that would help. Would love to know the thoughts behind this frame.', '2010-01-23 12:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5826800, 848794, 86218, '<td valign="top">First impression is absolutely beautifull. Background works great but then..This need sto be portrait to get bug in to the full and slightly more depth needed on the bug. Still a nice shot and colours work well. Just to much on the right.</td>', 'First impression is absolutely beautifull. Background works great but then..This need sto be portrait to get bug in to the full and slightly more depth needed on the bug. Still a nice shot and colours work well. Just to much on the right.', '2010-01-23 12:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
