(5827760, 847914, 30982, '<td valign="top">How fun!!  Wonderful capture!!</td>', 'How fun!!  Wonderful capture!!', '2010-01-23 19:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827762, 848350, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this one has indeed seen better days.</td>', 'Oh my, this one has indeed seen better days.', '2010-01-23 19:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827763, 847984, 49865, '<td valign="top">absolutely striking.</td>', 'absolutely striking.', '2010-01-23 19:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827765, 848060, 49865, '<td valign="top">well hey there little buddy.</td>', 'well hey there little buddy.', '2010-01-23 19:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827766, 848837, 100831, '<td valign="top">this is amazing.</td>', 'this is amazing.', '2010-01-23 19:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827767, 847247, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective - really gives a great view of the place and of the action.</td>', 'Awesome perspective - really gives a great view of the place and of the action.', '2010-01-23 19:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827768, 848338, 49865, '<td valign="top">the layered, dramatic sky really adds a lot to this. i think i would have turned down the green saturation a smidge and let those dark clouds directly behind the tree pass a bit, but otherwise this is a very enchanting image.</td>', 'the layered, dramatic sky really adds a lot to this. i think i would have turned down the green saturation a smidge and let those dark clouds directly behind the tree pass a bit, but otherwise this is a very enchanting image.', '2010-01-23 19:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827769, 848555, 30982, '<td valign="top">Raining stars!  Lovely.</td>', 'Raining stars!  Lovely.', '2010-01-23 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827770, 848002, 49865, '<td valign="top">little guy is making me hungry. beautiful colors...</td>', 'little guy is making me hungry. beautiful colors...', '2010-01-23 19:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827771, 848454, 49865, '<td valign="top">this certainly tells a story, doesn''t it! great capture, and nice composition.</td>', 'this certainly tells a story, doesn''t it! great capture, and nice composition.', '2010-01-23 19:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827773, 847365, 49865, '<td valign="top">nom nom nom</td>', 'nom nom nom', '2010-01-23 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827774, 848880, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of the foreground subject and nice catch of the light.  Very well balanced.</td>', 'Beautiful use of the foreground subject and nice catch of the light.  Very well balanced.', '2010-01-23 19:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827777, 848648, 49865, '<td valign="top">the nervous focus/blur and angle of the photo seems to enhance the story on the man''s face. a 7 from me.</td>', 'the nervous focus/blur and angle of the photo seems to enhance the story on the man''s face. a 7 from me.', '2010-01-23 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827779, 847196, 49865, '<td valign="top">the little boy''s face really makes this for me.</td>', 'the little boy''s face really makes this for me.', '2010-01-23 19:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827780, 847933, 49865, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous, i''d sure like to be there right about now.</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous, i''d sure like to be there right about now.', '2010-01-23 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827781, 848702, 100831, '<td valign="top">ethereal indeed. Lovely color.</td>', 'ethereal indeed. Lovely color.', '2010-01-23 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827783, 847091, 100831, '<td valign="top">Ohhh - I like this in b/w. Nice job!</td>', 'Ohhh - I like this in b/w. Nice job!', '2010-01-23 19:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827789, 848682, 101117, '<td valign="top">The old guy seems to have a bit of an amused look on his face, and wouldn''t you just!</td>', 'The old guy seems to have a bit of an amused look on his face, and wouldn''t you just!', '2010-01-23 19:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827790, 848538, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast. Perfect b/w. Beautiful scenery.</td>', 'Love the contrast. Perfect b/w. Beautiful scenery.', '2010-01-23 19:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827791, 848801, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting place to fine a sailing ship. How did it get into that pond in the first place?</td>', 'Interesting place to fine a sailing ship. How did it get into that pond in the first place?', '2010-01-23 19:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827792, 848909, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great colours and light here. The strong green is really nice contrasting with the grey sky.</td>', 'Great colours and light here. The strong green is really nice contrasting with the grey sky.', '2010-01-23 19:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827793, 848923, 43463, '<td valign="top">The balance of highlights and shadows is excellent in this predominately white composition. Not only a study of lines and shapes in this museum structure but also a really cool architectural shot. I really like how you composed the shot such that the main strut lines extend out to the top left corner; the line fan out on a diagonal with the ''branches'' coming extending out to make triangular patterns. Opposite the straight lines are the curves seen not only in the circle adorned walls but in the curve at the top of that wall as it bends.</td>', 'The balance of highlights and shadows is excellent in this predominately white composition. Not only a study of lines and shapes in this museum structure but also a really cool architectural shot. I really like how you composed the shot such that the main strut lines extend out to the top left corner; the line fan out on a diagonal with the ''branches'' coming extending out to make triangular patterns. Opposite the straight lines are the curves seen not only in the circle adorned walls but in the curve at the top of that wall as it bends.', '2010-01-23 19:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827797, 848934, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes and reflections, but somehow it''s not really grabbing my attention much. <strike>Not quite sure.</strike> <br/> <br/>Ok, now I''m sure after looking at the image details. At a 40k file size, there is some severe JPEG compression going on here, and I think that is what is killing all the clarity and pop in this image. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'Interesting shapes and reflections, but somehow it''s not really grabbing my attention much. Not quite sure.  Ok, now I''m sure after looking at the image details. At a 40k file size, there is some severe JPEG compression going on here, and I think that is what is killing all the clarity and pop in this image. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2010-01-23 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827798, 848328, 101117, '<td valign="top">It''s take me a while to figure out exactly what I''m seeing here. I think the reflection is balloons floating up against the lights.<br/> <br/>It''s such a strange contrast of environments between the inside and the outside. The outside world seems very old style, with the warm light and the sandstone buildings, it feels peaceful. Then on the inside you have what I can only assume are the electric unnatural blue colour being lit by fluorescent lighting, which is harsh and feels a touch sad when contrasted by the outside world.<br/> <br/>So much to look at here, such an interesting shot!</td>', 'It''s take me a while to figure out exactly what I''m seeing here. I think the reflection is balloons floating up against the lights. It''s such a strange contrast of environments between the inside and the outside. The outside world seems very old style, with the warm light and the sandstone buildings, it feels peaceful. Then on the inside you have what I can only assume are the electric unnatural blue colour being lit by fluorescent lighting, which is harsh and feels a touch sad when contrasted by the outside world. So much to look at here, such an interesting shot!', '2010-01-23 20:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827799, 848549, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great colours and perspective. I love the vibrancy of the whole thing.<br/> <br/>Not sure about the inclusion of the other photographer though, I think it ruins the serenity of the shot.</td>', 'Great colours and perspective. I love the vibrancy of the whole thing. Not sure about the inclusion of the other photographer though, I think it ruins the serenity of the shot.', '2010-01-23 20:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827800, 847608, 43463, '<td valign="top">I think I remember a description saying that this was a lighthouse. It looks to be the loneliest lighthouse on the planet. The icy region looks cold and very lonely for anyone set to do lighthouse duty. I can see a ship way off in the distance enshouded in the haze of the morning light. Love the colors and details of stones in this structure. The extended ''arm'' that would hold the guiding light almost takes on aspects of a fishing rod. It would be interesting to see this scene at night with the light lighted, but that may be difficult or not advisable due to freezing chill:-) Very beautiful shot.</td>', 'I think I remember a description saying that this was a lighthouse. It looks to be the loneliest lighthouse on the planet. The icy region looks cold and very lonely for anyone set to do lighthouse duty. I can see a ship way off in the distance enshouded in the haze of the morning light. Love the colors and details of stones in this structure. The extended ''arm'' that would hold the guiding light almost takes on aspects of a fishing rod. It would be interesting to see this scene at night with the light lighted, but that may be difficult or not advisable due to freezing chill:-) Very beautiful shot.', '2010-01-23 20:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827802, 848923, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract shot, just the kind of thing I can imagine hanging in the entrance of a large modern glass building.<br/> <br/>The only thing which lets this shot down a bit is the colour of what I assume are plastic panels, they take away a little from the very crisp whites of the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Interesting abstract shot, just the kind of thing I can imagine hanging in the entrance of a large modern glass building. The only thing which lets this shot down a bit is the colour of what I assume are plastic panels, they take away a little from the very crisp whites of the rest of the scene.', '2010-01-23 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827803, 848002, 100831, '<td valign="top">this is awesome. Beautiful colors and wonderfully abstract.</td>', 'this is awesome. Beautiful colors and wonderfully abstract.', '2010-01-23 20:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827805, 848831, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ha, nicely done, love the very close up approach. he really looks focused.<br/> <br/>This will be a wonderful picture to look back on years from now, I would definitely have this printed and put in an album!</td>', 'Ha, nicely done, love the very close up approach. he really looks focused. This will be a wonderful picture to look back on years from now, I would definitely have this printed and put in an album!', '2010-01-23 20:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827807, 848772, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this must get a vote on the low side from me. <br/> <br/>-There is a noticeable tilt to the image, that does not appear to be by design. Sometimes an intentional tilt can add impact, but I don''t think that''s the case here. Correcting tilt is an easy fix.<br/> <br/>-The pole/tree poking in on the left draws my eye away from the real subject and also draws attention to the tilt.<br/> <br/>-I DO like the way the blades of grass are outlined by the sunshine, and utilizing the translucency of the backlit petals works well.</td>', 'I''m afraid this must get a vote on the low side from me.  -There is a noticeable tilt to the image, that does not appear to be by design. Sometimes an intentional tilt can add impact, but I don''t think that''s the case here. Correcting tilt is an easy fix. -The pole/tree poking in on the left draws my eye away from the real subject and also draws attention to the tilt. -I DO like the way the blades of grass are outlined by the sunshine, and utilizing the translucency of the backlit petals works well.', '2010-01-23 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827808, 848532, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, though I''m not a fan of the fisheye look for this image. It''s a good effort to try and present a common scene in a different manner, but it does not seem to work for me. That of course, is just a personal preference thing, and I will be surprised if this entry does not soundly beat my own.</td>', 'I like the scene, though I''m not a fan of the fisheye look for this image. It''s a good effort to try and present a common scene in a different manner, but it does not seem to work for me. That of course, is just a personal preference thing, and I will be surprised if this entry does not soundly beat my own.', '2010-01-23 20:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827809, 848186, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice but I think a wider angle shot would have worked better. I say that because as soon as I looked at the shot I found myself wishing I could see the tops of the closer buildings and further up the waterway to the right.</td>', 'This is nice but I think a wider angle shot would have worked better. I say that because as soon as I looked at the shot I found myself wishing I could see the tops of the closer buildings and further up the waterway to the right.', '2010-01-23 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827810, 847196, 43463, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing the various shots of this photo shoot and while this is top notch work I like the expressions and poses of the earlier challenge shot. In the earlier one the kid had this devil may care expression and attitude - channeling some vibes from James Dean Rebel Without a Cause/ or Easy Rider. Here the kid looks about to cry as he steps off his bike to talk to the officer which does not coincide with the tough guy look in the dudes he wears and the mean tattoos on his arm (nice detail to have him wear the costume tattoo sleeves). Still, concept, image clarity, details and compositional elements all are great:-) High marks ...although not as high as the earlier one I liked more;-)</td>', 'I remember seeing the various shots of this photo shoot and while this is top notch work I like the expressions and poses of the earlier challenge shot. In the earlier one the kid had this devil may care expression and attitude - channeling some vibes from James Dean Rebel Without a Cause/ or Easy Rider. Here the kid looks about to cry as he steps off his bike to talk to the officer which does not coincide with the tough guy look in the dudes he wears and the mean tattoos on his arm (nice detail to have him wear the costume tattoo sleeves). Still, concept, image clarity, details and compositional elements all are great:-) High marks ...although not as high as the earlier one I liked more;-)', '2010-01-23 20:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827812, 848835, 101117, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of those artists renderings that you see when a new business park is being developed! I''m guessing the effect came from topaz.</td>', 'This looks like one of those artists renderings that you see when a new business park is being developed! I''m guessing the effect came from topaz.', '2010-01-23 20:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827814, 848822, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fantastic nature shot! Perhaps could benefit from a little more visual pop. Just out of curiosity, I did some quick adjustments on it and found a modest s-curve and some mild saturation increase really made the bear and the pattern of the water spray stand out. I''ll be curious to see how this fares in voting. I can''t ding an otherwise outstanding nature shot for the PP, so it still gets a high vote for me.</td>', 'Fantastic nature shot! Perhaps could benefit from a little more visual pop. Just out of curiosity, I did some quick adjustments on it and found a modest s-curve and some mild saturation increase really made the bear and the pattern of the water spray stand out. I''ll be curious to see how this fares in voting. I can''t ding an otherwise outstanding nature shot for the PP, so it still gets a high vote for me.', '2010-01-23 20:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827815, 848515, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting details, and because they''re interesting it does make me want to see more of the shot. I can''t say for sure if that''s a good or bad thing, I imagine this shot would work very well as a series with other details and ultimately the whole bike.</td>', 'Interesting details, and because they''re interesting it does make me want to see more of the shot. I can''t say for sure if that''s a good or bad thing, I imagine this shot would work very well as a series with other details and ultimately the whole bike.', '2010-01-23 20:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827817, 848923, 42013, '<td valign="top">great building and museum. You''ve achieved a nice symmetry here.</td>', 'great building and museum. You''ve achieved a nice symmetry here.', '2010-01-23 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827818, 848819, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very good sports portrait. Great lighting here and you''ve controlled it will with the strong colours.</td>', 'Very good sports portrait. Great lighting here and you''ve controlled it will with the strong colours.', '2010-01-23 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827820, 848640, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little on the overprocessed side, but I like it. It does very good for the details on the pelican, though it also brought out some unpleasant graininess in the background.</td>', 'A little on the overprocessed side, but I like it. It does very good for the details on the pelican, though it also brought out some unpleasant graininess in the background.', '2010-01-23 20:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827822, 848625, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''ll have to keep this shot in mind when I go to the Mardi Gras next moth. The shallow DOF is perfect.</td>', 'Very nice. I''ll have to keep this shot in mind when I go to the Mardi Gras next moth. The shallow DOF is perfect.', '2010-01-23 20:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827823, 847728, 42013, '<td valign="top">IMpressive display... people seem too sharp but i''m not sure how they wouldn''t look to sharp at 800 pixels. Hope you sold a bunch!</td>', 'IMpressive display... people seem too sharp but i''m not sure how they wouldn''t look to sharp at 800 pixels. Hope you sold a bunch!', '2010-01-23 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827824, 848625, 57447, '<td valign="top">Compelling composition.</td>', 'Compelling composition.', '2010-01-23 20:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827825, 848734, 105441, '<td valign="top">Interesting - this held my attention longer that I would expect for a simple photo. The foreground object (a broken sand dollar, I think) is a little small for my taste, and the vignetting at first looked like a flash that lit the center of the frame.</td>', 'Interesting - this held my attention longer that I would expect for a simple photo. The foreground object (a broken sand dollar, I think) is a little small for my taste, and the vignetting at first looked like a flash that lit the center of the frame.', '2010-01-23 20:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827826, 848840, 101117, '<td valign="top">It''s taken me a while to figure out exactly what I''m looking at here. I think the problem is that there''s too many distracting details, the bright lines coming from the branches etc. <br/> <br/>The shallow DOF doesn''t seem to work entirely as well as it leaves out what could be interesting details as well.<br/> <br/>I think overall, composition has probably let you down here. This might have come out a lot better taken from a different angle to get more of the interesting details and less of the annoying stuff.</td>', 'It''s taken me a while to figure out exactly what I''m looking at here. I think the problem is that there''s too many distracting details, the bright lines coming from the branches etc.  The shallow DOF doesn''t seem to work entirely as well as it leaves out what could be interesting details as well. I think overall, composition has probably let you down here. This might have come out a lot better taken from a different angle to get more of the interesting details and less of the annoying stuff.', '2010-01-23 20:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827827, 847463, 48657, '<td valign="top">well shot, memory captured for decades to come.</td>', 'well shot, memory captured for decades to come.', '2010-01-23 20:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827828, 847567, 109640, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture! Like the effect</td>', 'Very cool picture! Like the effect', '2010-01-23 20:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827830, 848278, 105441, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the use of silhouette, especially with the "sprinkles" so well defined.  The image seems soft though, with noised in the sky.  7</td>', 'I like the concept and the use of silhouette, especially with the "sprinkles" so well defined.  The image seems soft though, with noised in the sky.  7', '2010-01-23 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827831, 848729, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice with the exception of the large black cloud to the upper left, which completely dominates the picture and makes the tree more of a secondary element. I think if you had just cropped this a bit more off the top it would have improved it for me.</td>', 'This is nice with the exception of the large black cloud to the upper left, which completely dominates the picture and makes the tree more of a secondary element. I think if you had just cropped this a bit more off the top it would have improved it for me.', '2010-01-23 20:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827832, 848454, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can see a lot of effort put into this one, and it''s a fun shot, for certain. Just seems like more of a snapshot to me.</td>', 'I can see a lot of effort put into this one, and it''s a fun shot, for certain. Just seems like more of a snapshot to me.', '2010-01-23 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827833, 847425, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good focus.  I''d like a bit more area to the left for the bird to "look into."</td>', 'Nice capture, good focus.  I''d like a bit more area to the left for the bird to "look into."', '2010-01-23 20:28:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5827834, 848340, 101117, '<td valign="top">When I see shots like this I often wonder how long you had to walk to get to it. This one feels pretty isolated though for all I know you could be standing at the edge of the car park :)<br/> <br/>I like this, I like the fact that you have nice details running all the way through it, from the rocks in the foreground right through to the mountain in the background. The stream for me is a touch overdone, I usually prefer water to look like water rather than flowing smoke.</td>', 'When I see shots like this I often wonder how long you had to walk to get to it. This one feels pretty isolated though for all I know you could be standing at the edge of the car park :) I like this, I like the fact that you have nice details running all the way through it, from the rocks in the foreground right through to the mountain in the background. The stream for me is a touch overdone, I usually prefer water to look like water rather than flowing smoke.', '2010-01-23 20:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827835, 847555, 57447, '<td valign="top">Good choice on tone.</td>', 'Good choice on tone.', '2010-01-23 20:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827836, 848794, 105441, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, great selective DOF.  7</td>', 'Wonderful colors, great selective DOF.  7', '2010-01-23 20:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827838, 848863, 83313, '<td valign="top">A stereotype perhaps? Do wife beaters always wear these kind of undershirts? Regardless of that, it''s a very well done image. Looks like what the unfortunate victim is seeing.</td>', 'A stereotype perhaps? Do wife beaters always wear these kind of undershirts? Regardless of that, it''s a very well done image. Looks like what the unfortunate victim is seeing.', '2010-01-23 20:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827839, 848772, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice summer feel to this, but the shot is let down by the object (tree?) running down the left hand side. It has the double effect of distracting from the main subject, and making the shot appear askew. </td>', 'Nice summer feel to this, but the shot is let down by the object (tree?) running down the left hand side. It has the double effect of distracting from the main subject, and making the shot appear askew. ', '2010-01-23 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827840, 847742, 105441, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, the eyes with catchlight are great, the framing seems just right, and I like the inclusion of the hands, which makes this somewhat unique.  8</td>', 'Excellent portrait, the eyes with catchlight are great, the framing seems just right, and I like the inclusion of the hands, which makes this somewhat unique.  8', '2010-01-23 20:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827841, 847828, 48657, '<td valign="top">Nice find, not easy to find a great subject like this in such a wide open landscape. good crop.</td>', 'Nice find, not easy to find a great subject like this in such a wide open landscape. good crop.', '2010-01-23 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827842, 848759, 57447, '<td valign="top">Now I know how their web feet work.  Excellent entry.</td>', 'Now I know how their web feet work.  Excellent entry.', '2010-01-23 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827843, 847992, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking, though maybe a touch too heavy on the tonemapping for my preference.</td>', 'Very cool looking, though maybe a touch too heavy on the tonemapping for my preference.', '2010-01-23 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827844, 848379, 105441, '<td valign="top">Great macro, surprised by how so much of the fly is in focus, with the background so thoroughly blurred. The white shape in the center is distracting, though, and I would prefer more of the frame to be in front of the dragonfly. 7</td>', 'Great macro, surprised by how so much of the fly is in focus, with the background so thoroughly blurred. The white shape in the center is distracting, though, and I would prefer more of the frame to be in front of the dragonfly. 7', '2010-01-23 20:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827845, 848340, 57447, '<td valign="top">You have captured a well balanced beautiful landscape.</td>', 'You have captured a well balanced beautiful landscape.', '2010-01-23 20:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827847, 847109, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hiya, Wendy! I''m sure you are somewhere in the 6''s with this one.</td>', 'Hiya, Wendy! I''m sure you are somewhere in the 6''s with this one.', '2010-01-23 20:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827849, 847091, 105441, '<td valign="top">Very unusual shapes, looks like an alien''s head.</td>', 'Very unusual shapes, looks like an alien''s head.', '2010-01-23 20:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827850, 848728, 66494, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad I took the time to really take a good long look at this gem. It is gorgeous.</td>', 'I''m so glad I took the time to really take a good long look at this gem. It is gorgeous.', '2010-01-23 20:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827852, 848843, 105441, '<td valign="top">Small eats smaller.  Great capture, excellent focus.</td>', 'Small eats smaller.  Great capture, excellent focus.', '2010-01-23 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5827853, 848806, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic shot, but for me there just isn''t enough contrast in the foreground details. When I first opened it I instantly wanted to see more details in the wreck. <br/> <br/>It''s not that it''s too dark, as I think you''ve got the exposure just right, I think it''s that there''s not enough contrast in the details.</td>', 'Nice scenic shot, but for me there just isn''t enough contrast in the foreground details. When I first opened it I instantly wanted to see more details in the wreck.  It''s not that it''s too dark, as I think you''ve got the exposure just right, I think it''s that there''s not enough contrast in the details.', '2010-01-23 20:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
