(5828010, 847984, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on this portrait of a child. The looking back and upside down shot is very visually interesting to me. A different angle and something new to be enjoyed. And wow! just look at those gorgeous big eyes and lovely lashes. It is those eyes that really grab and hold my attention. Nice catchlights in the eyes as well. The B&amp;W tones are spectacular; the perfect range of dynamic tones. This is a unique, well composed, and well captured portrait.</td>', 'Nice twist on this portrait of a child. The looking back and upside down shot is very visually interesting to me. A different angle and something new to be enjoyed. And wow! just look at those gorgeous big eyes and lovely lashes. It is those eyes that really grab and hold my attention. Nice catchlights in the eyes as well. The B&W tones are spectacular; the perfect range of dynamic tones. This is a unique, well composed, and well captured portrait.', '2010-01-23 21:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828011, 847450, 68947, '<td valign="top">Eerie feel to see this standing alone, in the rain with a sole person, walking past it.  Lovely!</td>', 'Eerie feel to see this standing alone, in the rain with a sole person, walking past it.  Lovely!', '2010-01-23 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
