(5828018, 848826, 68947, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the light falls on the man in the foreground, highlighting him as the main subject.  It''s very dark and contrasted.  The one thing that it makes me ask myself is "what is it that the photographer wanted me to see in this...what is the reason?"  But, then again, with dozens of flowers and insect shots in this challenge, I''d likely say that I''m getting far more out of this shot than the eye candy shots :)</td>', 'I like the fact that the light falls on the man in the foreground, highlighting him as the main subject.  It''s very dark and contrasted.  The one thing that it makes me ask myself is "what is it that the photographer wanted me to see in this...what is the reason?"  But, then again, with dozens of flowers and insect shots in this challenge, I''d likely say that I''m getting far more out of this shot than the eye candy shots :)', '2010-01-23 21:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
