(5828078, 848915, 44877, '<td valign="top">Sooo darling. Love the composition. This is one of those cases where the big black frame really works. Great BW tones, too.</td>', 'Sooo darling. Love the composition. This is one of those cases where the big black frame really works. Great BW tones, too.', '2010-01-23 21:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828079, 848468, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is such a beautiful picture...I love how the fog is in this...and how the little bird is so very, very clear and deep in tone...just wonderful</td>', 'this is such a beautiful picture...I love how the fog is in this...and how the little bird is so very, very clear and deep in tone...just wonderful', '2010-01-23 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
