(5828082, 848826, 44877, '<td valign="top">Nice - street at its best. A sense of mystery with the fuzzy figure in the foreground. A sense of hope with the beautiful light shining on the buildings in the back. Outstanding contrast.</td>', 'Nice - street at its best. A sense of mystery with the fuzzy figure in the foreground. A sense of hope with the beautiful light shining on the buildings in the back. Outstanding contrast.', '2010-01-23 21:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828083, 848342, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great landscape shot, and I think you''ve taken it at the perfect time of day as well, with all the city lights visible but still not too dark that that''s all there is.<br/> <br/>The sky for me is also a really interesting part of the shot, and I think I would like it more if you had left a bit more sky along the top.</td>', 'Great landscape shot, and I think you''ve taken it at the perfect time of day as well, with all the city lights visible but still not too dark that that''s all there is. The sky for me is also a really interesting part of the shot, and I think I would like it more if you had left a bit more sky along the top.', '2010-01-23 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828084, 848927, 44877, '<td valign="top">Stunning - it is like a dream, indeed.</td>', 'Stunning - it is like a dream, indeed.', '2010-01-23 21:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
