(5828111, 848770, 98339, '<td valign="top">one of the very best webs that I''ve seen on here...the little beads are sooooo very detailed!!!</td>', 'one of the very best webs that I''ve seen on here...the little beads are sooooo very detailed!!!', '2010-01-23 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828112, 847420, 105441, '<td valign="top">I hope to read how this was done, but I have mixed feelings. The original composition is pretty amazing, with the four lanes of cars and taxis so perfectly lined up almost to infinity.  I''ve decided to vote high and give it an eight, because it has me so curious about the scene and the processing.</td>', 'I hope to read how this was done, but I have mixed feelings. The original composition is pretty amazing, with the four lanes of cars and taxis so perfectly lined up almost to infinity.  I''ve decided to vote high and give it an eight, because it has me so curious about the scene and the processing.', '2010-01-23 21:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828113, 847833, 68947, '<td valign="top">Another post card perfect shot and yet, a piece of art at the same time.  I love the color depth and the textures in this shot.  I hope that you''ll have it printed out and framed. :)</td>', 'Another post card perfect shot and yet, a piece of art at the same time.  I love the color depth and the textures in this shot.  I hope that you''ll have it printed out and framed. :)', '2010-01-23 21:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828114, 848545, 98339, '<td valign="top">such a soft delicate flower...beautiful...your lighting is really, really good</td>', 'such a soft delicate flower...beautiful...your lighting is really, really good', '2010-01-23 21:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828116, 848229, 105441, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this, I only wish the house was a larger element. 7</td>', 'I really like the feel of this, I only wish the house was a larger element. 7', '2010-01-23 21:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828117, 847196, 98339, '<td valign="top">oh, this is just plain to funny, what did you do to get him (little boy) to make such a face...excellent job on the composition</td>', 'oh, this is just plain to funny, what did you do to get him (little boy) to make such a face...excellent job on the composition', '2010-01-23 21:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828118, 848450, 68947, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel that water!  Honestly...this really emotes something from me because the way that you''ve captured this allows me to feel what this bird is feeling in some small way!  Nicely done!</td>', 'I can almost feel that water!  Honestly...this really emotes something from me because the way that you''ve captured this allows me to feel what this bird is feeling in some small way!  Nicely done!', '2010-01-23 21:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828119, 847576, 68947, '<td valign="top">Eerie and yet beautiful all that the same time! Brilliant!</td>', 'Eerie and yet beautiful all that the same time! Brilliant!', '2010-01-23 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828120, 847933, 48657, '<td valign="top">nicely done. Greens look great and nice shutter. I could easily spend a month in the gorge shooting.</td>', 'nicely done. Greens look great and nice shutter. I could easily spend a month in the gorge shooting.', '2010-01-23 21:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828121, 848586, 98339, '<td valign="top">excellent detail...your colors are so alive...not dull or flat...just wonderful</td>', 'excellent detail...your colors are so alive...not dull or flat...just wonderful', '2010-01-23 21:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828123, 847830, 68947, '<td valign="top">The both look so comfortable with one another.  I can feel the feeling of the breeze and the horse''s fur, all at the same time!  Wish I were there because your shot has made me want to be there! :)</td>', 'The both look so comfortable with one another.  I can feel the feeling of the breeze and the horse''s fur, all at the same time!  Wish I were there because your shot has made me want to be there! :)', '2010-01-23 21:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828126, 848819, 105441, '<td valign="top">Fabulous portrait. My only criticism is the florescent light directly over number 21''s head. 8</td>', 'Fabulous portrait. My only criticism is the florescent light directly over number 21''s head. 8', '2010-01-23 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828127, 847875, 98339, '<td valign="top">oh, to live near something like this....is the horizon tilted slightly?  And just FYI you seem to have something on your sensor...(up in the clouds).  Your lighting is well done</td>', 'oh, to live near something like this....is the horizon tilted slightly?  And just FYI you seem to have something on your sensor...(up in the clouds).  Your lighting is well done', '2010-01-23 21:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828128, 848478, 68947, '<td valign="top">What makes this shot priceless is that everything and everyone else in this shot is "stone faced"....lost in their own thoughts and business.  This little girl is the "bright spot" in the shot and shows us that we lose this ability to be happy at the simplest of things as we grow older. Love this shot for what it''s saying.</td>', 'What makes this shot priceless is that everything and everyone else in this shot is "stone faced"....lost in their own thoughts and business.  This little girl is the "bright spot" in the shot and shows us that we lose this ability to be happy at the simplest of things as we grow older. Love this shot for what it''s saying.', '2010-01-23 21:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828131, 848338, 105441, '<td valign="top">Great tree and colors.</td>', 'Great tree and colors.', '2010-01-23 21:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828132, 847365, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice details on the bug, and while I think the bright yellow background helps, the areas along the right that are darker do tend to draw my attention.</td>', 'Nice details on the bug, and while I think the bright yellow background helps, the areas along the right that are darker do tend to draw my attention.', '2010-01-23 21:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828133, 847984, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and perfect symmetry that works well in B&amp;W</td>', 'Beautiful model and perfect symmetry that works well in B&W', '2010-01-23 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828136, 847618, 68947, '<td valign="top">Majesty captured in a majestic fashion! :)</td>', 'Majesty captured in a majestic fashion! :)', '2010-01-23 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828137, 847080, 98339, '<td valign="top">for me this is just a little to pushed in the saturation/hue''s.  But it makes for a very different and unusual picture</td>', 'for me this is just a little to pushed in the saturation/hue''s.  But it makes for a very different and unusual picture', '2010-01-23 21:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828138, 848916, 44877, '<td valign="top">Soo pretty! Is this a pet fox? I mean, how do you get that kind of lighting on a fox? Amazing.</td>', 'Soo pretty! Is this a pet fox? I mean, how do you get that kind of lighting on a fox? Amazing.', '2010-01-23 21:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828139, 847837, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured this young mail lion in the action of prowling the savanna. The angle of the capture also adds interest for he is heading in the direction off to the far left. It makes me wonder what he sees; what is he about to do? The audience waits for the lion''s next action. A great above average shot (bumping to 7) but there is some room for improvement. Bring us closer to this big cat - show us more details of it''s wild beauty. As the composition stands now the top 1/3 of the composition does nothing to complement the scene. If there was a lone tree or animal herds in the distance then there would be some complementry elements to the scene, but there is not. Crop that out and reconfigure the crop so that it remains the same aspect ratio and size of this horizontal presentation. Keep some of the savanna evirons of the grasslands but make this big cat bigger and more up close &amp; personal. Do that and I think this composition will rocket up into the 9-10 category.</td>', 'I like how you captured this young mail lion in the action of prowling the savanna. The angle of the capture also adds interest for he is heading in the direction off to the far left. It makes me wonder what he sees; what is he about to do? The audience waits for the lion''s next action. A great above average shot (bumping to 7) but there is some room for improvement. Bring us closer to this big cat - show us more details of it''s wild beauty. As the composition stands now the top 1/3 of the composition does nothing to complement the scene. If there was a lone tree or animal herds in the distance then there would be some complementry elements to the scene, but there is not. Crop that out and reconfigure the crop so that it remains the same aspect ratio and size of this horizontal presentation. Keep some of the savanna evirons of the grasslands but make this big cat bigger and more up close & personal. Do that and I think this composition will rocket up into the 9-10 category.', '2010-01-23 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828140, 848788, 44877, '<td valign="top">Gotta love a good skull. Love the super slick water and the minimalist elements. Great colors.</td>', 'Gotta love a good skull. Love the super slick water and the minimalist elements. Great colors.', '2010-01-23 21:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828141, 847463, 68947, '<td valign="top">Her child''s beauty shows through but so does her grown beauty.  It''s amazing that I can see both in this one shot! But, then again....you were aiming for that, weren''t you?  You''ve done it! :)</td>', 'Her child''s beauty shows through but so does her grown beauty.  It''s amazing that I can see both in this one shot! But, then again....you were aiming for that, weren''t you?  You''ve done it! :)', '2010-01-23 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828142, 848474, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract balance of this...how the blacks fade for gray then to the lighter gray...I''m not sure what it is...but it''s a stunning picture</td>', 'I like the abstract balance of this...how the blacks fade for gray then to the lighter gray...I''m not sure what it is...but it''s a stunning picture', '2010-01-23 21:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828143, 848846, 98339, '<td valign="top">such brown, brown eyes...she will be a make-up artist''s dream come true</td>', 'such brown, brown eyes...she will be a make-up artist''s dream come true', '2010-01-23 21:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828144, 848598, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO this needs sharper focus...I like the grouping of the zebra''s</td>', 'IMO this needs sharper focus...I like the grouping of the zebra''s', '2010-01-23 21:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828146, 847806, 44877, '<td valign="top">Love this in BW. Also the crazy waves are juxtaposed to the calm birds in the foreground. It''s appears to be such an intimate moment, somehow.</td>', 'Love this in BW. Also the crazy waves are juxtaposed to the calm birds in the foreground. It''s appears to be such an intimate moment, somehow.', '2010-01-23 21:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828148, 847467, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great subject, I can see where you''re going with the B&amp;W to give the photo an old fashioned look (at least that''s my guess), but I don''t think this particular conversion does the subject justice. <br/> <br/>It seems to be lacking in contrast a little and the greys tend to blend together.</td>', 'Great subject, I can see where you''re going with the B&W to give the photo an old fashioned look (at least that''s my guess), but I don''t think this particular conversion does the subject justice.  It seems to be lacking in contrast a little and the greys tend to blend together.', '2010-01-23 21:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828149, 848008, 68947, '<td valign="top">Betel nuts as false teeth...really?  WOW!  I didn''t now that.  Besides giving me a lesson here LOL...the shot is really a great shot and even the crop off the side works well.</td>', 'Betel nuts as false teeth...really?  WOW!  I didn''t now that.  Besides giving me a lesson here LOL...the shot is really a great shot and even the crop off the side works well.', '2010-01-23 21:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828150, 848409, 44877, '<td valign="top">Nice - semi-abstract body parts. Love it for being different and well executed.</td>', 'Nice - semi-abstract body parts. Love it for being different and well executed.', '2010-01-23 21:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828152, 847469, 44877, '<td valign="top">What a kick. The guys eyes really make this - like he <i>knows</i> someone is watching him. Very nice capture.</td>', 'What a kick. The guys eyes really make this - like he knows someone is watching him. Very nice capture.', '2010-01-23 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828153, 848814, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure if I''d call it heaven, but it''s a nice landscape shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Not entirely sure if I''d call it heaven, but it''s a nice landscape shot nonetheless.', '2010-01-23 21:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828154, 847196, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  The sky was a challenge since there is some haloing around the officer left shoulder, but well done.</td>', 'Nice concept.  The sky was a challenge since there is some haloing around the officer left shoulder, but well done.', '2010-01-23 21:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828155, 847742, 68947, '<td valign="top">She is a beautiful model!  The sharpness of focus towards her eyes and face and the softness of focus everywhere else works extremely well!</td>', 'She is a beautiful model!  The sharpness of focus towards her eyes and face and the softness of focus everywhere else works extremely well!', '2010-01-23 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828156, 847313, 98339, '<td valign="top">I have decided that I''m a prude...I find these kind of pictures to be disturbing.  I have a hard time seeing the picture for the abuse that I see happening...I know it''s all pretend...I will say that your detail is very good..sorry to disappoint you</td>', 'I have decided that I''m a prude...I find these kind of pictures to be disturbing.  I have a hard time seeing the picture for the abuse that I see happening...I know it''s all pretend...I will say that your detail is very good..sorry to disappoint you', '2010-01-23 21:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828158, 848380, 44877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, straight on shot. Love the somewhat edgy processing. Excellent background.</td>', 'Beautiful, straight on shot. Love the somewhat edgy processing. Excellent background.', '2010-01-23 21:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828159, 847200, 101117, '<td valign="top">The little one camouflages nicely into the big one, I almost missed it on first look!<br/> <br/>Nice details, and I like the way the big one is watching the little one to make sure everything is ok.</td>', 'The little one camouflages nicely into the big one, I almost missed it on first look! Nice details, and I like the way the big one is watching the little one to make sure everything is ok.', '2010-01-23 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828161, 847620, 44877, '<td valign="top">Outstanding detail and beautiful colors.</td>', 'Outstanding detail and beautiful colors.', '2010-01-23 21:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828162, 848887, 98339, '<td valign="top">to me this has a bit of a green hue to it that doesn''t belong (feet), and your focus is just a little soft IMO</td>', 'to me this has a bit of a green hue to it that doesn''t belong (feet), and your focus is just a little soft IMO', '2010-01-23 21:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828163, 847379, 44877, '<td valign="top">I adore this image. The contrast on those stern lines is so incredibly good. Sweet touch with the black sky.</td>', 'I adore this image. The contrast on those stern lines is so incredibly good. Sweet touch with the black sky.', '2010-01-23 21:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828164, 848409, 105441, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, extreme high key photo. I like the creativity you have shown in what really is an uncommon view.  8</td>', 'Very interesting, extreme high key photo. I like the creativity you have shown in what really is an uncommon view.  8', '2010-01-23 21:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828165, 847842, 44877, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird! Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Pretty bird! Beautiful colors.', '2010-01-23 21:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828166, 847109, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the spread of the open wingspan of this bird! I see it and it just speaks the word ''soar'' to me; free to travel the winds. Colors are beautiful too. My only plaint is that the backdrop of the white environment seems very stark &amp; barren and that is at odds with the ''spread my wings to soar the wild blue yonder'' imagery I feel when I look at your main subject in full glory.</td>', 'Love the spread of the open wingspan of this bird! I see it and it just speaks the word ''soar'' to me; free to travel the winds. Colors are beautiful too. My only plaint is that the backdrop of the white environment seems very stark & barren and that is at odds with the ''spread my wings to soar the wild blue yonder'' imagery I feel when I look at your main subject in full glory.', '2010-01-23 21:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
