(5828443, 848863, 86218, '<td valign="top">This is artistic and the title carries this photo and explains allot. Without title one would wonder what the shot was about. For this in this context the photo really works to carry that idea but I would still like to see a bit more detail in mouth. Im no pro with this but these are my impressions. 6</td>', 'This is artistic and the title carries this photo and explains allot. Without title one would wonder what the shot was about. For this in this context the photo really works to carry that idea but I would still like to see a bit more detail in mouth. Im no pro with this but these are my impressions. 6', '2010-01-24 00:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828444, 848209, 86218, '<td valign="top">Looks liek a painting. Edges of the moon look not rounded enough but it works as a different shot of the moon an dpresented differently from what I ve ever seen</td>', 'Looks liek a painting. Edges of the moon look not rounded enough but it works as a different shot of the moon an dpresented differently from what I ve ever seen', '2010-01-24 00:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
