(5828501, 848901, 86218, '<td valign="top">Love this shot and background makes this stand out even more. Nice hand positioned into frame and mans hand/thumb connecting the two people. Very nice</td>', 'Love this shot and background makes this stand out even more. Nice hand positioned into frame and mans hand/thumb connecting the two people. Very nice', '2010-01-24 01:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828502, 848709, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very cute!!. Background at top of head bit distracting</td>', 'Very cute!!. Background at top of head bit distracting', '2010-01-24 01:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828518, 847535, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good timing with the fireworks.  You could have entered a much larger picture - 800 pixels on the long side - to provide a better view!</td>', 'Very good timing with the fireworks.  You could have entered a much larger picture - 800 pixels on the long side - to provide a better view!', '2010-01-24 01:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828519, 848500, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed at how poised and calm the horse looks compared to the somewhat terrified look of the rider.  A fascinating photo!</td>', 'I''m amazed at how poised and calm the horse looks compared to the somewhat terrified look of the rider.  A fascinating photo!', '2010-01-24 01:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828520, 848552, 30982, '<td valign="top">Even the fish are watching over him.  Sweet portrait!</td>', 'Even the fish are watching over him.  Sweet portrait!', '2010-01-24 01:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828533, 847308, 5822, '<td valign="top">Exquisite!</td>', 'Exquisite!', '2010-01-24 01:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828537, 848409, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish it were technically better, but I love the composition.</td>', 'I wish it were technically better, but I love the composition.', '2010-01-24 01:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828538, 847231, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this, very painterly, as well as, the tension created by the vertical composition.</td>', 'I like the processing on this, very painterly, as well as, the tension created by the vertical composition.', '2010-01-24 02:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828541, 848843, 5822, '<td valign="top">Your style is easily recognized here (a good thing). Another superb macro.</td>', 'Your style is easily recognized here (a good thing). Another superb macro.', '2010-01-24 02:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828544, 848885, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the three dimensional look and interesting subjects.</td>', 'I like the three dimensional look and interesting subjects.', '2010-01-24 02:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828545, 847847, 5822, '<td valign="top">The editing is too heavy and obvious, imo.</td>', 'The editing is too heavy and obvious, imo.', '2010-01-24 02:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828547, 847875, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the setting, but horizon is too centered and there''s too much sky. This pic would benefit with a more artistic editing.</td>', 'I like the setting, but horizon is too centered and there''s too much sky. This pic would benefit with a more artistic editing.', '2010-01-24 02:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828549, 848186, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even though the image is too cluttered, I like the compression effect of the architecture very much. I wish there were fewer gondolas, maybe just a few and I would have preferred more color contrast in the buildings and water.</td>', 'Even though the image is too cluttered, I like the compression effect of the architecture very much. I wish there were fewer gondolas, maybe just a few and I would have preferred more color contrast in the buildings and water.', '2010-01-24 02:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828555, 848856, 5822, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice high key shot, but I would have preferred a tighter crop and more environment showing. As it is, I found the pic a bit confusing as it appears there''s a sharply demarcated band of white/gray in the lower 1/4 (which doesn''t look good). It took me a while to figure out that''s a bath tub.</td>', 'It''s a nice high key shot, but I would have preferred a tighter crop and more environment showing. As it is, I found the pic a bit confusing as it appears there''s a sharply demarcated band of white/gray in the lower 1/4 (which doesn''t look good). It took me a while to figure out that''s a bath tub.', '2010-01-24 02:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
