(5828705, 847124, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting run down structure, you should revisit this place for the graffiti challenge.<br/> <br/>I like the photo and the way you''ve taken it, but I don''t think you''ve quite brought the details out enough. I think if you made the whole scene grimmer and darker this would be great.</td>', 'Interesting run down structure, you should revisit this place for the graffiti challenge. I like the photo and the way you''ve taken it, but I don''t think you''ve quite brought the details out enough. I think if you made the whole scene grimmer and darker this would be great.', '2010-01-24 07:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828709, 848851, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid for me this scene is just a chair and lots of objects that don''t hold a whole lot of interest.<br/> <br/>This is likely because I have no attachment to the objects in the scene, I''m sure this shot would have a lot more interest and relevance to those who know "Grandma".</td>', 'I''m afraid for me this scene is just a chair and lots of objects that don''t hold a whole lot of interest. This is likely because I have no attachment to the objects in the scene, I''m sure this shot would have a lot more interest and relevance to those who know "Grandma".', '2010-01-24 07:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828711, 848930, 101117, '<td valign="top">I thought it was an odd shot, then I saw the title and it just got odder!<br/> <br/>I''ve heard these things are great for practicing portraits, though your title makes me wonder what else it''s been used for!</td>', 'I thought it was an odd shot, then I saw the title and it just got odder! I''ve heard these things are great for practicing portraits, though your title makes me wonder what else it''s been used for!', '2010-01-24 07:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828712, 848454, 101117, '<td valign="top">And there was me thinking people used long lenses as well, now I understand how you all get those bird close up shots! :)<br/> <br/>It''s a fun capture, well timed, not sure how much converting to B&amp;W has done for it though.</td>', 'And there was me thinking people used long lenses as well, now I understand how you all get those bird close up shots! :) It''s a fun capture, well timed, not sure how much converting to B&W has done for it though.', '2010-01-24 07:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828714, 847358, 101117, '<td valign="top">I always find half the beauty in these shots the details in the feathers etc, but the B&amp;W conversion you''ve done seems to have lost a lot of that.<br/> <br/>This version is quite interesting, especially the strong head area against a largely black background, but I''m not sure if it makes up for the loss of the other attributes.</td>', 'I always find half the beauty in these shots the details in the feathers etc, but the B&W conversion you''ve done seems to have lost a lot of that. This version is quite interesting, especially the strong head area against a largely black background, but I''m not sure if it makes up for the loss of the other attributes.', '2010-01-24 07:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828715, 847562, 101117, '<td valign="top">I have visions of you standing dangerously on some rock on the edge of the water to take this, probably because I''ve done that in the past too.<br/> <br/>This is a nice shot, though it''s a shame you''ve cut the tops of the far trees off, it would have been good to see those and what''s behind.</td>', 'I have visions of you standing dangerously on some rock on the edge of the water to take this, probably because I''ve done that in the past too. This is a nice shot, though it''s a shame you''ve cut the tops of the far trees off, it would have been good to see those and what''s behind.', '2010-01-24 07:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828719, 848347, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the processing.<br/> <br/>It''s funny how it seems to start off in good condition on the top left and then decay more as you go to the bottom right. There''s almost two worlds here, a look into the old world where this building was in it''s prime and then the modern run down look, yet they both seem to co-exist at the same time as you look at it.</td>', 'Nice shot, love the processing. It''s funny how it seems to start off in good condition on the top left and then decay more as you go to the bottom right. There''s almost two worlds here, a look into the old world where this building was in it''s prime and then the modern run down look, yet they both seem to co-exist at the same time as you look at it.', '2010-01-24 07:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828720, 847906, 101117, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to even tell it''s a lake, it just looks like a snow covered road!<br/> <br/>For me the closest tree blocks a lot of the shot. I suspect there''s a tree line there and it would be nice to see them lead into the shot rather than be blocked off at the start. The ice and the path with both lead into the shot also seem to vanish behind the tree, again making it feel like it''s just in the way.</td>', 'It''s hard to even tell it''s a lake, it just looks like a snow covered road! For me the closest tree blocks a lot of the shot. I suspect there''s a tree line there and it would be nice to see them lead into the shot rather than be blocked off at the start. The ice and the path with both lead into the shot also seem to vanish behind the tree, again making it feel like it''s just in the way.', '2010-01-24 07:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828722, 848457, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like shots of run down buildings and this one has a lot going for it. The sky, the long colourful grass, the details on the structure itself.<br/> <br/>The downside of this for me is the composition. I think it needs a bit more space, some context to set the building in, some more of the surroundings perhaps.</td>', 'I like shots of run down buildings and this one has a lot going for it. The sky, the long colourful grass, the details on the structure itself. The downside of this for me is the composition. I think it needs a bit more space, some context to set the building in, some more of the surroundings perhaps.', '2010-01-24 07:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
