(5828860, 848929, 32011, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW!...  Wonderful night time B&amp;W image... love the long exposure, love the contrast, love the composition... love it, love it, love it!!!</td>', 'Oh WOW!...  Wonderful night time B&W image... love the long exposure, love the contrast, love the composition... love it, love it, love it!!!', '2010-01-24 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828862, 848022, 32011, '<td valign="top">A wonderful memory... a wonderful photo.  Composition is excellent.  Love it. <br/> <br/> <br/><i>Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97166" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">K10DGuy</a>''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #9 in the series</i> <br/> <br/>----------<br/>... and one expectant mother was non the wiser of what was about to happen, which would effect her directly and impact the entire world.</td>', 'A wonderful memory... a wonderful photo.  Composition is excellent.  Love it.   Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like  K10DGuy''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #9 in the series  ----------... and one expectant mother was non the wiser of what was about to happen, which would effect her directly and impact the entire world.', '2010-01-24 09:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5828863, 847116, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colour.  Might have gone with a tighter crop on this myself, perhaps to get away from the centred composition.  Love the eyes... they really pop out.<br/> <br/><i>Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97166" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">K10DGuy</a>''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #10 in the series</i> <br/> <br/>----------<br/>The animal kingdom on the other hand were eagerly waiting for this event, and had been waiting for some time.</td>', 'Great detail and colour.  Might have gone with a tighter crop on this myself, perhaps to get away from the centred composition.  Love the eyes... they really pop out. Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like  K10DGuy''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #10 in the series  ----------The animal kingdom on the other hand were eagerly waiting for this event, and had been waiting for some time.', '2010-01-24 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1)