(5829102, 848856, 43463, '<td valign="top">I think that this is an excellent high key portrait of this baby. B&amp;W tones are spot on fabulous. Focus and detail are wonderful with lots of highlights caught in the hair and some really nice catchlights in those big, beautiful eyes. I also like that this portrait shows a little more personality than just a straight look at the camera or smile at the camera. That tongue sticking out with the slight glance just off to the side definately is an interesting expression that draws our eyes to this child. I wonder just what s(he) is concentrating on?</td>', 'I think that this is an excellent high key portrait of this baby. B&W tones are spot on fabulous. Focus and detail are wonderful with lots of highlights caught in the hair and some really nice catchlights in those big, beautiful eyes. I also like that this portrait shows a little more personality than just a straight look at the camera or smile at the camera. That tongue sticking out with the slight glance just off to the side definately is an interesting expression that draws our eyes to this child. I wonder just what s(he) is concentrating on?', '2010-01-24 11:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829105, 848682, 48657, '<td valign="top">Humorous, the old gentleman must have the stick because he is blind. Technicality the image is great, but I feel there are too many elements in it. The beautiful model with the rusty doorway would have been enough.</td>', 'Humorous, the old gentleman must have the stick because he is blind. Technicality the image is great, but I feel there are too many elements in it. The beautiful model with the rusty doorway would have been enough.', '2010-01-24 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
