(5829111, 847087, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the panoramic presentation for it gives the photo a wide sweeping cinematic feel which fits really well to give us this grandscale view of the landscape. The city beneath the rolling cloud-cover looks so tiny and Lilliputian in the shadow of the awe-inspiring giant of a mountain. Colors are visually stunning - but I think just a touch too much. Don''t get me wrong I love the color but I think you pushed it just a tad too much because the reds and yellows are fiery and in the far left just off to the side of the mountain is a blown highlight spot surrounded by a halo of deep violet reds that looks unnatural. Still this is an exceptional and stunning shot - 9</td>', 'Love the panoramic presentation for it gives the photo a wide sweeping cinematic feel which fits really well to give us this grandscale view of the landscape. The city beneath the rolling cloud-cover looks so tiny and Lilliputian in the shadow of the awe-inspiring giant of a mountain. Colors are visually stunning - but I think just a touch too much. Don''t get me wrong I love the color but I think you pushed it just a tad too much because the reds and yellows are fiery and in the far left just off to the side of the mountain is a blown highlight spot surrounded by a halo of deep violet reds that looks unnatural. Still this is an exceptional and stunning shot - 9', '2010-01-24 11:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
