(5829488, 848831, 43463, '<td valign="top"><i>Ima gonna run you over, grab that ball from your hands and take my team into the playoffs. </i> <br/> <br/>This is what I perceive this young football player is saying - the determined pursing of his lips and the stare down issuing from his eyes. Details are in razor sharp focus with this portrait. The B&amp;W tones are excellent. The only critique I have is that I wish that I could have seen the reflected expression of his opponent in his eyes. The staredown and the response of that staredown visible in the eyes of this football player.</td>', 'Ima gonna run you over, grab that ball from your hands and take my team into the playoffs.   This is what I perceive this young football player is saying - the determined pursing of his lips and the stare down issuing from his eyes. Details are in razor sharp focus with this portrait. The B&W tones are excellent. The only critique I have is that I wish that I could have seen the reflected expression of his opponent in his eyes. The staredown and the response of that staredown visible in the eyes of this football player.', '2010-01-24 14:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
