(5829579, 848105, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice cool blue hues; it really enforces in me a the sense of frigid chill that is in the air. I cannot tell what those elegant white birds are; geese or perhaps swans. I like the capture but wish we could get closer to the action. Bring us closer to the action; have us get up close and personal. Your audience can then also appreciate more details of your main subject - the birds taking flight. This is a above average shot but if you bring us closer to your subject it would move into the spectacular category.</td>', 'Nice cool blue hues; it really enforces in me a the sense of frigid chill that is in the air. I cannot tell what those elegant white birds are; geese or perhaps swans. I like the capture but wish we could get closer to the action. Bring us closer to the action; have us get up close and personal. Your audience can then also appreciate more details of your main subject - the birds taking flight. This is a above average shot but if you bring us closer to your subject it would move into the spectacular category.', '2010-01-24 15:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829581, 848474, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but it''s sure different. Not bad different but different.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but it''s sure different. Not bad different but different.', '2010-01-24 15:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
