(5829620, 848648, 60036, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction was too soft, but it made me look again, the mixture of the subject and colour treatment gives it an ethereal and almost ghostlike feel, went from a 4 to an 8. Nice job.</td>', 'My initial reaction was too soft, but it made me look again, the mixture of the subject and colour treatment gives it an ethereal and almost ghostlike feel, went from a 4 to an 8. Nice job.', '2010-01-24 15:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829638, 848808, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and colours through the image.  A great angle used to give the image plenty of interest</td>', 'Interesting lines and colours through the image.  A great angle used to give the image plenty of interest', '2010-01-24 16:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829639, 848415, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the angled border, but it does make it stand out from the rest of the images.  The little bot of a door fram or something to the right is an unnecessary distraction.  Lighting though of the image is great</td>', 'Not sure about the angled border, but it does make it stand out from the rest of the images.  The little bot of a door fram or something to the right is an unnecessary distraction.  Lighting though of the image is great', '2010-01-24 16:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829641, 848132, 96881, '<td valign="top">The image is very great, due to the rocks and bear..........The background looks to be artificially blurred creating some weird parts to it that do draw attention as a result.</td>', 'The image is very great, due to the rocks and bear..........The background looks to be artificially blurred creating some weird parts to it that do draw attention as a result.', '2010-01-24 16:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829642, 848828, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great capture of a bird in flight.  great colours in the water as well.  The bird does seem a little constrained by the tight crop.  You could have used some extra space in front of it so it had room to ''fly'' into</td>', 'A great capture of a bird in flight.  great colours in the water as well.  The bird does seem a little constrained by the tight crop.  You could have used some extra space in front of it so it had room to ''fly'' into', '2010-01-24 16:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829646, 847984, 96881, '<td valign="top">The angle of the image and the shallow depth of field causing the face to progressively soften does not appeal to me.</td>', 'The angle of the image and the shallow depth of field causing the face to progressively soften does not appeal to me.', '2010-01-24 16:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829647, 848367, 96881, '<td valign="top">The fence in the top right of the image I feel detracts from the field of flowers that you have chosen.  A little of time organising them would have helped, especially the very front flower with the turned up petals could have been moved slightly to improve the composition</td>', 'The fence in the top right of the image I feel detracts from the field of flowers that you have chosen.  A little of time organising them would have helped, especially the very front flower with the turned up petals could have been moved slightly to improve the composition', '2010-01-24 16:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829650, 848018, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure the bright sun reflection on the upper part of the bridge helps the image.  It seems to have been taken mid day due to the dark shaddows that exist that also dont help you.  The crop is also very close to the bottom of the front tower.</td>', 'Not sure the bright sun reflection on the upper part of the bridge helps the image.  It seems to have been taken mid day due to the dark shaddows that exist that also dont help you.  The crop is also very close to the bottom of the front tower.', '2010-01-24 16:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829652, 848738, 96881, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the heavy black border suits the image.  Something more subtle would have worked a lot better.  The symmetry of the image works really well and your exposure to balance the whites is very good</td>', 'I don''t think the heavy black border suits the image.  Something more subtle would have worked a lot better.  The symmetry of the image works really well and your exposure to balance the whites is very good', '2010-01-24 16:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829653, 847934, 96881, '<td valign="top">I not you are using the ''old'' size of 640px instead of 800px.  With an image that has as many elements as this, those extra pixels could have helped you.  There is a lot going on here, and lots of elements, like the blue slides, that are partially hiden, making for a very busy image</td>', 'I not you are using the ''old'' size of 640px instead of 800px.  With an image that has as many elements as this, those extra pixels could have helped you.  There is a lot going on here, and lots of elements, like the blue slides, that are partially hiden, making for a very busy image', '2010-01-24 16:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829684, 847463, 63918, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title and shot!</td>', 'Wonderful title and shot!', '2010-01-24 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829686, 847907, 51747, '<td valign="top">This could use a much bigger DOF to make more of the image sharp.</td>', 'This could use a much bigger DOF to make more of the image sharp.', '2010-01-24 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829694, 848035, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It looks a little weird to have only one wing visible due to circumstances beyond your control.</td>', 'Nice capture. It looks a little weird to have only one wing visible due to circumstances beyond your control.', '2010-01-24 16:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829699, 847104, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to see if this will motivate me to see beyond the ordinary. :P Seriously, I think this is much better than the one you entered before. The position of the yellow in the background was better in the other photo but overall it was too sharp, IMO. This one has a much more delicate feel to it, which compliments the subject.</td>', 'I''m trying to see if this will motivate me to see beyond the ordinary. :P Seriously, I think this is much better than the one you entered before. The position of the yellow in the background was better in the other photo but overall it was too sharp, IMO. This one has a much more delicate feel to it, which compliments the subject.', '2010-01-24 16:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829705, 848239, 96881, '<td valign="top">The colours in this image seem to be very underdone.  A humourous image, but in this field, the technical deficiencies cant be made up by humour.......</td>', 'The colours in this image seem to be very underdone.  A humourous image, but in this field, the technical deficiencies cant be made up by humour.......', '2010-01-24 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829708, 848709, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait showing personality.  the crop of the hands and whatever she is holding though is awkward.......The crop needed to either include the hands or crop them out completely.  Lighting though is very good on this, and the depth of field is great to provide a really good background</td>', 'A nice portrait showing personality.  the crop of the hands and whatever she is holding though is awkward.......The crop needed to either include the hands or crop them out completely.  Lighting though is very good on this, and the depth of field is great to provide a really good background', '2010-01-24 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829712, 848533, 96881, '<td valign="top">The depth of field in this image is an issue.   The frog and branch both needed to be sharp.  The bent branch, if sharp, could have provided a really interesting element as well</td>', 'The depth of field in this image is an issue.   The frog and branch both needed to be sharp.  The bent branch, if sharp, could have provided a really interesting element as well', '2010-01-24 16:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829727, 848830, 28427, '<td valign="top">The aurora borealis speaks to the imagination of a lot of people, myself included.  Thank you for having shared this amazing phenomenon with us. You are one lucky girl/guy.</td>', 'The aurora borealis speaks to the imagination of a lot of people, myself included.  Thank you for having shared this amazing phenomenon with us. You are one lucky girl/guy.', '2010-01-24 17:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829728, 847903, 28427, '<td valign="top">Subtle, tasteful, beautiful.</td>', 'Subtle, tasteful, beautiful.', '2010-01-24 17:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5829732, 848722, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very effective photo in giving the viewer a feeling of cold, and gloomy weather. While it isnt the typical eye candy of DPC, this is still a very good photo.</td>', 'Very effective photo in giving the viewer a feeling of cold, and gloomy weather. While it isnt the typical eye candy of DPC, this is still a very good photo.', '2010-01-24 17:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
