(5829736, 848247, 75618, '<td valign="top">Really great shot! I would have cloned out the cord sticking from her back, it''s slightly distracting. 9</td>', 'Really great shot! I would have cloned out the cord sticking from her back, it''s slightly distracting. 9', '2010-01-24 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
