(5829776, 848347, 100393, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a> image.<br/> <br/>If I''m honest, this image feels a little flat to me - I love the colours and textures but the overall lighting and edit robs the image of depth - perhaps that was intentional but I''m not sure it is working for me.</td>', 'This reminds me of a  clive_patric_nolan image. If I''m honest, this image feels a little flat to me - I love the colours and textures but the overall lighting and edit robs the image of depth - perhaps that was intentional but I''m not sure it is working for me.', '2010-01-24 17:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
