(5830064, 848478, 101117, '<td valign="top">Straight off the mark because the small girl grabs your attention, I didn''t see much else. After looking around for a bit I suddenly came across the guy in the black, holding what I''m guessing is some sort of electronic device, who for some reason despite looking really out of place, escaped my attention for the longest time! Just when I thought I had taken in everything, I spot all the psychic and tarot signs! <br/> <br/>There''s so much to take in on this shot, which is funny because at first glance there doesn''t seem to be that much to look at at all!</td>', 'Straight off the mark because the small girl grabs your attention, I didn''t see much else. After looking around for a bit I suddenly came across the guy in the black, holding what I''m guessing is some sort of electronic device, who for some reason despite looking really out of place, escaped my attention for the longest time! Just when I thought I had taken in everything, I spot all the psychic and tarot signs!  There''s so much to take in on this shot, which is funny because at first glance there doesn''t seem to be that much to look at at all!', '2010-01-24 19:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830065, 848326, 327, '<td valign="top">You title says it! Beautiful church. You did a good job putting the viewer in the image.</td>', 'You title says it! Beautiful church. You did a good job putting the viewer in the image.', '2010-01-24 19:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
