(5830086, 848843, 101117, '<td valign="top">I remember marveling at the other version of this shot when I saw it. This one is another stunning capture.<br/> <br/>I always marvel at the details you capture in these and your backgrounds are always really nice, which I think is what lifts yours above all the other bug macros.</td>', 'I remember marveling at the other version of this shot when I saw it. This one is another stunning capture. I always marvel at the details you capture in these and your backgrounds are always really nice, which I think is what lifts yours above all the other bug macros.', '2010-01-24 19:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
