(5830170, 847828, 101117, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot here I like, and only a couple that I don''t. It''s a great subject against a really interesting landscape and I think the B&amp;W processing is great.<br/> <br/>The things I don''t like so much are the positioning of the structure, it''s not really centered but it''s not really far enough out of centre to make space for the landscape, it''s just kind of there. The other is the details in the building are just a little dark and hard to see against all the bright details around it like the sky and grass.<br/> <br/>Overall, a nice interesting image which is well processed.</td>', 'There''s a lot here I like, and only a couple that I don''t. It''s a great subject against a really interesting landscape and I think the B&W processing is great. The things I don''t like so much are the positioning of the structure, it''s not really centered but it''s not really far enough out of centre to make space for the landscape, it''s just kind of there. The other is the details in the building are just a little dark and hard to see against all the bright details around it like the sky and grass. Overall, a nice interesting image which is well processed.', '2010-01-24 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
