(5830342, 848861, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think the mating season is going on down here right now...I need to find out as they are quite interesting to capture when they are in the mating ritual...for me this is just a touch dark in the exposure...you''ve lost some vital detail IMO (I''m talking more about the leaves rather than the feathers...those are super detailed...good job)</td>', 'I think the mating season is going on down here right now...I need to find out as they are quite interesting to capture when they are in the mating ritual...for me this is just a touch dark in the exposure...you''ve lost some vital detail IMO (I''m talking more about the leaves rather than the feathers...those are super detailed...good job)', '2010-01-24 20:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
