(5830410, 848721, 112828, '<td valign="top">Did your research as well huh?  Excellent shot, and good title too!  I really like that you managed to get into a position that allowed for the dragonfly to be nearly perfectly in the plane of focus.  Well done - and thank you for not over saturating this, it''s really much better for that.  ---  Background looks really good here too, the variations of green brown and black are very interesting and add to the image in a significant way.</td>', 'Did your research as well huh?  Excellent shot, and good title too!  I really like that you managed to get into a position that allowed for the dragonfly to be nearly perfectly in the plane of focus.  Well done - and thank you for not over saturating this, it''s really much better for that.  ---  Background looks really good here too, the variations of green brown and black are very interesting and add to the image in a significant way.', '2010-01-24 20:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
