(5830435, 847469, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hmm,  that''s a nice art shot.  It really made me want to look at it for a while to just see everything that''s going on here.</td>', 'Hmm,  that''s a nice art shot.  It really made me want to look at it for a while to just see everything that''s going on here.', '2010-01-24 21:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830437, 848812, 63398, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done portrait of this gorgeous child......7</td>', 'Beautifully done portrait of this gorgeous child......7', '2010-01-24 21:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830438, 847530, 42100, '<td valign="top">The shallow DoF really does some interesting things with the structure of the wings...great tones as well!</td>', 'The shallow DoF really does some interesting things with the structure of the wings...great tones as well!', '2010-01-24 21:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830440, 848899, 63398, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean, and wonderful......8</td>', 'Crisp, clean, and wonderful......8', '2010-01-24 21:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830443, 847730, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice tones, but is more of a beach snapshot than a well thought out image...perhaps putting the camera on a tripod and setting a slower shutter speed would have given the water some movement...also, the scene needs a real focal point and there really isn''t one 5</td>', 'nice tones, but is more of a beach snapshot than a well thought out image...perhaps putting the camera on a tripod and setting a slower shutter speed would have given the water some movement...also, the scene needs a real focal point and there really isn''t one 5', '2010-01-24 21:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830444, 848851, 98339, '<td valign="top">you must be tall...because this has a very tilted feel to the picture...nice detail in the set up...</td>', 'you must be tall...because this has a very tilted feel to the picture...nice detail in the set up...', '2010-01-24 21:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830450, 848684, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene, the heavy border is a negative here for me, I would have preferred a much lighter border (although the color choice and sequence is great).  As for the image, the shot is wonderful, glassy water with great foliage, and even a (rail?) bridge to add interest.  It feels a little too sharp, but DPC loves that don''t they? Well done.</td>', 'Very cool scene, the heavy border is a negative here for me, I would have preferred a much lighter border (although the color choice and sequence is great).  As for the image, the shot is wonderful, glassy water with great foliage, and even a (rail?) bridge to add interest.  It feels a little too sharp, but DPC loves that don''t they? Well done.', '2010-01-24 21:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830451, 847837, 42100, '<td valign="top">This has to be in his natural environment...that would be such a cool thing to see.  Nicely done photo!</td>', 'This has to be in his natural environment...that would be such a cool thing to see.  Nicely done photo!', '2010-01-24 21:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830452, 847026, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow! you really get to do some great imagery! love your work! great use of lens, great drama...8</td>', 'wow! you really get to do some great imagery! love your work! great use of lens, great drama...8', '2010-01-24 21:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830454, 847038, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely overall, but the composition feels a little cramed...would have been great to get some better detail in the foreground 6</td>', 'lovely overall, but the composition feels a little cramed...would have been great to get some better detail in the foreground 6', '2010-01-24 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830455, 847090, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow...great contrast and a powerful b and w 8</td>', 'wow...great contrast and a powerful b and w 8', '2010-01-24 21:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830456, 848081, 112828, '<td valign="top">Neat image, very stark, and the ring flash (it is a ring flash isn''t it??) looks really cool reflected in her retinas.  There is a grungy harsh look here that breaks all the usual rules about photographing women, and I think it works well.  Nice image.</td>', 'Neat image, very stark, and the ring flash (it is a ring flash isn''t it??) looks really cool reflected in her retinas.  There is a grungy harsh look here that breaks all the usual rules about photographing women, and I think it works well.  Nice image.', '2010-01-24 21:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830459, 848186, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the processing. It has a dramatic feel to it.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the processing. It has a dramatic feel to it.', '2010-01-24 21:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830460, 848759, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice tones and detail 7</td>', 'nice tones and detail 7', '2010-01-24 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830461, 848340, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow! majestic, dramatic, eye candy! lots to see...9</td>', 'wow! majestic, dramatic, eye candy! lots to see...9', '2010-01-24 21:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
