(5830464, 848516, 34938, '<td valign="top">love the scene, but the foreground looks a little processed...7</td>', 'love the scene, but the foreground looks a little processed...7', '2010-01-24 21:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830466, 848646, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow...great colours and an interesting place</td>', 'wow...great colours and an interesting place', '2010-01-24 21:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830467, 848338, 112828, '<td valign="top">Good processing on this, although the edging on the portions is a bit hard, and the HDR would have been better just a little more muted here. (although, granted that is only my opinion, and this is, no doubt, eye candy..)..  With that being said, my "gut" reaction to the photo was very much a positive reaction.</td>', 'Good processing on this, although the edging on the portions is a bit hard, and the HDR would have been better just a little more muted here. (although, granted that is only my opinion, and this is, no doubt, eye candy..)..  With that being said, my "gut" reaction to the photo was very much a positive reaction.', '2010-01-24 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830468, 847914, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like deep and rich tones...and this is just loaded with them.  Really great comp and DoF to really capture the great subject matter!</td>', 'I like deep and rich tones...and this is just loaded with them.  Really great comp and DoF to really capture the great subject matter!', '2010-01-24 21:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830470, 847745, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like that the person give this perspective...without the person, this image would be very bland...7</td>', 'I like that the person give this perspective...without the person, this image would be very bland...7', '2010-01-24 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830471, 848848, 34938, '<td valign="top">good detail but an obvious zoo image that lacks the wow factor</td>', 'good detail but an obvious zoo image that lacks the wow factor', '2010-01-24 21:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830473, 848644, 43463, '<td valign="top"><i>It''s Mine, MINE I tell you! I have MY paws ALL over it!</i> <br/> <br/>I can''t help but see that as what this tiger is saying to whomever it is looking at off screen. This shot has excellent color and clarity. Look at all the details! I could almost feel the softness of the fur (that is if I dared to touch this tiger;-) Don''t come between a tiger and their toys ;-p) Great pose; this tiger looks very possessive of it''s toy. It also seems that the tiger was enjoying his/her play before being distracted by an intruder.</td>', 'It''s Mine, MINE I tell you! I have MY paws ALL over it!  I can''t help but see that as what this tiger is saying to whomever it is looking at off screen. This shot has excellent color and clarity. Look at all the details! I could almost feel the softness of the fur (that is if I dared to touch this tiger;-) Don''t come between a tiger and their toys ;-p) Great pose; this tiger looks very possessive of it''s toy. It also seems that the tiger was enjoying his/her play before being distracted by an intruder.', '2010-01-24 21:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830475, 847854, 7743, '<td valign="top">Love the layered affect here.</td>', 'Love the layered affect here.', '2010-01-24 21:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830476, 848357, 34938, '<td valign="top">good point of view, but looks more like a holiday snapshot than a well thought out image...the scene has much more potential</td>', 'good point of view, but looks more like a holiday snapshot than a well thought out image...the scene has much more potential', '2010-01-24 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830477, 848561, 34938, '<td valign="top">cute scene...light is good...it looks quite contrived though</td>', 'cute scene...light is good...it looks quite contrived though', '2010-01-24 21:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830480, 847734, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not bad, although for a best of, this doesn''t really seem a likely choice... Is there a story here I''m missing out on?  Overall a fairly good image technically, it just seems to lack real impact and there''s a bit of distraction with all the branches and such.  She does have a wonderful look on her face though.</td>', 'Not bad, although for a best of, this doesn''t really seem a likely choice... Is there a story here I''m missing out on?  Overall a fairly good image technically, it just seems to lack real impact and there''s a bit of distraction with all the branches and such.  She does have a wonderful look on her face though.', '2010-01-24 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830481, 847907, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the DOF.</td>', 'I like the colors and the DOF.', '2010-01-24 21:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830482, 848454, 34938, '<td valign="top">great catch, but not what I would see as the photo of 2009...a nice one for the album though :) 5</td>', 'great catch, but not what I would see as the photo of 2009...a nice one for the album though :) 5', '2010-01-24 21:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830483, 848933, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice scene...nice sky</td>', 'nice scene...nice sky', '2010-01-24 21:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830485, 848059, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the hard light. Gives it that dramatic look. Nice job.</td>', 'I like the hard light. Gives it that dramatic look. Nice job.', '2010-01-24 21:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830486, 847828, 112828, '<td valign="top">I think this might be one of those love/hate images.  I think it''s pretty cool visually, but the processing does look a bit heavy handed.</td>', 'I think this might be one of those love/hate images.  I think it''s pretty cool visually, but the processing does look a bit heavy handed.', '2010-01-24 21:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830487, 848911, 42100, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up...not the photo itself...when I saw the thumbnail, I thought I was in for a real train wreck.  But when I opened this I was blown away.  Now I wonder what I thought I saw on the thumbnail the first time.  Very well done!</td>', 'This cracks me up...not the photo itself...when I saw the thumbnail, I thought I was in for a real train wreck.  But when I opened this I was blown away.  Now I wonder what I thought I saw on the thumbnail the first time.  Very well done!', '2010-01-24 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830488, 848005, 34938, '<td valign="top">a holiday snapshot really...the people in the image with their luggage are a distraction...not the kind of image that would win a ribbon for photo of the year, but a nice snap for your photo album</td>', 'a holiday snapshot really...the people in the image with their luggage are a distraction...not the kind of image that would win a ribbon for photo of the year, but a nice snap for your photo album', '2010-01-24 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
