(5830495, 848519, 34938, '<td valign="top">what lets this majestic scene down is the actual pose of the person...it''s great having her in there as it adds perspective, but she looks like she is saying ''please don''t take my photo''... 6</td>', 'what lets this majestic scene down is the actual pose of the person...it''s great having her in there as it adds perspective, but she looks like she is saying ''please don''t take my photo''... 6', '2010-01-24 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
