(5830499, 847116, 112828, '<td valign="top">Eyecandy alert!  :)  Neat looking image, although it does have that "topazed" look to the fur and grass- Not that I dislike the effect, just looks processed a bit heavy for me (I think this might largely be due to the somewhat obvious noise suppression on the rear leg, making it look way too smooth.).<br/> <br/>Still like this image very much.</td>', 'Eyecandy alert!  :)  Neat looking image, although it does have that "topazed" look to the fur and grass- Not that I dislike the effect, just looks processed a bit heavy for me (I think this might largely be due to the somewhat obvious noise suppression on the rear leg, making it look way too smooth.). Still like this image very much.', '2010-01-24 21:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
