(5830504, 848766, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great placement of the deer.  I like how three are looking in your general direction and one is looking off to the side.</td>', 'Great placement of the deer.  I like how three are looking in your general direction and one is looking off to the side.', '2010-01-24 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
