(5830597, 848500, 43463, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the captured facial expression of the cowboy riding this bucking horse! <i>"Whoa, oh, man this was a BAD idea!"</i> is what I hear in my head as I look at this shot. This is also a great action shot of this rodeo event. Love how the horse is caught in midair - it almost has this ballerina like pose (when the hold their feet pointed tightly together when the do a leap in the air)! Focus, color, composition and clarity are spot on!</td>', 'I absolutely love the captured facial expression of the cowboy riding this bucking horse! "Whoa, oh, man this was a BAD idea!" is what I hear in my head as I look at this shot. This is also a great action shot of this rodeo event. Love how the horse is caught in midair - it almost has this ballerina like pose (when the hold their feet pointed tightly together when the do a leap in the air)! Focus, color, composition and clarity are spot on!', '2010-01-24 21:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
