(5830784, 848792, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, definitely tells a story, with action too!  I would have preferred her to the left against the block I think (more contrast...)  But still very well done.</td>', 'Wonderful image, definitely tells a story, with action too!  I would have preferred her to the left against the block I think (more contrast...)  But still very well done.', '2010-01-24 23:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830786, 848247, 42100, '<td valign="top">The ticklish reeds of grass completely add to feeling of free spirited-ness of the leaping girl.  It''s that very grass that makes this more than another silhouette photograph.  Very nice!</td>', 'The ticklish reeds of grass completely add to feeling of free spirited-ness of the leaping girl.  It''s that very grass that makes this more than another silhouette photograph.  Very nice!', '2010-01-24 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830788, 848733, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very sad kid...  Seems odd, but this doesn''t really impact me like I think it would, not sure why, but just didn''t really impact me.  Still a solid 6 from me.</td>', 'Very sad kid...  Seems odd, but this doesn''t really impact me like I think it would, not sure why, but just didn''t really impact me.  Still a solid 6 from me.', '2010-01-24 23:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830801, 848931, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a beautiful image, the subject and composition are really superb.  Now, let me explain why this is getting a 5 instead of an 8 from me (I hope you will understand) - The image appears oversharpenend- primarily the white and black parallel lines inside the flower, there is a blocky/noisy look to them that is just a shame, and the lower petal where it meets the water has the same blocky look.  Also, the frame is way too heavy, I like the yellow and black, but much lighter weight would have added elegance, this however really just doesn''t do anything for the photograph..<br/> <br/>Still, very nice image overall, different PP would have made a big difference.</td>', 'Oh, what a beautiful image, the subject and composition are really superb.  Now, let me explain why this is getting a 5 instead of an 8 from me (I hope you will understand) - The image appears oversharpenend- primarily the white and black parallel lines inside the flower, there is a blocky/noisy look to them that is just a shame, and the lower petal where it meets the water has the same blocky look.  Also, the frame is way too heavy, I like the yellow and black, but much lighter weight would have added elegance, this however really just doesn''t do anything for the photograph.. Still, very nice image overall, different PP would have made a big difference.', '2010-01-24 23:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5830831, 848885, 102534, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like how both boys have already taken the plunge and the girl is still a bit apprehensive. Only thing I don''t like is the background blur looks a bit too strong for my taste.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like how both boys have already taken the plunge and the girl is still a bit apprehensive. Only thing I don''t like is the background blur looks a bit too strong for my taste.', '2010-01-24 23:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
