(5831410, 848931, 43463, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what plant life that is but it is incredibly unique looking and has alot of interesting detail! Love the bold colors of yellow that pop off the cobalt blues. Love the details I see in the interior of the ''eye''. The composition of objects and the color almost takes on the aspects of this being a ''golden eye'' nebula found in the deep reaches of space. Love the square crop because it keeps my eye''s attention focused on the main subject.</td>', 'I don''t know what plant life that is but it is incredibly unique looking and has alot of interesting detail! Love the bold colors of yellow that pop off the cobalt blues. Love the details I see in the interior of the ''eye''. The composition of objects and the color almost takes on the aspects of this being a ''golden eye'' nebula found in the deep reaches of space. Love the square crop because it keeps my eye''s attention focused on the main subject.', '2010-01-25 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
