(5832031, 847567, 38032, '<td valign="top">Fun image for sure! A great way to tell this story, and that should be rewarded and encouraged  - I love it for that.  I also think the exposure is perfect on the car-lights - great composition as well.<br/> <br/> It leaves me wondering though: How did the photographer not get hit?  Why didn''t he do anything about this and just pushed the shutter? ;) Why isn''t there more blood and sever bone-crushing :0  and finally, what''s up with the shoe? ;)<br/> <br/>It must have been tough to get that street light thing going on (I''m thinking that''s not a street lamp and if it isn''t, it looks prettty close.<br/>Anyway, I think this certainly could be used for much discussion in  a photography class for sure and I can''t wait to read the details of how it was created. 8</td>', 'Fun image for sure! A great way to tell this story, and that should be rewarded and encouraged  - I love it for that.  I also think the exposure is perfect on the car-lights - great composition as well.  It leaves me wondering though: How did the photographer not get hit?  Why didn''t he do anything about this and just pushed the shutter? ;) Why isn''t there more blood and sever bone-crushing :0  and finally, what''s up with the shoe? ;) It must have been tough to get that street light thing going on (I''m thinking that''s not a street lamp and if it isn''t, it looks prettty close.Anyway, I think this certainly could be used for much discussion in  a photography class for sure and I can''t wait to read the details of how it was created. 8', '2010-01-25 11:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832032, 848568, 90098, '<td valign="top">love the tones in this.</td>', 'love the tones in this.', '2010-01-25 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
