(5832321, 847220, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely pic and liek th eboat in this as well. for complete abstract artistic type of pic i would love to have seen different comps on just the rock and poles. Could get some relly interesting comps and moods there 7</td>', 'Lovely pic and liek th eboat in this as well. for complete abstract artistic type of pic i would love to have seen different comps on just the rock and poles. Could get some relly interesting comps and moods there 7', '2010-01-25 13:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
