(5832351, 847032, 86218, '<td valign="top">South African photographer and little confused as who''s entry this could be. Brilliant colours and the sky spectacular. Nice composition. Reflections coming off the wet sand really cool.</td>', 'South African photographer and little confused as who''s entry this could be. Brilliant colours and the sky spectacular. Nice composition. Reflections coming off the wet sand really cool.', '2010-01-25 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
