(5832358, 847222, 86218, '<td valign="top">wow. colours works well with the eye and flower. portrait comp works here for me. Sharp and love the feeling of tension almost generated by the feeling one gets that this frog could fall any minute from those fragile leaves/petals. Static dynamics - if there is such a thing</td>', 'wow. colours works well with the eye and flower. portrait comp works here for me. Sharp and love the feeling of tension almost generated by the feeling one gets that this frog could fall any minute from those fragile leaves/petals. Static dynamics - if there is such a thing', '2010-01-25 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832359, 848916, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic of a fox I presume. Love the way the eyes are lit up and selective areas dark and light. maybe a tad more light on the snout/nose would have been nice</td>', 'Very nice pic of a fox I presume. Love the way the eyes are lit up and selective areas dark and light. maybe a tad more light on the snout/nose would have been nice', '2010-01-25 13:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
