(5832377, 848928, 327, '<td valign="top">Background red makes this even more vivid. Pretty yellow. I do wish we could of seen the inside of the flower.</td>', 'Background red makes this even more vivid. Pretty yellow. I do wish we could of seen the inside of the flower.', '2010-01-25 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832379, 848911, 100773, '<td valign="top">Haha, he looks like he has completely lost his mind! the eyes are like: "Aha! I see you now, cone! I... will... kill...." But his claws/legs are still sane, realy holding on the that rock there, going: "wtf have you been smoking lately? Your own feathers?" Feathers going: "No! We abandoned bird long time ago! I suggest you do the same!" <br/> <br/>I don''t know where I''m going with this. Was at a Eddie Izzard gig recently. Anyway, 10 and a fav from me. This is an AWESOME bird photo!</td>', 'Haha, he looks like he has completely lost his mind! the eyes are like: "Aha! I see you now, cone! I... will... kill...." But his claws/legs are still sane, realy holding on the that rock there, going: "wtf have you been smoking lately? Your own feathers?" Feathers going: "No! We abandoned bird long time ago! I suggest you do the same!"  I don''t know where I''m going with this. Was at a Eddie Izzard gig recently. Anyway, 10 and a fav from me. This is an AWESOME bird photo!', '2010-01-25 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832381, 848859, 98339, '<td valign="top">what a cute picture...your colors are great not flat and dull, which I find to be important when processing these animals...and your focus is spot on...</td>', 'what a cute picture...your colors are great not flat and dull, which I find to be important when processing these animals...and your focus is spot on...', '2010-01-25 13:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832383, 848551, 98339, '<td valign="top">a very beautiful spot...did you use a fisheye?  the area seems to have a curve to it so I''m guessing the fisheye...nice color...not pushed to much...well done</td>', 'a very beautiful spot...did you use a fisheye?  the area seems to have a curve to it so I''m guessing the fisheye...nice color...not pushed to much...well done', '2010-01-25 13:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
