(5833128, 847620, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m no oceanographer (hell, I never even watched Jacques Cousteau) so I never know what I''m looking at when shots like this come up. I can recognize it as something vaguely out of Spongebob (sorry, I have kids) and appreciate it for it''s abstract beauty. Really good work.</td>', 'I''m no oceanographer (hell, I never even watched Jacques Cousteau) so I never know what I''m looking at when shots like this come up. I can recognize it as something vaguely out of Spongebob (sorry, I have kids) and appreciate it for it''s abstract beauty. Really good work.', '2010-01-25 17:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5833133, 848340, 76335, '<td valign="top">This has a surreal quality -- like something out of a storybook or fairytale. Nicely done.</td>', 'This has a surreal quality -- like something out of a storybook or fairytale. Nicely done.', '2010-01-25 17:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
