(5833558, 848247, 100831, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous. I am not a senior yet but getting there! I definitely see glimpses already of the mental freedoms that accompany the age group but the aches and pains of arthritis will, unfortunately, keep both of my feet on the ground for all my years to come. Great, great picture.</td>', 'I am so jealous. I am not a senior yet but getting there! I definitely see glimpses already of the mental freedoms that accompany the age group but the aches and pains of arthritis will, unfortunately, keep both of my feet on the ground for all my years to come. Great, great picture.', '2010-01-25 20:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
