(5834036, 848347, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a disparity between street level and just one floor up...  Such a very sad scene, as that was obviously a lovingly crafted building with rather good stonework.</td>', 'What a disparity between street level and just one floor up...  Such a very sad scene, as that was obviously a lovingly crafted building with rather good stonework.', '2010-01-26 00:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834038, 848833, 79141, '<td valign="top">greta  good detail in the horses  face</td>', 'greta  good detail in the horses  face', '2010-01-26 00:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834039, 848478, 79141, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2010-01-26 00:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834041, 848312, 112828, '<td valign="top">LOL what the heck is she up to?  Looks like somebody''s going to need to dial 911 soon.  And how about the dumpster diver here?  What a good shot, almost Lachapelle like..  You get an 8.</td>', 'LOL what the heck is she up to?  Looks like somebody''s going to need to dial 911 soon.  And how about the dumpster diver here?  What a good shot, almost Lachapelle like..  You get an 8.', '2010-01-26 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834042, 848035, 79141, '<td valign="top">awesome capture  <br/>the face is so well done</td>', 'awesome capture  the face is so well done', '2010-01-26 00:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834043, 848824, 112828, '<td valign="top">Smooth and creamy with such a wonderful contrast of that building with the reflections... wow oh wow, so much going on here.  Leading lines, rule of thirds, centered?  Exposed with silhoutte and detail in the building, with, mind you, a well exposed sky...  <br/> <br/>The only negative I can find is the reflection on the white building from the water (you might have gotten away with burning that down and the slightly overexposed area right next to the spiral on the main square building..<br/> <br/>Still superb, I would score a 7.5 on this, but I''m sure the trolls have given me the ability to comfortable vote 8 here..</td>', 'Smooth and creamy with such a wonderful contrast of that building with the reflections... wow oh wow, so much going on here.  Leading lines, rule of thirds, centered?  Exposed with silhoutte and detail in the building, with, mind you, a well exposed sky...   The only negative I can find is the reflection on the white building from the water (you might have gotten away with burning that down and the slightly overexposed area right next to the spiral on the main square building.. Still superb, I would score a 7.5 on this, but I''m sure the trolls have given me the ability to comfortable vote 8 here..', '2010-01-26 00:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834044, 848843, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, I love the whole nature of this shot, I do wish it was ever so slightly deeper DOF, but at this level of magnification you only have so much ability to stop down before it''s a mess I''m sure.  The color in the eyes is great, I really like the ruby red in the smaller bug.  The eyes on the larger bug do seem to lack detail, and that''s a shame, because it would have really pushed this up a notch.</td>', 'Very nice image, I love the whole nature of this shot, I do wish it was ever so slightly deeper DOF, but at this level of magnification you only have so much ability to stop down before it''s a mess I''m sure.  The color in the eyes is great, I really like the ruby red in the smaller bug.  The eyes on the larger bug do seem to lack detail, and that''s a shame, because it would have really pushed this up a notch.', '2010-01-26 00:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834045, 847535, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well done on the length of exposure.</td>', 'Nice shot, well done on the length of exposure.', '2010-01-26 00:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834047, 847053, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place, very cool shot, although it does seem just a little dull or gray overall (of course that is how it looks when it rains, kinda)...  I do like the image in a general way, although it is a pretty standard landscape without a super interesting point to focus on, so I''ll for for a 6 here, hope that''s ok with you..  Cheers!</td>', 'What a beautiful place, very cool shot, although it does seem just a little dull or gray overall (of course that is how it looks when it rains, kinda)...  I do like the image in a general way, although it is a pretty standard landscape without a super interesting point to focus on, so I''ll for for a 6 here, hope that''s ok with you..  Cheers!', '2010-01-26 00:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834048, 847780, 112828, '<td valign="top">How wonderful, that looks positively freezing!  You did an excellent job with this shot, the only small detraction is the color of the water, although it is probably true to the scene, a slight color adjustment here might have really made an incredible difference... Maybe..  I still really like the shot, 7 ok with you?</td>', 'How wonderful, that looks positively freezing!  You did an excellent job with this shot, the only small detraction is the color of the water, although it is probably true to the scene, a slight color adjustment here might have really made an incredible difference... Maybe..  I still really like the shot, 7 ok with you?', '2010-01-26 00:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834049, 847036, 112828, '<td valign="top">A 6 for a very pretty kitty :)  Would be a 7 for me with a little more sharpening and noise filtering.</td>', 'A 6 for a very pretty kitty :)  Would be a 7 for me with a little more sharpening and noise filtering.', '2010-01-26 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834051, 847252, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines (quite literally here!), Although the noise and rather dull subject matter will only earn a 5 today.  Tons of chroma noise here, my guess is that this was done on a point and shoot, mind you that''s why you''re getting a 5, if I thought this was an SLR I might go for a 4..  Please don''t hate me, I just think you should know why I''m scoring your image as I am.</td>', 'Nice leading lines (quite literally here!), Although the noise and rather dull subject matter will only earn a 5 today.  Tons of chroma noise here, my guess is that this was done on a point and shoot, mind you that''s why you''re getting a 5, if I thought this was an SLR I might go for a 4..  Please don''t hate me, I just think you should know why I''m scoring your image as I am.', '2010-01-26 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5834062, 847196, 112828, '<td valign="top">Another Lachapelle style shot..  Very cool, I love these so much. 8.</td>', 'Another Lachapelle style shot..  Very cool, I love these so much. 8.', '2010-01-26 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834063, 848734, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent...  Everything is great here.. 8 because I almost never give a 10 and this just doesn''t quite hit me hard enough for a 9... Still, that''s a superb shot!</td>', 'Excellent...  Everything is great here.. 8 because I almost never give a 10 and this just doesn''t quite hit me hard enough for a 9... Still, that''s a superb shot!', '2010-01-26 01:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834064, 848837, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent..  Absolutely nothing to say other than excellent.. A solid 9 for me.</td>', 'Excellent..  Absolutely nothing to say other than excellent.. A solid 9 for me.', '2010-01-26 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834067, 847905, 112828, '<td valign="top">Where did all the people go??  :) I''m not sure which was better for me..  Both are quite nice.</td>', 'Where did all the people go??  :) I''m not sure which was better for me..  Both are quite nice.', '2010-01-26 01:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834069, 847031, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow.  A beautiful image, absolutely great, if you did HDR this, the job was very well done, and I''m not sure how else you could have gotten such a great image.</td>', 'Wow.  A beautiful image, absolutely great, if you did HDR this, the job was very well done, and I''m not sure how else you could have gotten such a great image.', '2010-01-26 01:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834071, 847530, 112828, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting shots of a dragonfly I''ve ever seen... Really great job on this.</td>', 'One of the most interesting shots of a dragonfly I''ve ever seen... Really great job on this.', '2010-01-26 01:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834074, 848060, 5034, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s saying, "Ok, you''ve got your stupid photo <i>now come and get me out of here!</i>"</td>', 'It looks like it''s saying, "Ok, you''ve got your stupid photo now come and get me out of here!"', '2010-01-26 01:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834075, 848772, 106543, '<td valign="top">Nice backlit flower, your picture has a height of 500 pixels the maximum is 800. I think this might have improved with a bigger size.</td>', 'Nice backlit flower, your picture has a height of 500 pixels the maximum is 800. I think this might have improved with a bigger size.', '2010-01-26 01:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834076, 847231, 56579, '<td valign="top">The noise bothers me...but this photo does not seem to have the sharpness to do much more of a noise filter.  Did you try a USM at the end to help that?</td>', 'The noise bothers me...but this photo does not seem to have the sharpness to do much more of a noise filter.  Did you try a USM at the end to help that?', '2010-01-26 01:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834079, 848485, 106543, '<td valign="top">Cute dog, was he chewing on that branch in front of his face? This is one of those images that is more of a personal thing something DPCer''s are not always fans of.</td>', 'Cute dog, was he chewing on that branch in front of his face? This is one of those images that is more of a personal thing something DPCer''s are not always fans of.', '2010-01-26 01:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834081, 848380, 5034, '<td valign="top">He looks more like he''s saying, "this is <i>my</i> territory."  VERY nice capture, great DOF, excellent detail.  9.</td>', 'He looks more like he''s saying, "this is my territory."  VERY nice capture, great DOF, excellent detail.  9.', '2010-01-26 01:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834082, 847033, 106543, '<td valign="top">I think if you had isolated the main flower, as opposed to having the peripheral flowers it would allow the viewer to focus on a main object.</td>', 'I think if you had isolated the main flower, as opposed to having the peripheral flowers it would allow the viewer to focus on a main object.', '2010-01-26 01:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834083, 848644, 5034, '<td valign="top">Oooorah.  Very very very nice.  9 for now, potential for an upgrade.</td>', 'Oooorah.  Very very very nice.  9 for now, potential for an upgrade.', '2010-01-26 01:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834085, 847465, 106543, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of flowers myself, but you did a good job with lighting and having a good background that doesn''t take away from your flower.</td>', 'Not a big fan of flowers myself, but you did a good job with lighting and having a good background that doesn''t take away from your flower.', '2010-01-26 01:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834088, 848869, 5034, '<td valign="top">NICE!  A landscape that hasn''t been HDR''d to death.  Great detail, good use of long shutter speed for the water, well done.</td>', 'NICE!  A landscape that hasn''t been HDR''d to death.  Great detail, good use of long shutter speed for the water, well done.', '2010-01-26 01:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834089, 848699, 106543, '<td valign="top">The softness is nice around the neck and ear. Don''t like the white vignetting border though.</td>', 'The softness is nice around the neck and ear. Don''t like the white vignetting border though.', '2010-01-26 01:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834092, 847780, 5034, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture, love the ice on the lighthouse, 10.</td>', 'Brilliant capture, love the ice on the lighthouse, 10.', '2010-01-26 01:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834093, 847810, 5034, '<td valign="top">Seen that bloke before, intense portrait here, beautiful colours and detail.  This score has been upgraded to 10.</td>', 'Seen that bloke before, intense portrait here, beautiful colours and detail.  This score has been upgraded to 10.', '2010-01-26 01:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834094, 847481, 5034, '<td valign="top">I love the hunour here.  These are awesome birds and the one on the right really seems annoyed.  10.</td>', 'I love the hunour here.  These are awesome birds and the one on the right really seems annoyed.  10.', '2010-01-26 01:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834095, 847127, 5034, '<td valign="top">The most amazing thing to me is that I force myself to look at the trees but my eyes keep returning and diving in to the water so to speak.  10.</td>', 'The most amazing thing to me is that I force myself to look at the trees but my eyes keep returning and diving in to the water so to speak.  10.', '2010-01-26 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834096, 848725, 106543, '<td valign="top">A little less grain and more light on the upper part of the face and you would have been golden.</td>', 'A little less grain and more light on the upper part of the face and you would have been golden.', '2010-01-26 01:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834097, 847196, 5034, '<td valign="top">Love it, he really looks like he knows he''s in serious trouble.  Love the parents off to the side concerned for their wayward son.  10.</td>', 'Love it, he really looks like he knows he''s in serious trouble.  Love the parents off to the side concerned for their wayward son.  10.', '2010-01-26 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834098, 847296, 5034, '<td valign="top">Such a variety of colours and yet I cannot detect any HDR.  10 from me for that point alone.</td>', 'Such a variety of colours and yet I cannot detect any HDR.  10 from me for that point alone.', '2010-01-26 01:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834099, 848506, 5034, '<td valign="top">Good use of the triangle!  Spot on focus, beautiful model and I really like the fact you didn''t edit out the freckles.  This score has been upgraded to 10.</td>', 'Good use of the triangle!  Spot on focus, beautiful model and I really like the fact you didn''t edit out the freckles.  This score has been upgraded to 10.', '2010-01-26 01:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834100, 848788, 5034, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s really, really well done.  This score has been upgraded to 10.</td>', 'Wow, that''s really, really well done.  This score has been upgraded to 10.', '2010-01-26 01:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834101, 847541, 5034, '<td valign="top">That''s a 10 just for the timing alone.  You couldn''t really ask for this to be much better.</td>', 'That''s a 10 just for the timing alone.  You couldn''t really ask for this to be much better.', '2010-01-26 01:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834102, 847866, 5034, '<td valign="top">Jawdropping.  Simply stunning.  To get this in a city with all the lights and everything, beautiful.  Pity about the rain drops but you do tend to get them in a thunderstorm.  10.</td>', 'Jawdropping.  Simply stunning.  To get this in a city with all the lights and everything, beautiful.  Pity about the rain drops but you do tend to get them in a thunderstorm.  10.', '2010-01-26 01:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834103, 847933, 5034, '<td valign="top">Tranquility deluxe.  Perfect depiction of such a lovely place.</td>', 'Tranquility deluxe.  Perfect depiction of such a lovely place.', '2010-01-26 01:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834104, 847618, 5034, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture against the leaves.  Pity we can''t see its feet and that the plant on the right is there but life, of course, is imperfect.  Excellent focus and detail on the animal.</td>', 'Perfect capture against the leaves.  Pity we can''t see its feet and that the plant on the right is there but life, of course, is imperfect.  Excellent focus and detail on the animal.', '2010-01-26 01:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834105, 848478, 106543, '<td valign="top">A little blurry on the girl,  not sure what she is holding. Love the hat in the background :)</td>', 'A little blurry on the girl,  not sure what she is holding. Love the hat in the background :)', '2010-01-26 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834106, 847393, 5034, '<td valign="top">I probably would have cut half an inch or a little less off the left hand side, just to get more of a feeling of centredness.  Still a 10 from me though.</td>', 'I probably would have cut half an inch or a little less off the left hand side, just to get more of a feeling of centredness.  Still a 10 from me though.', '2010-01-26 01:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834107, 848106, 106543, '<td valign="top">A little grainy for my taste but I do like the distant mystic land in the background</td>', 'A little grainy for my taste but I do like the distant mystic land in the background', '2010-01-26 01:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834111, 848507, 106543, '<td valign="top">From a play or something of that sort? Right hand is a little blurry and the backdrop is distracting, but I assume you didn''t have much choice in that :)</td>', 'From a play or something of that sort? Right hand is a little blurry and the backdrop is distracting, but I assume you didn''t have much choice in that :)', '2010-01-26 01:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834114, 848851, 106543, '<td valign="top">Very elegant seating arrangement!</td>', 'Very elegant seating arrangement!', '2010-01-26 01:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834115, 848860, 106543, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the vignetting but the perspective makes you wonder what might be at the end of this boardwalk.</td>', 'Not a fan of the vignetting but the perspective makes you wonder what might be at the end of this boardwalk.', '2010-01-26 01:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834116, 847173, 106543, '<td valign="top">Mmmm making me hungry! I like the gravy dropping</td>', 'Mmmm making me hungry! I like the gravy dropping', '2010-01-26 01:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834118, 847720, 106543, '<td valign="top">Oh nice shot, would have like to see this a little lighter though.</td>', 'Oh nice shot, would have like to see this a little lighter though.', '2010-01-26 01:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834119, 848340, 106543, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9, the trees and rocky river is great but it''s the clouds and especially the mountain that really put it over the top for me</td>', 'I gave this a 9, the trees and rocky river is great but it''s the clouds and especially the mountain that really put it over the top for me', '2010-01-26 02:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834123, 848551, 106543, '<td valign="top">Love the textures all over the photo, rocks, plants, clouds, water, great! I also like the title, I googled what it was and love it even more!</td>', 'Love the textures all over the photo, rocks, plants, clouds, water, great! I also like the title, I googled what it was and love it even more!', '2010-01-26 02:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834126, 848341, 106543, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait, the eyes, nice skin, and the curls. I gave this an 8, the only way I could see it being improved would be to have a little more in focus. But it is great this way!</td>', 'I really like this portrait, the eyes, nice skin, and the curls. I gave this an 8, the only way I could see it being improved would be to have a little more in focus. But it is great this way!', '2010-01-26 02:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834129, 847093, 106543, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the eyes and face, I also like the ruffly hood and sleeve lining. All around an impressive photo, but you already knew that!</td>', 'Great focus on the eyes and face, I also like the ruffly hood and sleeve lining. All around an impressive photo, but you already knew that!', '2010-01-26 02:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834130, 847576, 106543, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a CD cover of a band from Sweden, perfect reflections</td>', 'Reminds me of a CD cover of a band from Sweden, perfect reflections', '2010-01-26 02:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834131, 848420, 113740, '<td valign="top">This is stunning.</td>', 'This is stunning.', '2010-01-26 02:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834132, 847914, 106543, '<td valign="top">This truly captures the spirit of these people. Can''t wait to find out what this is of! 8</td>', 'This truly captures the spirit of these people. Can''t wait to find out what this is of! 8', '2010-01-26 02:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834133, 848893, 106543, '<td valign="top">Scrolling down I thought it was a very nice picture of a mountain landscape, but then that coyote looking so small just brought this picture to an even greater level!</td>', 'Scrolling down I thought it was a very nice picture of a mountain landscape, but then that coyote looking so small just brought this picture to an even greater level!', '2010-01-26 02:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834134, 848346, 106543, '<td valign="top">Hmmm I think I''ve seen this lion win a ribbon not too long ago? Looks like the same scratch on the nose. Either way this is an excellent shot!</td>', 'Hmmm I think I''ve seen this lion win a ribbon not too long ago? Looks like the same scratch on the nose. Either way this is an excellent shot!', '2010-01-26 02:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834136, 848519, 106543, '<td valign="top">A busy picture but it works! Makes you feel very small in this world. 8</td>', 'A busy picture but it works! Makes you feel very small in this world. 8', '2010-01-26 02:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834137, 848247, 106543, '<td valign="top">Is this really a senior? I don''t know if I can jump that high and I''m 20!</td>', 'Is this really a senior? I don''t know if I can jump that high and I''m 20!', '2010-01-26 02:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834138, 848514, 106543, '<td valign="top">Shame that the tree is in the way but I still think it''s a great picture. Now I''m interested in what this is.</td>', 'Shame that the tree is in the way but I still think it''s a great picture. Now I''m interested in what this is.', '2010-01-26 02:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834140, 847116, 113740, '<td valign="top">One word - Wow.</td>', 'One word - Wow.', '2010-01-26 02:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834141, 847742, 106543, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=49643" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bnilesh</a>? Beautiful portrait!</td>', ' bnilesh? Beautiful portrait!', '2010-01-26 02:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834144, 848770, 106543, '<td valign="top">What a delicate web of dew, I think it''s dew at least.</td>', 'What a delicate web of dew, I think it''s dew at least.', '2010-01-26 02:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834146, 847060, 106543, '<td valign="top">In hindsight you''ll see that you picked the right image! I like the way the sun is shining through that layer of grass in the back</td>', 'In hindsight you''ll see that you picked the right image! I like the way the sun is shining through that layer of grass in the back', '2010-01-26 02:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834147, 847467, 106543, '<td valign="top">Those poor photographers up there, they shot the wrong side of the train. Fortunately you were there to capture it!</td>', 'Those poor photographers up there, they shot the wrong side of the train. Fortunately you were there to capture it!', '2010-01-26 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834148, 847529, 106543, '<td valign="top">Wowee! Great landscape, are those bales covered up? I don''t know if they are supposed to have it or not but it looks like there''s an aqua colour at the top of the bales. I just assumed it''s part of the covers though.</td>', 'Wowee! Great landscape, are those bales covered up? I don''t know if they are supposed to have it or not but it looks like there''s an aqua colour at the top of the bales. I just assumed it''s part of the covers though.', '2010-01-26 02:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834149, 848821, 106543, '<td valign="top">Are her eyes naturally like that!? Either way they are very cool and you did a good job capturing her!</td>', 'Are her eyes naturally like that!? Either way they are very cool and you did a good job capturing her!', '2010-01-26 02:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834150, 848801, 106543, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the dark sky and bright reflected sky. It''s kind of bizarre that there seems to be a pirate ship in the middle of nowhere, I like that.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the dark sky and bright reflected sky. It''s kind of bizarre that there seems to be a pirate ship in the middle of nowhere, I like that.', '2010-01-26 02:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834152, 848506, 106543, '<td valign="top">I also liked your other portrait of her in a recent free study. I believe I, let me check, yes I favourited that one. I like the other one better but I think that''s just because the eyes are bigger and able to show more detail. Anyways I still think this is awesome!</td>', 'I also liked your other portrait of her in a recent free study. I believe I, let me check, yes I favourited that one. I like the other one better but I think that''s just because the eyes are bigger and able to show more detail. Anyways I still think this is awesome!', '2010-01-26 02:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
