(5834337, 848373, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice colours can clouds... I love a nice cloudscape... this would have benefited from something more than tree tops in the foreground... hard to make a cloudscape rock just with clouds, no matter how great the clouds... not impossible, but not easy.<br/> <br/><i>Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97166" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">K10DGuy</a>''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is 3rd in the series</i> <br/> <br/>----------<br/>The fires blazed night and day, and they set the sky alight with colour.</td>', 'Nice colours can clouds... I love a nice cloudscape... this would have benefited from something more than tree tops in the foreground... hard to make a cloudscape rock just with clouds, no matter how great the clouds... not impossible, but not easy. Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like  K10DGuy''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is 3rd in the series  ----------The fires blazed night and day, and they set the sky alight with colour.', '2010-01-26 09:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
