(5834342, 848889, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colour.  I like that you''ve captured some people in the image... gives is some perspective and some story.<br/> <br/> <br/><i>Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97166" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">K10DGuy</a>''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #12 in the series</i> <br/> <br/>----------<br/>The age of man was about to come to an end, and animals would rule the world again.</td>', 'Nice composition and colour.  I like that you''ve captured some people in the image... gives is some perspective and some story.  Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like  K10DGuy''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #12 in the series  ----------The age of man was about to come to an end, and animals would rule the world again.', '2010-01-26 09:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
