(5834432, 847298, 86218, '<td valign="top">I generally dont like to take pics like this of flowers as I find it a bit boring. the results on this however is stunning and the lighting is magic brining out the details in this. This is beautifull. The lines shaped by the leaves enhances the flower and contributes to the petal lines. I dont hink I have given a 9 for a boring flower pic...But this is not boring. You worked on this and its not merely a picture taken but a picture made.</td>', 'I generally dont like to take pics like this of flowers as I find it a bit boring. the results on this however is stunning and the lighting is magic brining out the details in this. This is beautifull. The lines shaped by the leaves enhances the flower and contributes to the petal lines. I dont hink I have given a 9 for a boring flower pic...But this is not boring. You worked on this and its not merely a picture taken but a picture made.', '2010-01-26 10:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834434, 848556, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture but feel for this composition everything is a bit on the dark side. The walkway def needs to have more light. The idea however is perfect and I love this pic</td>', 'Very nice picture but feel for this composition everything is a bit on the dark side. The walkway def needs to have more light. The idea however is perfect and I love this pic', '2010-01-26 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
