(5834445, 848308, 86218, '<td valign="top">Love the sweeping line of this tree taking me to the falls and the reflection and rocks looks good. Only nit for me is the exposure on the top of this line of the tree a bit white. Its a super well thought out image thats worth a bettre exposure or maybe different time of the day</td>', 'Love the sweeping line of this tree taking me to the falls and the reflection and rocks looks good. Only nit for me is the exposure on the top of this line of the tree a bit white. Its a super well thought out image thats worth a bettre exposure or maybe different time of the day', '2010-01-26 10:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
