(5836460, 848270, 94241, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunningly beautiful.<br/> <br/>My suggestion would be: give it a more extreme crop.  I think the picture is aiming for showing some wild and radical world, so a wild and radical aspect ratio would be okay.  Specifically, I''d crop off the top 10%-ish to get rid of the foreground leaves in the upper right; I think they break the ambience.</td>', 'Absolutely stunningly beautiful. My suggestion would be: give it a more extreme crop.  I think the picture is aiming for showing some wild and radical world, so a wild and radical aspect ratio would be okay.  Specifically, I''d crop off the top 10%-ish to get rid of the foreground leaves in the upper right; I think they break the ambience.', '2010-01-27 03:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
