(5836482, 848567, 94241, '<td valign="top">The focus here confuses me.  Since the bench is in focus, I keep studying it to figure out why it''s the most important part of the image.  But the sunrise (sunset?) drags my attention away by being brighter and more complex.  It''s a really pretty image, I''m just not sure what I''m supposed to pay attention to.</td>', 'The focus here confuses me.  Since the bench is in focus, I keep studying it to figure out why it''s the most important part of the image.  But the sunrise (sunset?) drags my attention away by being brighter and more complex.  It''s a really pretty image, I''m just not sure what I''m supposed to pay attention to.', '2010-01-27 04:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5836487, 848317, 94241, '<td valign="top">I am not actually sure what this is, but it gives me a sense of immense scale.  That plus the really cool textures makes me think of some Michael Whelan paintings.</td>', 'I am not actually sure what this is, but it gives me a sense of immense scale.  That plus the really cool textures makes me think of some Michael Whelan paintings.', '2010-01-27 04:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
