(5836503, 847576, 32011, '<td valign="top">Love your work Nuzzer.  This is one of my favourite images of the challenge... one of many excellent images...  I''ve already voted and now commenting... only realised this was a Nuzzer thanks to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=26236" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">saphire</a> faving my entry, and me having a look at her previous fav''s and seeing your Mystic River entry amongst them.  Anyway... what is it I like... love the composition and the use of duotone... subtle but effective... and love that there''s more detail in the reflection than at the top.</td>', 'Love your work Nuzzer.  This is one of my favourite images of the challenge... one of many excellent images...  I''ve already voted and now commenting... only realised this was a Nuzzer thanks to  saphire faving my entry, and me having a look at her previous fav''s and seeing your Mystic River entry amongst them.  Anyway... what is it I like... love the composition and the use of duotone... subtle but effective... and love that there''s more detail in the reflection than at the top.', '2010-01-27 05:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
