(5836649, 848549, 32011, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and composition... I love the story it tells... always like a story,.. now this is a flower photo that I like.  :)<br/> <br/> <br/><i>Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=97166" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">K10DGuy</a>''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #8 in the series</i> <br/> <br/>----------<br/>Some distance from the devastation on the coast, life went on...</td>', 'Excellent colour and composition... I love the story it tells... always like a story,.. now this is a flower photo that I like.  :)  Now... please bear with me... I''m revisiting a little comment experiment I conducted in the 2009-03 Free Study... something like  K10DGuy''s comments, but with a twist... the twist being, the story will move from one photo to another within the challenge... also, I don''t select just a few photos I start at the first and end on the last as determined by DPC random order assigned to me, with a single sentence for each photo... should be interesting... and you''re photo is #8 in the series  ----------Some distance from the devastation on the coast, life went on...', '2010-01-27 06:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
