(5836680, 847064, 51793, '<td valign="top">The lighting of your background is better than the lighting of your subject. It looks like you are trying to light them both using the same light. By the looks of it I would say that you bounced the light off the ceiling, which in this case you should point the flash straighter up or back up about 4 feet. Not sure what settings you used but I would increase the power of the flash by at least one stop.</td>', 'The lighting of your background is better than the lighting of your subject. It looks like you are trying to light them both using the same light. By the looks of it I would say that you bounced the light off the ceiling, which in this case you should point the flash straighter up or back up about 4 feet. Not sure what settings you used but I would increase the power of the flash by at least one stop.', '2010-01-27 06:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
