(5837232, 848772, 28476, '<td valign="top">I probably would have minimized the depth of field even more, cut the dark what ever on the left and gone even lower with the camera to get the green fill half the frame. Having the sun behind the flower is good...<br/>I''m no master however...</td>', 'I probably would have minimized the depth of field even more, cut the dark what ever on the left and gone even lower with the camera to get the green fill half the frame. Having the sun behind the flower is good...I''m no master however...', '2010-01-27 09:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837235, 847463, 49643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait &amp; excellent tonality,expressions!<br/>May I guess about gears as 5D with 85mm/1.2 ? They both are on my list &amp; will like to have one day :)</td>', 'Beautiful portrait & excellent tonality,expressions!May I guess about gears as 5D with 85mm/1.2 ? They both are on my list & will like to have one day :)', '2010-01-27 09:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
