(5837963, 847116, 42013, '<td valign="top">I''d quarrel a little with the seemingly over-sharp treatment, but, it really does nothing to detract for me. Colors are great, pose is regal, and the bg blur is over the top. Good luck!</td>', 'I''d quarrel a little with the seemingly over-sharp treatment, but, it really does nothing to detract for me. Colors are great, pose is regal, and the bg blur is over the top. Good luck!', '2010-01-27 13:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
