(5837970, 847842, 85097, '<td valign="top">I think that maybe the crop should be a little bit tighter?  Maybe try cropping by the birds right wing so that the eye naturally follows the tilt of his head.  but I love the green colors here.</td>', 'I think that maybe the crop should be a little bit tighter?  Maybe try cropping by the birds right wing so that the eye naturally follows the tilt of his head.  but I love the green colors here.', '2010-01-27 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
