(5837976, 848818, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very Tranquil. This shot draws you in and Love the detail on the foreground and the channel funneling me along into these mountaisn to nowhere...because nowhere is where you go where nobody can find you and nothing can disturb you. Ahhh. Love it 9 Others might complain about the emptiness and lack of something here in the fore.</td>', 'Very Tranquil. This shot draws you in and Love the detail on the foreground and the channel funneling me along into these mountaisn to nowhere...because nowhere is where you go where nobody can find you and nothing can disturb you. Ahhh. Love it 9 Others might complain about the emptiness and lack of something here in the fore.', '2010-01-27 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837977, 847247, 85097, '<td valign="top">great action photo.</td>', 'great action photo.', '2010-01-27 14:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837978, 848911, 42013, '<td valign="top">I think i''ve seen this before--can''t remember who! It''s a great shot and worthy of the best of.</td>', 'I think i''ve seen this before--can''t remember who! It''s a great shot and worthy of the best of.', '2010-01-27 14:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837979, 847562, 85097, '<td valign="top">love natural landscapes that aren''t over processed.  This one is very good.</td>', 'love natural landscapes that aren''t over processed.  This one is very good.', '2010-01-27 14:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837980, 847762, 68256, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why I like this other than the missing heads of all the subjects.  Strange.  On second thought I like the patterns and textures of the bricks.  I probably would have cloned out your subject ("one") and the extra feet at top and you wouldn''t have liked it nearly as good, and I would have liked it a little better...</td>', 'I have no idea why I like this other than the missing heads of all the subjects.  Strange.  On second thought I like the patterns and textures of the bricks.  I probably would have cloned out your subject ("one") and the extra feet at top and you wouldn''t have liked it nearly as good, and I would have liked it a little better...', '2010-01-27 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837981, 848422, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the color treatment and your model... Not 100% convinced of her expression but overall well done.</td>', 'I like the color treatment and your model... Not 100% convinced of her expression but overall well done.', '2010-01-27 14:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837982, 848552, 86218, '<td valign="top">The effect of this rough and tough dad made soft by new life in his arms works for me</td>', 'The effect of this rough and tough dad made soft by new life in his arms works for me', '2010-01-27 14:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
