(5838004, 848022, 86218, '<td valign="top">My wife would agree 100% Boy or girl? Boy...Storm raging outwards...Girl storm brewing inwards. I only have boys..3 of them. I would not know about girls. Enjoy the calmness...oooh but this is best of 2009 so maybe the storm is there? 7</td>', 'My wife would agree 100% Boy or girl? Boy...Storm raging outwards...Girl storm brewing inwards. I only have boys..3 of them. I would not know about girls. Enjoy the calmness...oooh but this is best of 2009 so maybe the storm is there? 7', '2010-01-27 14:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838009, 848348, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract, I love the boldness, lines and composition.</td>', 'Very nice abstract, I love the boldness, lines and composition.', '2010-01-27 14:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838018, 848923, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition, the diagonal lines leading to the top of the "whole" wall and the symmetrical patters are wonderful.  I also like the high key exposure.</td>', 'I really like this composition, the diagonal lines leading to the top of the "whole" wall and the symmetrical patters are wonderful.  I also like the high key exposure.', '2010-01-27 14:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838022, 847856, 3102, '<td valign="top">A neat looking place, and a fun idea.  I''m not crazy about the selective desaturation... it just seems like it was used gratuitously here.</td>', 'A neat looking place, and a fun idea.  I''m not crazy about the selective desaturation... it just seems like it was used gratuitously here.', '2010-01-27 14:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838027, 848788, 3102, '<td valign="top">What an amazing looking place -- looks like it was straight out of a movie scene!  I love the color of the sky, and the skull gives it a rather mysterious feel.  It would have been cool if the skull had been moving in such a way that there was a bit of a wake behind it.  I don''t know if that would have been possible (I''m sure it would have taken quite a bit of work to pull off), but that would have bumped this from a 9 to a 10 for me.  This is my 4,000th comment at DPC... thanks for being my milestone photo comment! :)</td>', 'What an amazing looking place -- looks like it was straight out of a movie scene!  I love the color of the sky, and the skull gives it a rather mysterious feel.  It would have been cool if the skull had been moving in such a way that there was a bit of a wake behind it.  I don''t know if that would have been possible (I''m sure it would have taken quite a bit of work to pull off), but that would have bumped this from a 9 to a 10 for me.  This is my 4,000th comment at DPC... thanks for being my milestone photo comment! :)', '2010-01-27 14:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838031, 847837, 68256, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment, this is my favorite wildlife photo of the bunch..at least it looks "wild".  I''m glad he isn''t focused on you!  I gave it a 10 a couple of days ago...</td>', 'Coming back to comment, this is my favorite wildlife photo of the bunch..at least it looks "wild".  I''m glad he isn''t focused on you!  I gave it a 10 a couple of days ago...', '2010-01-27 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838033, 848356, 68256, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of the owl''s head and the fact that you have captured its personality.  Very well done.</td>', 'Love the angle of the owl''s head and the fact that you have captured its personality.  Very well done.', '2010-01-27 14:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838041, 848935, 68256, '<td valign="top">Although perhaps not the most technically sound portrait of the challenge there is a indescribably beauty to both the photograph and the model. I like the vignette and dof is perfect.  I had given this a 9 at first glance and I''m guessing the only thing that I initially voted down on was the bright spot behind her and the somewhat strange gray tones of her hair on that side (maybe light spill), but after more studying, I just can justify dropping this below 10.</td>', 'Although perhaps not the most technically sound portrait of the challenge there is a indescribably beauty to both the photograph and the model. I like the vignette and dof is perfect.  I had given this a 9 at first glance and I''m guessing the only thing that I initially voted down on was the bright spot behind her and the somewhat strange gray tones of her hair on that side (maybe light spill), but after more studying, I just can justify dropping this below 10.', '2010-01-27 14:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838045, 848083, 48697, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, b&amp;w does it well.</td>', 'I really like this image, b&w does it well.', '2010-01-27 14:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838047, 848893, 48697, '<td valign="top">A fine image, the coyote really gives this scale. Well done.</td>', 'A fine image, the coyote really gives this scale. Well done.', '2010-01-27 14:33:47.000000', NULL, 1);
