(5838324, 847060, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice title &amp; ''concept'', nice image - nice scene, good lighting, good detail, wish it were 800 and some minor adjustments in pp, like the branch coming in on the right middle to top the fore oof leaves (minor) and the sky color/exposure upper right.  Not sure if it is gamma issues, but some black/dark areas on the horse''s knees and chest seem a little funky.  Really like the way the mane is almost perfectly ''laying'' on the neck and the tail contrasted by the morning/evening light making it ''glow''.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Nice title & ''concept'', nice image - nice scene, good lighting, good detail, wish it were 800 and some minor adjustments in pp, like the branch coming in on the right middle to top the fore oof leaves (minor) and the sky color/exposure upper right.  Not sure if it is gamma issues, but some black/dark areas on the horse''s knees and chest seem a little funky.  Really like the way the mane is almost perfectly ''laying'' on the neck and the tail contrasted by the morning/evening light making it ''glow''.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2010-01-27 16:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
