(5838696, 848734, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/8/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 9/8/10 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 10/9 <br/>Presentation:7 <br/>Total: 8.1 <br/>Vote: 8 <br/> <br/>Remarks: Although there are many images occupying this genre, I cannot imagine a better rendition of the givens.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/8/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 9/8/10 Aesthetics/Technical: 10/9 Presentation:7 Total: 8.1 Vote: 8  Remarks: Although there are many images occupying this genre, I cannot imagine a better rendition of the givens.', '2010-01-27 19:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838697, 848933, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have captured such great lighting in this scene with such an even exposure. It''s very vivid in color. The clouds in the sky add great interest. Yet nothing stands out as a subject. I think it needs a little pop of color somewhere in the greens. This would be great if it were the background of the composition and not the entire composition itself.</td>', 'You have captured such great lighting in this scene with such an even exposure. It''s very vivid in color. The clouds in the sky add great interest. Yet nothing stands out as a subject. I think it needs a little pop of color somewhere in the greens. This would be great if it were the background of the composition and not the entire composition itself.', '2010-01-27 19:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838704, 848865, 10785, '<td valign="top">Excellent photojournalism! You captured the adventure of this tragic event.</td>', 'Excellent photojournalism! You captured the adventure of this tragic event.', '2010-01-27 19:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838706, 848872, 10785, '<td valign="top">It may be just the illusion of the perspective but the horizon looks tilted on this photo. The shore line and the house lines seem to run diagonal however the top of the mountain looks normal so I don''t know.</td>', 'It may be just the illusion of the perspective but the horizon looks tilted on this photo. The shore line and the house lines seem to run diagonal however the top of the mountain looks normal so I don''t know.', '2010-01-27 19:10:58.000000', NULL, 1);
