(5838914, 848551, 2333, '<td valign="top">This, honestly, is just stunning. My top pick of the challenge... and there are some other images that are extremely good in this bunch. You''ve nailed the composition, and of course the content is beautiful. What takes it to the next level, IMO, is the fact that you have held the maximal amount of detail, with no hint of oversharpening. Nice job.<br/>From the sun angle and the foreground detail, I do assume this is multiple exposure HDR; it is, IMO, what HDR is all about, rendering a natural scene believably, yet with more detail in darker areas than would normally be possible.</td>', 'This, honestly, is just stunning. My top pick of the challenge... and there are some other images that are extremely good in this bunch. You''ve nailed the composition, and of course the content is beautiful. What takes it to the next level, IMO, is the fact that you have held the maximal amount of detail, with no hint of oversharpening. Nice job.From the sun angle and the foreground detail, I do assume this is multiple exposure HDR; it is, IMO, what HDR is all about, rendering a natural scene believably, yet with more detail in darker areas than would normally be possible.', '2010-01-27 20:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838920, 848538, 2333, '<td valign="top">What an awesome scene, and captured in beautiful, dramatic light. My one nitpick on this is that the final web image is a little "crunchy." Slightly oversharpened to my personal taste.</td>', 'What an awesome scene, and captured in beautiful, dramatic light. My one nitpick on this is that the final web image is a little "crunchy." Slightly oversharpened to my personal taste.', '2010-01-27 20:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838924, 848683, 2333, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this... the light is just ethereal. The combination of late evening daylight and the glow created by the lights on the ride... just wonderful. I really like your choice of exposure time, just enough motion in there. A beautiful image.</td>', 'I absolutely love this... the light is just ethereal. The combination of late evening daylight and the glow created by the lights on the ride... just wonderful. I really like your choice of exposure time, just enough motion in there. A beautiful image.', '2010-01-27 21:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
