(5838984, 847090, 2333, '<td valign="top">Like the concept, love the execution. Nice tonal range. I found myself wanting just a *little* more definition in the edges of the distant spires, and judging by the fact that the mid-distance is sharper, I suspect that it just wasn''t there in the original, either due to focusing a touch inside of the hyperfocal distance, or because of atmospheric turbulence.</td>', 'Like the concept, love the execution. Nice tonal range. I found myself wanting just a *little* more definition in the edges of the distant spires, and judging by the fact that the mid-distance is sharper, I suspect that it just wasn''t there in the original, either due to focusing a touch inside of the hyperfocal distance, or because of atmospheric turbulence.', '2010-01-27 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
