(5839001, 848896, 2333, '<td valign="top">An exceptionally well done rendition of a great landmark. The very light fog adds a great deal to the image. Congrats on your timing and your execution.</td>', 'An exceptionally well done rendition of a great landmark. The very light fog adds a great deal to the image. Congrats on your timing and your execution.', '2010-01-27 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
