(5839007, 848548, 79955, '<td valign="top">Lovely conversion , a unique presentation which I really like.<br/>That defect on the petal is really distracting , wish you had removed it , 7</td>', 'Lovely conversion , a unique presentation which I really like.That defect on the petal is really distracting , wish you had removed it , 7', '2010-01-27 21:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839008, 848081, 42013, '<td valign="top">Resembles Larus'' work. The forehead chop feels like too much but then again you have a nice symmetry in her shoulders and face. I suspect she has great skin but you wanted the ''dirty'' look.</td>', 'Resembles Larus'' work. The forehead chop feels like too much but then again you have a nice symmetry in her shoulders and face. I suspect she has great skin but you wanted the ''dirty'' look.', '2010-01-27 21:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839010, 848379, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice catch , the bokeh works very well here , 7</td>', 'Nice catch , the bokeh works very well here , 7', '2010-01-27 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839011, 848643, 2333, '<td valign="top">How surreal! A great find, and a beautiful capture. I very much like your treatment in post. Nice tonal range. I would not personally have chosen these specific tones, but they work well for this image. Nice work.</td>', 'How surreal! A great find, and a beautiful capture. I very much like your treatment in post. Nice tonal range. I would not personally have chosen these specific tones, but they work well for this image. Nice work.', '2010-01-27 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839013, 847230, 63398, '<td valign="top">Competent bird shot.....6</td>', 'Competent bird shot.....6', '2010-01-27 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839014, 848839, 79955, '<td valign="top">A little more fill flash to lighten the face up would have be better, 5</td>', 'A little more fill flash to lighten the face up would have be better, 5', '2010-01-27 21:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839019, 847090, 42013, '<td valign="top">Hi Lev, wonder how this one is going for you. It''s not a typical Monument valley photo. I like the image--feels like the cowboy is kneeling down in awe of the scene. The high contrast is nice.</td>', 'Hi Lev, wonder how this one is going for you. It''s not a typical Monument valley photo. I like the image--feels like the cowboy is kneeling down in awe of the scene. The high contrast is nice.', '2010-01-27 21:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839020, 847039, 2333, '<td valign="top">He does not look pleased... but I''m sure you were pleased when you reviewed the result!</td>', 'He does not look pleased... but I''m sure you were pleased when you reviewed the result!', '2010-01-27 21:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839022, 848563, 79955, '<td valign="top">A lot of potential in this shot! Currently I feel that the post processing falls short.The viginette on the left is a little too strong, the platform could do with a tad more contrast &amp; be crisper to really lead the viewer into the shot , 6</td>', 'A lot of potential in this shot! Currently I feel that the post processing falls short.The viginette on the left is a little too strong, the platform could do with a tad more contrast & be crisper to really lead the viewer into the shot , 6', '2010-01-27 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839024, 847762, 42013, '<td valign="top">I want to think that the dog has stopped at a drinking fountain. The arrow is to help him find his way home. <br/> <br/>This is my favorite---sure to be buried in obscurity on page 8, but i hope not!</td>', 'I want to think that the dog has stopped at a drinking fountain. The arrow is to help him find his way home.  This is my favorite---sure to be buried in obscurity on page 8, but i hope not!', '2010-01-27 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
