(5839027, 848863, 79955, '<td valign="top">Very interestingly executed , actually I quite like it. I would have liked it even more if the reds &amp; yellows are a little too strong. 6</td>', 'Very interestingly executed , actually I quite like it. I would have liked it even more if the reds & yellows are a little too strong. 6', '2010-01-27 21:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
