(5839057, 847467, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent conversion using the entire range of tones, Nice composition. My only niggle is that the smoke blends in too well with the clouds. I would have burned it a little more, 7</td>', 'excellent conversion using the entire range of tones, Nice composition. My only niggle is that the smoke blends in too well with the clouds. I would have burned it a little more, 7', '2010-01-27 21:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
