(5839089, 848935, 63398, '<td valign="top">A most appealing angle and perspective. A lovely model, too.....6</td>', 'A most appealing angle and perspective. A lovely model, too.....6', '2010-01-27 21:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839090, 848420, 2333, '<td valign="top">What a surreal seascape, mad all the more so by the long exposure. Beautifully captured.<br/>You have done a great job on post on this... just the right amount of sharpness. There is a hint of posterization in the sky, which is ever so hard to avoid in a very smoothly graduated blue sky.It is just barely apparent in the final image (it appears mostly in the red channel, less in the green, and just visible in the blue)</td>', 'What a surreal seascape, mad all the more so by the long exposure. Beautifully captured.You have done a great job on post on this... just the right amount of sharpness. There is a hint of posterization in the sky, which is ever so hard to avoid in a very smoothly graduated blue sky.It is just barely apparent in the final image (it appears mostly in the red channel, less in the green, and just visible in the blue)', '2010-01-27 21:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839093, 847484, 63398, '<td valign="top">An interesting statue. I would have liked to have seen a less tight crop....6</td>', 'An interesting statue. I would have liked to have seen a less tight crop....6', '2010-01-27 21:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839096, 848786, 63398, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting &amp; DOF.....6</td>', 'Nice lighting & DOF.....6', '2010-01-27 21:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839098, 848340, 2333, '<td valign="top">well seen, well shot, and well processed. Perfect retention of detail without any oversharpening. Kudos.</td>', 'well seen, well shot, and well processed. Perfect retention of detail without any oversharpening. Kudos.', '2010-01-27 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839104, 848568, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, its a kind of shot in the setting i really like.. I wish the train was moving and you had cropped a little more on the left.. one hand covered and other open is kind of creating an unbalance! 7</td>', 'Beautiful composition, its a kind of shot in the setting i really like.. I wish the train was moving and you had cropped a little more on the left.. one hand covered and other open is kind of creating an unbalance! 7', '2010-01-27 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839110, 847312, 42256, '<td valign="top">great stop motion! Love the droplets of the wave all over the picture. IMO the centered surfer is making the shot less appealing, a little more water to the right would have shown me the complete wave formation and added a wow element to the shot! 6</td>', 'great stop motion! Love the droplets of the wave all over the picture. IMO the centered surfer is making the shot less appealing, a little more water to the right would have shown me the complete wave formation and added a wow element to the shot! 6', '2010-01-27 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839112, 848880, 63398, '<td valign="top">Lovely vista despite the ominous sky.....6</td>', 'Lovely vista despite the ominous sky.....6', '2010-01-27 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839113, 847932, 2333, '<td valign="top">What an unusual winter scene... the white frost on the trees, the fog, the vivid reds and blues of the foreground and sky. <br/>Very nice choice of viewpoint and composition, and very good post processing. I do detect a small amount of haloing on the foreground tree branches against the sky, perhaps dial back sharpening just a tad.</td>', 'What an unusual winter scene... the white frost on the trees, the fog, the vivid reds and blues of the foreground and sky. Very nice choice of viewpoint and composition, and very good post processing. I do detect a small amount of haloing on the foreground tree branches against the sky, perhaps dial back sharpening just a tad.', '2010-01-27 21:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839114, 847546, 63398, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but it''s an intriguing image.....6</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but it''s an intriguing image.....6', '2010-01-27 21:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839117, 847069, 63398, '<td valign="top">That''s just COOL!!!.....7</td>', 'That''s just COOL!!!.....7', '2010-01-27 21:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839121, 848495, 2333, '<td valign="top">This is a positively wonderful street candid. your timing was drop-dead perfect. Love the tones of your final image; nice choice there.</td>', 'This is a positively wonderful street candid. your timing was drop-dead perfect. Love the tones of your final image; nice choice there.', '2010-01-27 21:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839123, 848312, 42256, '<td valign="top">i love the colors and clarity in the shot.. and that man looking inside what seems like a garbage can is just adding so much too the shot.. Don''t know if the people in the shot are posing .. but you have done a great job at finding the right place and right time to shoot! 8</td>', 'i love the colors and clarity in the shot.. and that man looking inside what seems like a garbage can is just adding so much too the shot.. Don''t know if the people in the shot are posing .. but you have done a great job at finding the right place and right time to shoot! 8', '2010-01-27 21:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839124, 848800, 63398, '<td valign="top">I *really* like this, but it bugs me that his arm is chopped off....6</td>', 'I *really* like this, but it bugs me that his arm is chopped off....6', '2010-01-27 21:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839136, 848932, 63398, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like lifelong friends......6</td>', 'Kind of looks like lifelong friends......6', '2010-01-27 21:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
