(5839753, 848576, 93565, '<td valign="top">Good control of depth of field. I can''t decide if I''d prefer to have the antennae in focus or not. I''d like them in focus, but I also like the focus on the arm and face. Good insect shot.</td>', 'Good control of depth of field. I can''t decide if I''d prefer to have the antennae in focus or not. I''d like them in focus, but I also like the focus on the arm and face. Good insect shot.', '2010-01-28 05:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
