(5839766, 848340, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve captured so many picturesque elements of landscapes in one scene. The river, the peaks, the dynamic clouds and the evergreen forest all combine together quite nicely. Looks like a tiny bit of the mountain and the river a slightly blown but it''s a minor issue. Good job.</td>', 'I like how you''ve captured so many picturesque elements of landscapes in one scene. The river, the peaks, the dynamic clouds and the evergreen forest all combine together quite nicely. Looks like a tiny bit of the mountain and the river a slightly blown but it''s a minor issue. Good job.', '2010-01-28 05:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839767, 847230, 93565, '<td valign="top">That background is just way too powerful. It overwhelms things.</td>', 'That background is just way too powerful. It overwhelms things.', '2010-01-28 05:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839769, 848636, 86218, '<td valign="top">Shhhhhtupified. This is sssshhtunning. Best Macro I have seen in a long time. Truly the best. I wonder what more depth would have done for this in the wings? Still I cant fault it on that and this effect works as well. 9</td>', 'Shhhhhtupified. This is sssshhtunning. Best Macro I have seen in a long time. Truly the best. I wonder what more depth would have done for this in the wings? Still I cant fault it on that and this effect works as well. 9', '2010-01-28 05:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839770, 847093, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting- it trails off very nicely into the hood, and gives it an edgy sort of feel to it. I think it also intensifies her stare quite well. Nice pose as well.</td>', 'Very nice lighting- it trails off very nicely into the hood, and gives it an edgy sort of feel to it. I think it also intensifies her stare quite well. Nice pose as well.', '2010-01-28 05:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839772, 848734, 86218, '<td valign="top">Art, true art. I would also like to see this in b&amp;W - rare  10. say no more</td>', 'Art, true art. I would also like to see this in b&W - rare  10. say no more', '2010-01-28 05:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839774, 848449, 93565, '<td valign="top">This would be a lot stronger if the background didn''t take such a prominent role.</td>', 'This would be a lot stronger if the background didn''t take such a prominent role.', '2010-01-28 05:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839779, 848564, 79955, '<td valign="top">The color cast is very strong on my screen , if that was the intention , then it doesn''t quite appeal to me, sorry , 5, but I do like his expression.</td>', 'The color cast is very strong on my screen , if that was the intention , then it doesn''t quite appeal to me, sorry , 5, but I do like his expression.', '2010-01-28 05:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
