(5839783, 848317, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice architectural abstract. It seems ever so minutely skewed, but this is a miniscule amount. Nice hues and textures. One of my higher votes so far.</td>', 'Very nice architectural abstract. It seems ever so minutely skewed, but this is a miniscule amount. Nice hues and textures. One of my higher votes so far.', '2010-01-28 05:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
