(5839789, 848636, 93565, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a very good job of taking a favorite DPC subject and changing things up quite nicely. The dew is very cool, especially the manner in which it clings to the wings and dragonfly''s hair. The silhouette is also nice, especially the way that the foliage has a nice rim light.</td>', 'You''ve done a very good job of taking a favorite DPC subject and changing things up quite nicely. The dew is very cool, especially the manner in which it clings to the wings and dragonfly''s hair. The silhouette is also nice, especially the way that the foliage has a nice rim light.', '2010-01-28 05:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839790, 848326, 79955, '<td valign="top">reasonably good edit , warm with nice details. The randomness of the people in the shot gives this a snashot like feel. Don''t get me wrong , this is definitely better than a snapshot. As an example , I wish the rest of the visitors were not there with the exception of the couple sitting down. , 6</td>', 'reasonably good edit , warm with nice details. The randomness of the people in the shot gives this a snashot like feel. Don''t get me wrong , this is definitely better than a snapshot. As an example , I wish the rest of the visitors were not there with the exception of the couple sitting down. , 6', '2010-01-28 05:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839791, 847932, 79955, '<td valign="top">The colors are strong enough to make this shot attractive to the viewer , good job. 8</td>', 'The colors are strong enough to make this shot attractive to the viewer , good job. 8', '2010-01-28 05:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839792, 848851, 79955, '<td valign="top">Love your edit here, 7</td>', 'Love your edit here, 7', '2010-01-28 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839794, 848816, 93565, '<td valign="top">The grandness of the scene, and the overwhelming vastness, is captured very well by your lone silhouette perched upon the outcropping.</td>', 'The grandness of the scene, and the overwhelming vastness, is captured very well by your lone silhouette perched upon the outcropping.', '2010-01-28 05:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
