(5839796, 847231, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very grainy, and I''m not feeling a real connection between grain and your subject matter. Nice looking little day gecko you''ve got though.</td>', 'Very grainy, and I''m not feeling a real connection between grain and your subject matter. Nice looking little day gecko you''ve got though.', '2010-01-28 05:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839797, 847530, 93565, '<td valign="top">Another interesting dragonfly photo... You''ve nearly taken this into the realm of a complete abstract. I wonder if you missed your focal point or intended to do this; regardless it doesn''t matter, because I like the outcome. Good job.</td>', 'Another interesting dragonfly photo... You''ve nearly taken this into the realm of a complete abstract. I wonder if you missed your focal point or intended to do this; regardless it doesn''t matter, because I like the outcome. Good job.', '2010-01-28 05:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
