(5839853, 847229, 67152, '<td valign="top">these owls are so intense - i love the focus you have on the bird - just be careful with combining layers.  the edge of the blurred background is very noticeable, especially on the left side of the image.</td>', 'these owls are so intense - i love the focus you have on the bird - just be careful with combining layers.  the edge of the blurred background is very noticeable, especially on the left side of the image.', '2010-01-28 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839854, 847235, 63398, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word as far as the title goes; I don''t get it, but this is an excellent portrait......7</td>', 'I''ll take your word as far as the title goes; I don''t get it, but this is an excellent portrait......7', '2010-01-28 06:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839855, 848420, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but as it has become a bit of a common shot here, something along these lines has to be completely outstanding in some fashion to impress me, and I''m afraid this one doesn''t have anything in particular that makes me stop and go wow.<br/> <br/>I recognize it''s a good shot, but unfortunately it''s a type of shot that we see so much of now that it almost becomes mundane.</td>', 'This is nice, but as it has become a bit of a common shot here, something along these lines has to be completely outstanding in some fashion to impress me, and I''m afraid this one doesn''t have anything in particular that makes me stop and go wow. I recognize it''s a good shot, but unfortunately it''s a type of shot that we see so much of now that it almost becomes mundane.', '2010-01-28 06:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839857, 847091, 63398, '<td valign="top">Intriguing swirls. Well captured....7</td>', 'Intriguing swirls. Well captured....7', '2010-01-28 06:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
