(5840020, 848856, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice high key, I like the fact you can just make out the line of the bath along the left hand side and then it just fades into the white, nice effect.</td>', 'Nice high key, I like the fact you can just make out the line of the bath along the left hand side and then it just fades into the white, nice effect.', '2010-01-28 07:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840022, 848800, 101117, '<td valign="top">The combination of things in this shot don''t really make sense to me. Is there a significance to the door? I can''t tell what it is but it''s there and I''m assuming you didn''t just forget to close it. Then the right arm is cropped for no particular reason that I can tell while the door is taking a full third in the right of the frame, I''m afraid either I just don''t get this shot or there''s a lot wrong with it.</td>', 'The combination of things in this shot don''t really make sense to me. Is there a significance to the door? I can''t tell what it is but it''s there and I''m assuming you didn''t just forget to close it. Then the right arm is cropped for no particular reason that I can tell while the door is taking a full third in the right of the frame, I''m afraid either I just don''t get this shot or there''s a lot wrong with it.', '2010-01-28 07:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840023, 847728, 63398, '<td valign="top">Heck of an angle. Something seems just a tad off to me with the light......6</td>', 'Heck of an angle. Something seems just a tad off to me with the light......6', '2010-01-28 07:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
