(5840025, 848485, 101117, '<td valign="top">This just feels like a photograph of a pet to me, and I''m afraid photographically it doesn''t seem outstanding at all.<br/> <br/>The front on flash is probably what''s giving it the "snapshot" feeling, with the harsh reflections from both the dog and the surrounding details.</td>', 'This just feels like a photograph of a pet to me, and I''m afraid photographically it doesn''t seem outstanding at all. The front on flash is probably what''s giving it the "snapshot" feeling, with the harsh reflections from both the dog and the surrounding details.', '2010-01-28 07:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
