(5840032, 847069, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a bit strange, and in interesting choice for a "Best Of..." entry.<br/> <br/>I saw the cat fairly quickly, but as I look at it longer, it starts to take on a much more sinister quality for some reason. Now I''m imagining it in the context of someone hiding behind the brown thing (curtain?) and the evil cat just having found them.</td>', 'This is a bit strange, and in interesting choice for a "Best Of..." entry. I saw the cat fairly quickly, but as I look at it longer, it starts to take on a much more sinister quality for some reason. Now I''m imagining it in the context of someone hiding behind the brown thing (curtain?) and the evil cat just having found them.', '2010-01-28 07:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840033, 848357, 63398, '<td valign="top">IMNSHO, a slightly different angle more across the loom eliminating the gap on the right would have made a great deal of difference.....just subjectively, of course.....5</td>', 'IMNSHO, a slightly different angle more across the loom eliminating the gap on the right would have made a great deal of difference.....just subjectively, of course.....5', '2010-01-28 07:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
