(5840051, 848521, 63398, '<td valign="top">Curious....interesting composition.....5</td>', 'Curious....interesting composition.....5', '2010-01-28 07:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840052, 847907, 63398, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject &amp; DOF.....5</td>', 'Interesting subject & DOF.....5', '2010-01-28 07:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840053, 847728, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice, but way too heavy handed on the processing, especially apparent in the cloud area.</td>', 'This is quite nice, but way too heavy handed on the processing, especially apparent in the cloud area.', '2010-01-28 07:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840054, 848695, 101117, '<td valign="top">HA, fun perspective, great use of wide angle, made me laugh the second I saw it!</td>', 'HA, fun perspective, great use of wide angle, made me laugh the second I saw it!', '2010-01-28 07:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840057, 848935, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice model shot. Not too keen on the blurring in the lower half, which looks like it was added in processing to me (either that or it was taken with a lensbaby), but the face is very well done and it''s a nice change to see an expression that isn''t a forced smile.</td>', 'Nice model shot. Not too keen on the blurring in the lower half, which looks like it was added in processing to me (either that or it was taken with a lensbaby), but the face is very well done and it''s a nice change to see an expression that isn''t a forced smile.', '2010-01-28 07:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840059, 848788, 101117, '<td valign="top">Weird proportions, not sure what''s going on here, it feels like the whole landscape is being sucked into some sort of vortex. Perhaps it''s just the cloud movement, perhaps I''m just up too late commenting, but it''s one bizarre effect!</td>', 'Weird proportions, not sure what''s going on here, it feels like the whole landscape is being sucked into some sort of vortex. Perhaps it''s just the cloud movement, perhaps I''m just up too late commenting, but it''s one bizarre effect!', '2010-01-28 07:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840060, 847229, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great details, love the red eyes.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing you''ve artificially blurred the background, and it wasn''t initially obvious, but on looking at it for a bit I started to notice the cut off point, especially around the left hand side, there''s a clear line running down there where I''m guessing you selected the blur area.</td>', 'Great details, love the red eyes. I''m guessing you''ve artificially blurred the background, and it wasn''t initially obvious, but on looking at it for a bit I started to notice the cut off point, especially around the left hand side, there''s a clear line running down there where I''m guessing you selected the blur area.', '2010-01-28 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840061, 847932, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great effect, love the way the road fades off almost but not quite into the fog just as it reaches the corner. Great colours too.</td>', 'Great effect, love the way the road fades off almost but not quite into the fog just as it reaches the corner. Great colours too.', '2010-01-28 07:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840064, 847733, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not really a big fan of selective desats in general, and while this is one of the better uses of it, I still don''t like it particularly. All B&amp;W or all colour and I would probably have preferred this.</td>', 'Not really a big fan of selective desats in general, and while this is one of the better uses of it, I still don''t like it particularly. All B&W or all colour and I would probably have preferred this.', '2010-01-28 07:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840066, 848863, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, almost appeared abstract at first until I started to make out details. I only looked at your title secondary and it''s a brave subject to approach.<br/> <br/>I''m wondering how you got the effect, it almost has a double exposure feel to it as if on film, but since this is digital photography, I''m guessing it was down to camera movement.<br/> <br/>I like it, though I don''t think the shot itself has as much impact as it should relative to your title. For me it''s more of an abstract portrait.</td>', 'Interesting shot, almost appeared abstract at first until I started to make out details. I only looked at your title secondary and it''s a brave subject to approach. I''m wondering how you got the effect, it almost has a double exposure feel to it as if on film, but since this is digital photography, I''m guessing it was down to camera movement. I like it, though I don''t think the shot itself has as much impact as it should relative to your title. For me it''s more of an abstract portrait.', '2010-01-28 07:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840067, 848885, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this will have a nice family appeal, but what''s off putting for me is the glow surrounding the three children. I get the emphasis and the soft look, but it feels overdone and it actually cheapens what would otherwise be a good shot for me.</td>', 'I''m sure this will have a nice family appeal, but what''s off putting for me is the glow surrounding the three children. I get the emphasis and the soft look, but it feels overdone and it actually cheapens what would otherwise be a good shot for me.', '2010-01-28 07:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840069, 847842, 101117, '<td valign="top">There really is a lot of green here! It''s actually a really well done shot, the green on green with the little splashes of red works well, though I''m not sure how long I could look at it for as it''s a slightly luminous green!</td>', 'There really is a lot of green here! It''s actually a really well done shot, the green on green with the little splashes of red works well, though I''m not sure how long I could look at it for as it''s a slightly luminous green!', '2010-01-28 07:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840072, 848469, 101117, '<td valign="top">This has a very old feel about it, reminds me of the shots you would always see of the shipyards in Glasgow when I was a young boy. Nicely handled for what I would imagine was a tricky exposure, and I like the B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'This has a very old feel about it, reminds me of the shots you would always see of the shipyards in Glasgow when I was a young boy. Nicely handled for what I would imagine was a tricky exposure, and I like the B&W conversion.', '2010-01-28 07:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840075, 848350, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the distortion. It really fits against that mean looking sky.</td>', 'Love the distortion. It really fits against that mean looking sky.', '2010-01-28 07:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840076, 848933, 100831, '<td valign="top">Those greens are to die for. What a shot!</td>', 'Those greens are to die for. What a shot!', '2010-01-28 07:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840077, 847762, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is my sort of shot! It''s one of those really strange ones where there''s a whole lot of seemingly unconnected things going on but in some strange way are all related.<br/> <br/>Each item in this shot has it''s own interest, and for me I keep coming back to the arrow, what does it represent, who drew it there, what it is pointing to / from? The fact that it leads backwards to a dogs rear end is funny.</td>', 'This is my sort of shot! It''s one of those really strange ones where there''s a whole lot of seemingly unconnected things going on but in some strange way are all related. Each item in this shot has it''s own interest, and for me I keep coming back to the arrow, what does it represent, who drew it there, what it is pointing to / from? The fact that it leads backwards to a dogs rear end is funny.', '2010-01-28 07:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840078, 847324, 100831, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous reflection and I like the way the scene rolls to the back. So to speak. Lovely colors too.</td>', 'Gorgeous reflection and I like the way the scene rolls to the back. So to speak. Lovely colors too.', '2010-01-28 07:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840079, 848415, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I don''t particularly like the framing you''ve added. On the other hand, if it had been an actual large wooden frame, that would be a very different matter!</td>', 'I like the shot, but I don''t particularly like the framing you''ve added. On the other hand, if it had been an actual large wooden frame, that would be a very different matter!', '2010-01-28 07:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840080, 848915, 100831, '<td valign="top">Oh so sweet. Lovely little pile of fur balls warming themselves in the sunshine.</td>', 'Oh so sweet. Lovely little pile of fur balls warming themselves in the sunshine.', '2010-01-28 07:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840082, 848883, 101117, '<td valign="top">Either he really loves doing that, or he really needs the money!<br/> <br/>Great scene, the timing is good, but for me that''s only a minor part of a much larger nice shot.</td>', 'Either he really loves doing that, or he really needs the money! Great scene, the timing is good, but for me that''s only a minor part of a much larger nice shot.', '2010-01-28 07:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840084, 848766, 101117, '<td valign="top">Ha, I love the isolation and they way they are all huddled together looking different directions. You can just see the conversion, "Ingrid, it all looks the same to me, are you sure we''re going the right way?".</td>', 'Ha, I love the isolation and they way they are all huddled together looking different directions. You can just see the conversion, "Ingrid, it all looks the same to me, are you sure we''re going the right way?".', '2010-01-28 07:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840085, 847230, 101117, '<td valign="top">I think the strong yellow background really detracts from an otherwise nice shot here.</td>', 'I think the strong yellow background really detracts from an otherwise nice shot here.', '2010-01-28 07:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
