(5840114, 848340, 86218, '<td valign="top">Wow. Would love to see the original of this. feel its maybe worked a bit to much especially the trees. Super comp and mood here though. Still a 8 from me. Would really appreciate if you were to give some feedback as to your processing here.</td>', 'Wow. Would love to see the original of this. feel its maybe worked a bit to much especially the trees. Super comp and mood here though. Still a 8 from me. Would really appreciate if you were to give some feedback as to your processing here.', '2010-01-28 08:09:25.000000', NULL, 1);
