(5840489, 847533, 100831, '<td valign="top">Exquisite little portrait - she is super cute! I like the direct look and sort of a smile.</td>', 'Exquisite little portrait - she is super cute! I like the direct look and sort of a smile.', '2010-01-28 12:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
