(5840513, 847169, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the colors and shapes of these light fixtures. This is an interesting study in colors, shapes and lines. I like how you present this in an interesting angle, but I don''t think you got the angle presentation nearly enough to make these fixtures visually pop off of their space. Yes, I know angle can be tough and what I am about to suggest *may* have been impossible. However, the lines of the tall building in the backdrop -compete- and distract from the lines and shapes of those cool light fixtures. If possible - get a straight up shot at that larger fixture on the top portion of this photo so that there is nothing but sky behind it. To me, that larger fixture on the upper portion first struck me as something seen on planetary star charts or planetary orbit trajectories. I know your title is making the allusion that all these fixtures are blasting off into space, but my eyes cannot help but be drawn to that one on the top portion. The full circular shapes and spectacular yellow/orange hues really capture my eye; would make a great abstract in a squared presentation btw. Nonetheless a slightly above average shot that shows a lot of imagination and an eye for looking at new angles to show off the beauty in what many would pass by everyday without blinking an eye.</td>', 'Wow, I love the colors and shapes of these light fixtures. This is an interesting study in colors, shapes and lines. I like how you present this in an interesting angle, but I don''t think you got the angle presentation nearly enough to make these fixtures visually pop off of their space. Yes, I know angle can be tough and what I am about to suggest *may* have been impossible. However, the lines of the tall building in the backdrop -compete- and distract from the lines and shapes of those cool light fixtures. If possible - get a straight up shot at that larger fixture on the top portion of this photo so that there is nothing but sky behind it. To me, that larger fixture on the upper portion first struck me as something seen on planetary star charts or planetary orbit trajectories. I know your title is making the allusion that all these fixtures are blasting off into space, but my eyes cannot help but be drawn to that one on the top portion. The full circular shapes and spectacular yellow/orange hues really capture my eye; would make a great abstract in a squared presentation btw. Nonetheless a slightly above average shot that shows a lot of imagination and an eye for looking at new angles to show off the beauty in what many would pass by everyday without blinking an eye.', '2010-01-28 12:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840523, 848328, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very surreal look to this. Took me a while to realize what the purple things probably are. Balloons inside the room behind you? Extra pointage for making me stop to examine it closer.</td>', 'A very surreal look to this. Took me a while to realize what the purple things probably are. Balloons inside the room behind you? Extra pointage for making me stop to examine it closer.', '2010-01-28 12:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840524, 848082, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice smile! Great looking child and the black and white is very well done.</td>', 'Nice smile! Great looking child and the black and white is very well done.', '2010-01-28 12:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840530, 847875, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely comp and light. 8</td>', 'Lovely comp and light. 8', '2010-01-28 12:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840531, 847324, 86218, '<td valign="top">A bit overprocessed for my taste for this to be able to enjoy the natural beauty of this. Nice scene though</td>', 'A bit overprocessed for my taste for this to be able to enjoy the natural beauty of this. Nice scene though', '2010-01-28 12:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840533, 847087, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to get a grasp of where you must have been to get this - it''s a stunning view!</td>', 'I''m trying to get a grasp of where you must have been to get this - it''s a stunning view!', '2010-01-28 12:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840534, 847408, 86218, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate your comp and intention here. This maybe needs to be in b&amp;W and it would be even better</td>', 'I can appreciate your comp and intention here. This maybe needs to be in b&W and it would be even better', '2010-01-28 12:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840536, 847984, 86218, '<td valign="top">Love the different approach here. The chin going up and the shapes really has one staring...just to find myself being stared at.</td>', 'Love the different approach here. The chin going up and the shapes really has one staring...just to find myself being stared at.', '2010-01-28 12:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840538, 848559, 83313, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t have a huge amount of the magical "wow-factor" that everyone talks about, but there is something about this shot that really grabs me. The slight blur implies that I am viewing this from a moving train and examining the details of the city as it goes past my window. Well done.</td>', 'It doesn''t have a huge amount of the magical "wow-factor" that everyone talks about, but there is something about this shot that really grabs me. The slight blur implies that I am viewing this from a moving train and examining the details of the city as it goes past my window. Well done.', '2010-01-28 12:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840540, 847358, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Lighting works perfectly here. Eyes are well lit and posture of eagle good.</td>', 'Very nice. Lighting works perfectly here. Eyes are well lit and posture of eagle good.', '2010-01-28 12:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840542, 848835, 100831, '<td valign="top">Coming from New York as I do, the first thing I notice is how uncluttered everything is. Where is all the traffic and people and how is it so clean?</td>', 'Coming from New York as I do, the first thing I notice is how uncluttered everything is. Where is all the traffic and people and how is it so clean?', '2010-01-28 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840544, 848834, 86218, '<td valign="top">This scene makes me wonder more and raise more questions and would love to see what they are working at. yes - pulling in a net but they are to minor in the big scene of this pic to hold the attention</td>', 'This scene makes me wonder more and raise more questions and would love to see what they are working at. yes - pulling in a net but they are to minor in the big scene of this pic to hold the attention', '2010-01-28 12:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840545, 847252, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty feel to this, accentuated by the absence of light.</td>', 'I like the gritty feel to this, accentuated by the absence of light.', '2010-01-28 12:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840546, 847535, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, but using the entire 800 pixels available to you would have shown off so much more of that great detail. (I''m probably not the first to leave that comment.)</td>', 'Wonderful shot, but using the entire 800 pixels available to you would have shown off so much more of that great detail. (I''m probably not the first to leave that comment.)', '2010-01-28 12:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
