(5840550, 847866, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and yet a pity about the water/rain ruining this view of the bolt hitting the tower. I would want either or but now am liking the abstract part but curious about the potential of a clear shot.</td>', 'Nice abstract and yet a pity about the water/rain ruining this view of the bolt hitting the tower. I would want either or but now am liking the abstract part but curious about the potential of a clear shot.', '2010-01-28 13:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840551, 848030, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like some harsh lighting, and that is what is holding this pic back some for me. Of course, with the kittens between your legs, there was no opportunity to adjust lighting. Otherwise it is a good capture of a cute moment.</td>', 'Looks like some harsh lighting, and that is what is holding this pic back some for me. Of course, with the kittens between your legs, there was no opportunity to adjust lighting. Otherwise it is a good capture of a cute moment.', '2010-01-28 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
