(5840562, 848494, 112739, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot. The sand flowing down looks like water, but then it''s hard to imagine sand flowing without some sort of source. Very interesting.</td>', 'What a cool shot. The sand flowing down looks like water, but then it''s hard to imagine sand flowing without some sort of source. Very interesting.', '2010-01-28 13:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840571, 848022, 83313, '<td valign="top">Talk about a picture being worth 1000 words! Great capture of a moment that I think many women will identify with. Hope it does well for you. I''ll do my part to help it.</td>', 'Talk about a picture being worth 1000 words! Great capture of a moment that I think many women will identify with. Hope it does well for you. I''ll do my part to help it.', '2010-01-28 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
