(5840729, 848682, 98647, '<td valign="top">Okay. It seems you''re trying to appeal to two different demographics with this shot, and the title works in this regard. I personally would have voted you higher if you had only one of them in the shot. My preference would be to eliminate the girl because I think the old man against the old door makes more of a statement. Of course the men out there would much rather see the eye candy.</td>', 'Okay. It seems you''re trying to appeal to two different demographics with this shot, and the title works in this regard. I personally would have voted you higher if you had only one of them in the shot. My preference would be to eliminate the girl because I think the old man against the old door makes more of a statement. Of course the men out there would much rather see the eye candy.', '2010-01-28 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840730, 848467, 98647, '<td valign="top">This looks like a picture from the books I used to read as a child. Maybe not too DPC worthy but it definitely tells a story.</td>', 'This looks like a picture from the books I used to read as a child. Maybe not too DPC worthy but it definitely tells a story.', '2010-01-28 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
