(5841273, 847992, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, but a bit too much processing has left it overdetailed and instead of seeing and appreciating the whole scene, I find myself constantly distracted by the little details in the rocks, sky, water etc.</td>', 'Nice landscape, but a bit too much processing has left it overdetailed and instead of seeing and appreciating the whole scene, I find myself constantly distracted by the little details in the rocks, sky, water etc.', '2010-01-28 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841280, 848312, 101117, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this shot, must have been way back at the start of the year and really liking it then, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> if I remember right.<br/> <br/>There''s so much to look at in this shot, it''s like all little parts of life happening at the same time, but my favorite part has got to be the really obscure stance the girl is taking the photo from, and the photo she''s taking of that guy with the bored expression!</td>', 'I remember seeing this shot, must have been way back at the start of the year and really liking it then,  Melethia if I remember right. There''s so much to look at in this shot, it''s like all little parts of life happening at the same time, but my favorite part has got to be the really obscure stance the girl is taking the photo from, and the photo she''s taking of that guy with the bored expression!', '2010-01-28 18:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841281, 847191, 101117, '<td valign="top">If only she was looking up at the camera with everything else the same, this would have been perfect!</td>', 'If only she was looking up at the camera with everything else the same, this would have been perfect!', '2010-01-28 18:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
