(5842461, 848725, 63918, '<td valign="top">Last place??? Wow!!!<br/>It appears that the majority puts a heavily weighted emphasis on technical issues rather than getting the emotion impact of the image<br/>Going for a different look here, the shallow focus is selective and is in the plane of the mouth and nose. It is not out of focus. <br/>For the ones that don''t get the composition, the rule of thirds isn''t always necessary. <br/>Okay... the grain/noise was a bit much and the color could have been a little cleaner but.....<br/>LAST PLACE???? .... out of 444???<br/>Unbelievable.......<br/>I think it is time to take my ball and bat and go home....<br/> <br/>P.S. I do thank the ones who "got it". RianBotes'' comment was dead on target. And actually, if you want to knock it to a 5 for technical or personal issues, I don''t have a real problem<br/>with that. It is just the 4 and below scores that seem over the top... or is it under the top?<br/> <br/>Ah.... well ... maybe next time I can get in the top 425. That''s my new DPC goal.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-29 23:48:15.</i></td>', 'Last place??? Wow!!!It appears that the majority puts a heavily weighted emphasis on technical issues rather than getting the emotion impact of the imageGoing for a different look here, the shallow focus is selective and is in the plane of the mouth and nose. It is not out of focus. For the ones that don''t get the composition, the rule of thirds isn''t always necessary. Okay... the grain/noise was a bit much and the color could have been a little cleaner but.....LAST PLACE???? .... out of 444???Unbelievable.......I think it is time to take my ball and bat and go home.... P.S. I do thank the ones who "got it". RianBotes'' comment was dead on target. And actually, if you want to knock it to a 5 for technical or personal issues, I don''t have a real problemwith that. It is just the 4 and below scores that seem over the top... or is it under the top? Ah.... well ... maybe next time I can get in the top 425. That''s my new DPC goal.', '2010-01-29 00:31:17.000000', '2010-01-29 23:48:15.000000', 0),
(5842462, 848312, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know, I thought this was going to be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=13688" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">muur88</a> shot.  I thought it was staged too.  I loved all the stories in this shot!  What a fond little farewell photo too.  Should have scored higher!</td>', 'You know, I thought this was going to be a  muur88 shot.  I thought it was staged too.  I loved all the stories in this shot!  What a fond little farewell photo too.  Should have scored higher!', '2010-01-29 00:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
