(5842611, 848273, 69008, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty brave to enter a P&amp;S image in a best of challenge. I like the color spread of the foreground fire light and the deep blue of the sky in this. Glad you got to go there to get this shot. I was at Little Torch Key later that week for the sport lobster season.</td>', 'That''s pretty brave to enter a P&S image in a best of challenge. I like the color spread of the foreground fire light and the deep blue of the sky in this. Glad you got to go there to get this shot. I was at Little Torch Key later that week for the sport lobster season.', '2010-01-29 02:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
