(5842621, 847847, 69008, '<td valign="top">I think that the lay of the clouds makes the horizon look a little out of level, even though on close inspection, it actually is level. <br/> I remember seeing the effect that you mention in your comment when I was up there on vacation in the summer.  The processing looks a little hard, but that makes for a very moody looking scene overall, which is ok with me.</td>', 'I think that the lay of the clouds makes the horizon look a little out of level, even though on close inspection, it actually is level.  I remember seeing the effect that you mention in your comment when I was up there on vacation in the summer.  The processing looks a little hard, but that makes for a very moody looking scene overall, which is ok with me.', '2010-01-29 02:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
