(5842643, 848481, 30214, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 5 Janine! Beautiful rendering! I remember this particular view very well, actually I am pretty sure I have a photo of it somewhere in my archive from last January, could have submitted it too :).<br/> <br/>ETA: Oh yes, found it, I actually had in in January''09 FS :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=759270" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/976/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_759270.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/976/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_759270.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/976/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_759270.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-29 14:16:27.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the top 5 Janine! Beautiful rendering! I remember this particular view very well, actually I am pretty sure I have a photo of it somewhere in my archive from last January, could have submitted it too :). ETA: Oh yes, found it, I actually had in in January''09 FS :)', '2010-01-29 02:55:13.000000', '2010-01-29 14:16:27.000000', 0),
