(5842965, 847136, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh I remember that scene!  Were you able to get something this stunning that day we were there?  Man, if it was from that day, you are the MASTER at using your photography skills to compensate for less-than-perfect conditions.  All my photos from that day were all blown out and looked like. . .like Texas in the summer.  This is BEAUTIFUL!</td>', 'Ohhhh I remember that scene!  Were you able to get something this stunning that day we were there?  Man, if it was from that day, you are the MASTER at using your photography skills to compensate for less-than-perfect conditions.  All my photos from that day were all blown out and looked like. . .like Texas in the summer.  This is BEAUTIFUL!', '2010-01-29 09:27:34.000000', NULL, 0),
