(5842977, 847133, 67697, '<td valign="top">How appropriate that you saved a photo from Ireland as one of your best for 2009.  I''m sure it brings back fond memories to look at all your shots.  I''ve never been there but I will say that i would not have expected to see a scene like this.  The cloud-covered green rolling hills (mountains, whatever, etc.) is so beautiful!</td>', 'How appropriate that you saved a photo from Ireland as one of your best for 2009.  I''m sure it brings back fond memories to look at all your shots.  I''ve never been there but I will say that i would not have expected to see a scene like this.  The cloud-covered green rolling hills (mountains, whatever, etc.) is so beautiful!', '2010-01-29 09:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5842980, 848810, 65234, '<td valign="top">Way underrated IMO.  My monitor is calibrated and I thought the detail was just perfect for a night shot.  And the deep blue of the sky is gorgeous, especially with that sprinkling of stars.  But then my own entry did miserably so maybe my opinion isn''t all that useful ;-)  I stand by my fave, though; this is one I will enjoy going back to look at.</td>', 'Way underrated IMO.  My monitor is calibrated and I thought the detail was just perfect for a night shot.  And the deep blue of the sky is gorgeous, especially with that sprinkling of stars.  But then my own entry did miserably so maybe my opinion isn''t all that useful ;-)  I stand by my fave, though; this is one I will enjoy going back to look at.', '2010-01-29 09:34:06.000000', NULL, 0),
