(5842998, 848725, 63918, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the input, y''all, and I am taking off the cloak of sulkiness and bringing back my ball and bat. <br/> <br/>.... and maybe there is some honor in being last... out of 444. We all have a different take on how we look at things and that''s okay.<br/> <br/>I am especially grateful for the momentousness of receiving a brown ribbon. Thanks, Yo, for pointing out how special it is!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-29 09:51:59.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the input, y''all, and I am taking off the cloak of sulkiness and bringing back my ball and bat.  .... and maybe there is some honor in being last... out of 444. We all have a different take on how we look at things and that''s okay. I am especially grateful for the momentousness of receiving a brown ribbon. Thanks, Yo, for pointing out how special it is!', '2010-01-29 09:47:19.000000', '2010-01-29 09:51:59.000000', 0),
