(5843027, 848810, 44877, '<td valign="top">I think you fell victim to the uncalibrated monitor, because on mine this looks fantastic. I gave it a six - and not more - because the colors could have popped a little more to make this more fabulous. So sorry it didn''t score higher.</td>', 'I think you fell victim to the uncalibrated monitor, because on mine this looks fantastic. I gave it a six - and not more - because the colors could have popped a little more to make this more fabulous. So sorry it didn''t score higher.', '2010-01-29 09:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
