(5843030, 848412, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol so you have a new model now.  funny, during voting, I wondered if this was yours.  my interpretation was of a homeless person seeking a little time with God.  The only thing I would like to have seen different is that she would be holding the rosary as if she were about to pray.  To me it looks like she is holding it so you can get it in the shot.  The processing works for me!</td>', 'lol so you have a new model now.  funny, during voting, I wondered if this was yours.  my interpretation was of a homeless person seeking a little time with God.  The only thing I would like to have seen different is that she would be holding the rosary as if she were about to pray.  To me it looks like she is holding it so you can get it in the shot.  The processing works for me!', '2010-01-29 09:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843031, 848229, 73564, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work..Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful work..Nice job!', '2010-01-29 09:59:19.000000', NULL, 0),
