(5843051, 848917, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB</b> <br/> <br/>LOL - did you appreciate all 27 of those splendid comments as this sweet image was being voted on?  And then, later, two more and a favorite!  <br/> <br/>Well, I hope you had your scores turned off (yeah, sure) because the 5.6653 just doesn''t match up.  What happened?  Having lost my crystal ball some time ago, I don''t know.  <br/> <br/>There is little to ''critique'' in this fine image.  Before I got to the main subject, as this appeared on my screen I was appreciating the fine detail on the weathered fence, then spotted that amazing expression on the amazing dog, and went Wow! The greenery just finished off the story in an appropriate way.<br/> <br/>It was a terrific find and a very good handling of the story-telling process along with the careful post processing details.<br/> <br/>Nicely done.   <br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB  LOL - did you appreciate all 27 of those splendid comments as this sweet image was being voted on?  And then, later, two more and a favorite!   Well, I hope you had your scores turned off (yeah, sure) because the 5.6653 just doesn''t match up.  What happened?  Having lost my crystal ball some time ago, I don''t know.   There is little to ''critique'' in this fine image.  Before I got to the main subject, as this appeared on my screen I was appreciating the fine detail on the weathered fence, then spotted that amazing expression on the amazing dog, and went Wow! The greenery just finished off the story in an appropriate way. It was a terrific find and a very good handling of the story-telling process along with the careful post processing details. Nicely done.    Alice', '2010-01-29 10:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843055, 848917, 67697, '<td valign="top">How hilarious that the owner did this for her lol.  She looks like a little kid with her head poking out like this.  What a sweetheart!</td>', 'How hilarious that the owner did this for her lol.  She looks like a little kid with her head poking out like this.  What a sweetheart!', '2010-01-29 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843058, 848412, 80096, '<td valign="top">This is a unique and different theme for you, I never would have guessed this was yours. A very compelling and poignant portrayal, Jaime, and very well done.</td>', 'This is a unique and different theme for you, I never would have guessed this was yours. A very compelling and poignant portrayal, Jaime, and very well done.', '2010-01-29 10:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843060, 847726, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB</b> <br/> <br/>This was a tough competition.  That''s the only reason I can think of for your image not receiving the "6" or better that it deserved.  (I gave it a 7 in competition)<br/> <br/>Your use of light and dark, your excellent composition including the placement of the reflections in the water, and overall feel of this image makes it a more than respectable entry in the ''best of...'' category.  <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.  <br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB  This was a tough competition.  That''s the only reason I can think of for your image not receiving the "6" or better that it deserved.  (I gave it a 7 in competition) Your use of light and dark, your excellent composition including the placement of the reflections in the water, and overall feel of this image makes it a more than respectable entry in the ''best of...'' category.   Keep up the good work.   Alice', '2010-01-29 10:14:18.000000', NULL, 0),
