(5843173, 848911, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  I''m glad that it won a ribbon!  <br/>Just two questions that I "have" to know now LOL  Was it rain or snow (my guess is rain given the background) and secondly, was this taken through a window? :)  Just curiosity now. :)</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  I''m glad that it won a ribbon!  Just two questions that I "have" to know now LOL  Was it rain or snow (my guess is rain given the background) and secondly, was this taken through a window? :)  Just curiosity now. :)', '2010-01-29 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843179, 848346, 28742, '<td valign="top">Put me in the half of the people who love the processing. :) This immediately brings to mind the story of Daniel in the Lion''s Den. Great job, Juliet!</td>', 'Put me in the half of the people who love the processing. :) This immediately brings to mind the story of Daniel in the Lion''s Den. Great job, Juliet!', '2010-01-29 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843183, 847249, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m saying this a lot -- this should have scored much higher. I gave it a 7 -- I think it''s wonderful! Great sign, fascinating connectors, ropes, etc. And if it''s a lensbaby, it''s one of the few that work for me. Very well done!</td>', 'Ok, I''m saying this a lot -- this should have scored much higher. I gave it a 7 -- I think it''s wonderful! Great sign, fascinating connectors, ropes, etc. And if it''s a lensbaby, it''s one of the few that work for me. Very well done!', '2010-01-29 11:09:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843184, 848481, 30861, '<td valign="top">The thing of it is, over and over and over and over again we see antelope canyon shots that are just so mundane, *for that place* that they make me weep. Mediocre light, clumsy processing, cliched point of view, the whole litany. But shot properly, it''s a place of exaltation. <br/> <br/>Your shot captures this sense of the place, extremely well, and I''m glad the voters recognized that.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'The thing of it is, over and over and over and over again we see antelope canyon shots that are just so mundane, *for that place* that they make me weep. Mediocre light, clumsy processing, cliched point of view, the whole litany. But shot properly, it''s a place of exaltation.  Your shot captures this sense of the place, extremely well, and I''m glad the voters recognized that. R.', '2010-01-29 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843185, 848539, 28742, '<td valign="top">A great shot, but you''re no <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16046" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">caba</a>. :P I would have gone with your other choice of photos, but based on the results in this challenge, it might not have placed much higher. Both great shots though. Any score over 6 in this challenge is something to be very proud of.</td>', 'A great shot, but you''re no  caba. :P I would have gone with your other choice of photos, but based on the results in this challenge, it might not have placed much higher. Both great shots though. Any score over 6 in this challenge is something to be very proud of.', '2010-01-29 11:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843186, 848831, 32767, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. Deserved better. Cheers!</td>', 'Really great shot. Deserved better. Cheers!', '2010-01-29 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843187, 848005, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like this, and the tourist do add quite a bit! Did you try cropping it in? When I scrolled down to enter this comment, I stopped when the sky disappeared and it just made me say "wow!!" The top part is so interesting, so I never would have thought about cropping it out, but when it scrolled off, the result was really interesting, I just had to share it.<br/> <br/>Anyway, fun spot and wonderful capture!</td>', 'I really like this, and the tourist do add quite a bit! Did you try cropping it in? When I scrolled down to enter this comment, I stopped when the sky disappeared and it just made me say "wow!!" The top part is so interesting, so I never would have thought about cropping it out, but when it scrolled off, the result was really interesting, I just had to share it. Anyway, fun spot and wonderful capture!', '2010-01-29 11:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843189, 848759, 28742, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot here, Jimmy! That thing looks absolutely prehistoric. Very tough competition, very solid score.</td>', 'Outstanding shot here, Jimmy! That thing looks absolutely prehistoric. Very tough competition, very solid score.', '2010-01-29 11:13:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843190, 848770, 68947, '<td valign="top">HA....I didn''t guess this was yours!  I should have though by the processing, B&amp;W and DOF LOL.  It''s a Colorcarnival "signature" piece.  Beautiful Michelle!  Love it and scored it high! :) Congrats on a higher placement in such a tough challenge.</td>', 'HA....I didn''t guess this was yours!  I should have though by the processing, B&W and DOF LOL.  It''s a Colorcarnival "signature" piece.  Beautiful Michelle!  Love it and scored it high! :) Congrats on a higher placement in such a tough challenge.', '2010-01-29 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843191, 848792, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and also loved your michael jackson shot. Everything is wonderful, especially the ripped nylons. Very well done!!</td>', 'I really like this shot and also loved your michael jackson shot. Everything is wonderful, especially the ripped nylons. Very well done!!', '2010-01-29 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843192, 848482, 28742, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful! Very good score - especially for this challenge.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful! Very good score - especially for this challenge.', '2010-01-29 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843194, 847063, 103142, '<td valign="top">This was so utterly bizarre; that''s what made it so interesting! It''s one of those shots that made you study it. I thought it was great!</td>', 'This was so utterly bizarre; that''s what made it so interesting! It''s one of those shots that made you study it. I thought it was great!', '2010-01-29 11:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843195, 847564, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning shot, Jo!  The clarity, the contrast and highlights, the cropping, masking...everything is beautiful! <br/> <br/>ETA:  I must find out (privately) how you got the petals over the border like that LOL! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-29 11:18:11.</i></td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning shot, Jo!  The clarity, the contrast and highlights, the cropping, masking...everything is beautiful!  ETA:  I must find out (privately) how you got the petals over the border like that LOL! :)', '2010-01-29 11:16:45.000000', '2010-01-29 11:18:11.000000', 0),
(5843196, 847133, 103142, '<td valign="top">Someone commented that it lacked a focal point so that the eye wandered. I think that''s the strength of this shot -- it makes you look deeper and take everything in. Not shot has to be about something specific. Sometimes it can be the sum total of everything! I like it quite a bit and enjoyed taking in the clouds, waves, rocks and letting my eye and mind wander. Well done!</td>', 'Someone commented that it lacked a focal point so that the eye wandered. I think that''s the strength of this shot -- it makes you look deeper and take everything in. Not shot has to be about something specific. Sometimes it can be the sum total of everything! I like it quite a bit and enjoyed taking in the clouds, waves, rocks and letting my eye and mind wander. Well done!', '2010-01-29 11:17:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843197, 847136, 28742, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Judy! Great score.</td>', 'Beautiful, Judy! Great score.', '2010-01-29 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843200, 848893, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think this should have finished much higher. It is a photo I can hear.</td>', 'I think this should have finished much higher. It is a photo I can hear.', '2010-01-29 11:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843202, 847200, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love the pair and love the background! The patterns really play havoc with your eyes if you''re sitting to close to the screen! :P<br/> <br/>What a wonderful scene.</td>', 'Love the pair and love the background! The patterns really play havoc with your eyes if you''re sitting to close to the screen! :P What a wonderful scene.', '2010-01-29 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843203, 848555, 28742, '<td valign="top">17+ minute exposure? Wow! Turned out beautiful. Apparently not enough overall visual impact to finish higher in this tough challenge. Great job though.</td>', '17+ minute exposure? Wow! Turned out beautiful. Apparently not enough overall visual impact to finish higher in this tough challenge. Great job though.', '2010-01-29 11:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843204, 847087, 81530, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. 9 from me.</td>', 'Lovely shot. 9 from me.', '2010-01-29 11:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843205, 848695, 103142, '<td valign="top">I thought this was spectacularly done!! I gave it an 8. The wide angle lens is so funny on animals, I''ll have to play with it! Anyway, I think it''s brilliant! And the b&amp;w was a perfect choice. I disagree with the "needs to be sharper comment", however. I think it would be a mistake...</td>', 'I thought this was spectacularly done!! I gave it an 8. The wide angle lens is so funny on animals, I''ll have to play with it! Anyway, I think it''s brilliant! And the b&w was a perfect choice. I disagree with the "needs to be sharper comment", however. I think it would be a mistake...', '2010-01-29 11:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843206, 847728, 81530, '<td valign="top">I thought this was yours. Highly underrated in my opinion. 9 from me.</td>', 'I thought this was yours. Highly underrated in my opinion. 9 from me.', '2010-01-29 11:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843207, 848527, 22301, '<td valign="top">I thought this was another entry that deserved a higher score. It had a nice rhythm.</td>', 'I thought this was another entry that deserved a higher score. It had a nice rhythm.', '2010-01-29 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843208, 848312, 28742, '<td valign="top">Incredibly surreal for not being setup! Incredible either way, really. You did a great job on everything here, Deb. A visual feast!</td>', 'Incredibly surreal for not being setup! Incredible either way, really. You did a great job on everything here, Deb. A visual feast!', '2010-01-29 11:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843210, 847785, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m always afraid to comment on your photos, because you know so much more about this than I do. And I need to look into how to do gradients for sky...<br/> <br/>anyway, I really like the shot. Love the red and love the softness of the boat. Wonderful colors, as well. AP is right - vibrant, but not artificial. It''s time you start a mentor series on doing this.</td>', 'I''m always afraid to comment on your photos, because you know so much more about this than I do. And I need to look into how to do gradients for sky... anyway, I really like the shot. Love the red and love the softness of the boat. Wonderful colors, as well. AP is right - vibrant, but not artificial. It''s time you start a mentor series on doing this.', '2010-01-29 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843212, 848702, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow- this is beautiful, Irene.</td>', 'Wow- this is beautiful, Irene.', '2010-01-29 11:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843214, 847110, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot and gave it a 7. Yes, the face is a little soft, but that works with this, and I don''t think it would have been nearly as effective if it was sharper. I thought the softness was part of its charm!</td>', 'I really liked this shot and gave it a 7. Yes, the face is a little soft, but that works with this, and I don''t think it would have been nearly as effective if it was sharper. I thought the softness was part of its charm!', '2010-01-29 11:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843215, 848163, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on beating your prediction and ending up with a great result, Barry!</td>', 'Congrats on beating your prediction and ending up with a great result, Barry!', '2010-01-29 11:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843219, 848415, 83313, '<td valign="top">I liked the way you used the frame, it''s something I will have to remember when needed. I have found however, that most of the time when I use a border on an entry, someone will not like it''s usage. Never gotten a critique for lacking one, though.<br/> <br/>This was an 8 for me, btw. I think it was severely underrated by many. That''s how it goes, I guess.</td>', 'I liked the way you used the frame, it''s something I will have to remember when needed. I have found however, that most of the time when I use a border on an entry, someone will not like it''s usage. Never gotten a critique for lacking one, though. This was an 8 for me, btw. I think it was severely underrated by many. That''s how it goes, I guess.', '2010-01-29 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843221, 848270, 22301, '<td valign="top">I really like the light, it is like a painting.</td>', 'I really like the light, it is like a painting.', '2010-01-29 11:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843222, 847467, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot and gave it a 7. I thought the same as others, that a little more contrast would be nice. I''m kicking myself for not spending more time looking at it the first time around, because I missed the photographers up top!! They add so much to the picture. The 800 pixel limit loses some of those fine details for people with lousy eyes, such as myself!<br/> <br/>It really has a wonderful, nostalgic feel to it. So very nicely captured!</td>', 'I really liked this shot and gave it a 7. I thought the same as others, that a little more contrast would be nice. I''m kicking myself for not spending more time looking at it the first time around, because I missed the photographers up top!! They add so much to the picture. The 800 pixel limit loses some of those fine details for people with lousy eyes, such as myself! It really has a wonderful, nostalgic feel to it. So very nicely captured!', '2010-01-29 11:31:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843227, 848519, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well Mike comes out of the woodwork to enter this spectacular shot! :-)</td>', 'Well Mike comes out of the woodwork to enter this spectacular shot! :-)', '2010-01-29 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843229, 848539, 19936, '<td valign="top">I''m in the camp where I thought this would have done better, 6.5 maybe.  Oh well, shows what I know!</td>', 'I''m in the camp where I thought this would have done better, 6.5 maybe.  Oh well, shows what I know!', '2010-01-29 11:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843231, 847830, 28742, '<td valign="top">The spelling killed you. ;-) Great job on this and you are right - you made the right people happy with this image. :)</td>', 'The spelling killed you. ;-) Great job on this and you are right - you made the right people happy with this image. :)', '2010-01-29 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843234, 848341, 28742, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2010-01-29 11:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843235, 848826, 30982, '<td valign="top">HUGE congrats on the Posthumous Blue!  And very well deserved.  This is quite simply a marvelous photograph.</td>', 'HUGE congrats on the Posthumous Blue!  And very well deserved.  This is quite simply a marvelous photograph.', '2010-01-29 11:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843236, 847169, 28742, '<td valign="top">over 5.5: check. Congrats. Shoulda made a hanging mobile from shoehorns though. :P</td>', 'over 5.5: check. Congrats. Shoulda made a hanging mobile from shoehorns though. :P', '2010-01-29 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843237, 848766, 22459, '<td valign="top">Brilliant work</td>', 'Brilliant work', '2010-01-29 11:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843238, 848890, 28742, '<td valign="top">As annoyed as I have been with those cinematic borders, I think they work here. She looks like a star, after all. :-) Best of luck in 2010!</td>', 'As annoyed as I have been with those cinematic borders, I think they work here. She looks like a star, after all. :-) Best of luck in 2010!', '2010-01-29 11:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843240, 848481, 112739, '<td valign="top">As I stated in my comment during voting, very well done and congratuations Janine. I haven''t been to Antelope canyon, but a couple of my best freinds and I have been going every year to do some canyoneering in Utah. It''s an awesome place to be and play and photograph. Congrats on placing 4th!</td>', 'As I stated in my comment during voting, very well done and congratuations Janine. I haven''t been to Antelope canyon, but a couple of my best freinds and I have been going every year to do some canyoneering in Utah. It''s an awesome place to be and play and photograph. Congrats on placing 4th!', '2010-01-29 11:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843241, 847914, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great image, thanks for the additional information.</td>', 'Great image, thanks for the additional information.', '2010-01-29 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843244, 847034, 65319, '<td valign="top">I could gaze at this one all day!  WOW!  I only voted on about half the challenge and didn''t get to this one.  Would have been an instant 10 from me!  Tremendous work, Andrew!</td>', 'I could gaze at this one all day!  WOW!  I only voted on about half the challenge and didn''t get to this one.  Would have been an instant 10 from me!  Tremendous work, Andrew!', '2010-01-29 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843245, 848759, 73942, '<td valign="top">What an awesome shot and terrific PP, love it, surprised it didn''t score higher.</td>', 'What an awesome shot and terrific PP, love it, surprised it didn''t score higher.', '2010-01-29 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843246, 848899, 30608, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for your kind comments. I visit Yosemite quite often each year and take many pictures each time I go. When going through all my raw images of Yosemite that I shot in 2009 looking for something I wanted to use in the Best of 2009 challenge this one popped out at me. I did my edits and submitted. It wasn''t until I went to my profile page I realized that I had already used this same image in the Ansel Adams challenge an entire year earlier. I immediately wrote and asked to be disqualified. Just an honest mistake!</td>', 'Thanks everybody for your kind comments. I visit Yosemite quite often each year and take many pictures each time I go. When going through all my raw images of Yosemite that I shot in 2009 looking for something I wanted to use in the Best of 2009 challenge this one popped out at me. I did my edits and submitted. It wasn''t until I went to my profile page I realized that I had already used this same image in the Ansel Adams challenge an entire year earlier. I immediately wrote and asked to be disqualified. Just an honest mistake!', '2010-01-29 11:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843247, 847296, 112739, '<td valign="top">Great work Dave. Congrats again on placing high with this beautiful photo.</td>', 'Great work Dave. Congrats again on placing high with this beautiful photo.', '2010-01-29 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
