(5843606, 847220, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice finish Sarah!  I love the image, but I am a bit torn about the boat. One one hand it gives scale and depth to the scene, on the other hand, it is a bit too literal for this Zenic (:)) image. I probably would''ve cloned it out... Either way it''s good!</td>', 'nice finish Sarah!  I love the image, but I am a bit torn about the boat. One one hand it gives scale and depth to the scene, on the other hand, it is a bit too literal for this Zenic (:)) image. I probably would''ve cloned it out... Either way it''s good!', '2010-01-29 15:44:41.000000', NULL, 0),
