(5843633, 848022, 68256, '<td valign="top">Well, I was your other 10 and fav..Just stopping by to see how this finished.  I just love this shot.  I couldn''t put it into words, but you said it best.."calm and blissful.  Now I want to see shots of the baby!</td>', 'Well, I was your other 10 and fav..Just stopping by to see how this finished.  I just love this shot.  I couldn''t put it into words, but you said it best.."calm and blissful.  Now I want to see shots of the baby!', '2010-01-29 16:15:09.000000', NULL, 0),
