(5843686, 848494, 38032, '<td valign="top">seems under-rated  I was looking for this one to place higher.  Certainly worthy or a poster as well.  I suppose the highlights are slightly high and the contrast and sharpness could be improved slightly but the long exposure is really nice here.</td>', 'seems under-rated  I was looking for this one to place higher.  Certainly worthy or a poster as well.  I suppose the highlights are slightly high and the contrast and sharpness could be improved slightly but the long exposure is really nice here.', '2010-01-29 17:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
