(5843979, 848721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fret not the votes.  I didn''t receive any 10s - you at least got one of those!  If you let this place grind you down based on 2s, 3s and 4s, it ain''t much fun.  I know - I''ve let it do that to me.  I get tired of myself when that happens.  :-)  As for this shot, amazing detail and color - you really did an excellent job of presenting this guy.</td>', 'Fret not the votes.  I didn''t receive any 10s - you at least got one of those!  If you let this place grind you down based on 2s, 3s and 4s, it ain''t much fun.  I know - I''ve let it do that to me.  I get tired of myself when that happens.  :-)  As for this shot, amazing detail and color - you really did an excellent job of presenting this guy.', '2010-01-29 21:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843981, 848531, 30982, '<td valign="top">This would make an excellent shot for a brochure advertising the races.  You really did get very good crisp focus panning the car - and that ain''t easy!  Lovely vehicle it is, too.</td>', 'This would make an excellent shot for a brochure advertising the races.  You really did get very good crisp focus panning the car - and that ain''t easy!  Lovely vehicle it is, too.', '2010-01-29 21:58:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5843984, 848794, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome shallow DOF here with amazing rich color.  I can never pull this off, and I''ve tried!  Very nice work.  I love how the perspective you''ve chosen creates almost an imaginary and complete world in this single little shot.</td>', 'Awesome shallow DOF here with amazing rich color.  I can never pull this off, and I''ve tried!  Very nice work.  I love how the perspective you''ve chosen creates almost an imaginary and complete world in this single little shot.', '2010-01-29 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 0),
