(5844084, 848839, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture - would be king on a scrapbook page. You''ve done some very nice things here - he''s off center, your choice of positioning vs. the sun puts shadow on his face, but it is nicely and evenly lit - probably the best anyone could do considering the conditions. Great expression, and he''s looking right out of the picture at you. IMO, "perfecting" this picture would result in a loss of the natural charm, and reality of the shot. <br/>This picture does everything you wanted it to do, and more. <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a great picture - would be king on a scrapbook page. You''ve done some very nice things here - he''s off center, your choice of positioning vs. the sun puts shadow on his face, but it is nicely and evenly lit - probably the best anyone could do considering the conditions. Great expression, and he''s looking right out of the picture at you. IMO, "perfecting" this picture would result in a loss of the natural charm, and reality of the shot. This picture does everything you wanted it to do, and more.   ', '2010-01-29 23:56:20.000000', NULL, 0),
