(5844871, 848381, 106543, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club! </b> <br/> <br/>Very eye catching photo! During voting I gave this a 7. A little of the left side could be cut off, placing the planes in more of a rule of thirds positioning. The red planes against the blue sky is very nice! The only thing I didn''t like about this picture is the smoke trails being a darker grey colour. The only way I see to improve this image would be to have turned the smoke trails a more white colour. I see it''s your second highest rated photo, congratulations!<br/> <br/>If you have any questions <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/messaging.php?action=compose&amp;USER_ID=106543" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">click here to message me</a>! <br/> <br/>Senay</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!   Very eye catching photo! During voting I gave this a 7. A little of the left side could be cut off, placing the planes in more of a rule of thirds positioning. The red planes against the blue sky is very nice! The only thing I didn''t like about this picture is the smoke trails being a darker grey colour. The only way I see to improve this image would be to have turned the smoke trails a more white colour. I see it''s your second highest rated photo, congratulations! If you have any questions click here to message me!  Senay', '2010-01-30 20:47:50.000000', NULL, 0),
