(5845147, 847308, 30982, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Not sure what I can offer as far as any constructive critique - your exceptional score and top ten placement out of 400+ entries should tell you that this is an excellent photograph and very well received.  Color, light, clarity, detail - all are right on the mark here.  A lovely little bird and you have more than done it justice.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Not sure what I can offer as far as any constructive critique - your exceptional score and top ten placement out of 400+ entries should tell you that this is an excellent photograph and very well received.  Color, light, clarity, detail - all are right on the mark here.  A lovely little bird and you have more than done it justice.  Congratulations!', '2010-01-31 02:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5845148, 848902, 30982, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>I have to say I''ve had a couple of really easy shots to critique - hard to go wrong when the shots you get finish in the top of a very competitive challenge!  Excellent job with merging the exposures - you obviously did it right and used a tripod (I keep trying to do it handheld and I can tell you it doesn''t work nearly as well!).  Nice touch with the overall processing - very vibrant and rich without feeling like it is overdone.  And very nice use of those foreground rocks.  A beautiful photograph!  Congrats on the top twenty finish!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! I have to say I''ve had a couple of really easy shots to critique - hard to go wrong when the shots you get finish in the top of a very competitive challenge!  Excellent job with merging the exposures - you obviously did it right and used a tripod (I keep trying to do it handheld and I can tell you it doesn''t work nearly as well!).  Nice touch with the overall processing - very vibrant and rich without feeling like it is overdone.  And very nice use of those foreground rocks.  A beautiful photograph!  Congrats on the top twenty finish!', '2010-01-31 02:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
