(5846204, 848759, 103142, '<td valign="top">Here''s the bluebird! I actually posted it in the thread, but forgot to tell you.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058&amp;page=3" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous thread</a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Here''s the bluebird! I actually posted it in the thread, but forgot to tell you. posthumous thread  ', '2010-02-01 00:44:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5846226, 848734, 54645, '<td valign="top">Strong work Joe, interesting how the layers of color, texture, and movement result in a "simple" image. It also demonstrates an excellent use of a bright blue sky. Just the right amount in the composition to define the horizon and put a sense of peace over the scene. I can see this in BW, but it would create a different mood, particularly with that sky.</td>', 'Strong work Joe, interesting how the layers of color, texture, and movement result in a "simple" image. It also demonstrates an excellent use of a bright blue sky. Just the right amount in the composition to define the horizon and put a sense of peace over the scene. I can see this in BW, but it would create a different mood, particularly with that sky.', '2010-02-01 00:59:27.000000', NULL, 0),
