(5857177, 848273, 106543, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club! </b> <br/> <br/>Sorry about the wait for your critique, this is coming out of the backlog! <br/> <br/>Wow you did a wonderful job on the PP! I thought it was nice when I saw it during voting but now I can truly appreciate how much work you put into it. For which I might add you did not receive a fair score.<br/> <br/>Too bad you didn''t have a chance to capture this with your DSLR, I think it would have reduced the noise and made it a little sharper. That''s all that I can really see that could be improved in this picture. <br/> <br/>If you have any questions <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/messaging.php?action=compose&amp;USER_ID=106543" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">click here to message me</a>! <br/> <br/>Senay</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!   Sorry about the wait for your critique, this is coming out of the backlog!  Wow you did a wonderful job on the PP! I thought it was nice when I saw it during voting but now I can truly appreciate how much work you put into it. For which I might add you did not receive a fair score. Too bad you didn''t have a chance to capture this with your DSLR, I think it would have reduced the noise and made it a little sharper. That''s all that I can really see that could be improved in this picture.  If you have any questions click here to message me!  Senay', '2010-02-07 18:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
