(5861563, 847133, 30982, '<td valign="top">You could walk for hours here and simply enjoy the peace of the place.  I''d not have guessed Ireland.  Pleased you chose this as your "best of" for the year in representing your trip!  Lovely, lovely view.</td>', 'You could walk for hours here and simply enjoy the peace of the place.  I''d not have guessed Ireland.  Pleased you chose this as your "best of" for the year in representing your trip!  Lovely, lovely view.', '2010-02-10 09:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5861576, 848005, 30982, '<td valign="top">"As for the tourists, the normalcy of them was my point ... you see tourists like that all around Venice, trolling bags over cobbled streets past beautiful buildings and light with nary a glance. I do have other shots with nobody in them, but I like this one better"<br/> <br/>Exactly!!  And it is not just Venice and not just tourists.  Europe to those who don''t live there is a "picture postcard" but to those who DO live there it is just home.  And perfectly normal to have people with suitcases or briefcases walking through many centuries old arches.  Or lovely Mercedes Benz cars parked in front of ancient castles.  Anyway, I like this a lot.  :-)</td>', '"As for the tourists, the normalcy of them was my point ... you see tourists like that all around Venice, trolling bags over cobbled streets past beautiful buildings and light with nary a glance. I do have other shots with nobody in them, but I like this one better" Exactly!!  And it is not just Venice and not just tourists.  Europe to those who don''t live there is a "picture postcard" but to those who DO live there it is just home.  And perfectly normal to have people with suitcases or briefcases walking through many centuries old arches.  Or lovely Mercedes Benz cars parked in front of ancient castles.  Anyway, I like this a lot.  :-)', '2010-02-10 09:16:03.000000', NULL, 0),
