(5865283, 848552, 52686, '<td valign="top">@Nuzzer:  Thank you (much delayed, I know...) for the detailed critique.  It is very much appreciated.<br/> <br/>@Dr.Confuser: Thank you, as well, for your vote of confidence and evaluation.<br/> <br/>@All: I found all of the comments regarding the "tough guy" rather amusing as Derek is one of the most gentle and softspoken people I know.  He''s a big softie...  He''s just rather sizeable and happens to have a lot of ink.  The carp, btw, are representative of himself and his wife, Kerri.  Since this picture was taken, he has a new outline of a smaller carp in the works on his left forearm for Zoe...  :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-13 04:27:50.</i></td>', '@Nuzzer:  Thank you (much delayed, I know...) for the detailed critique.  It is very much appreciated. @Dr.Confuser: Thank you, as well, for your vote of confidence and evaluation. @All: I found all of the comments regarding the "tough guy" rather amusing as Derek is one of the most gentle and softspoken people I know.  He''s a big softie...  He''s just rather sizeable and happens to have a lot of ink.  The carp, btw, are representative of himself and his wife, Kerri.  Since this picture was taken, he has a new outline of a smaller carp in the works on his left forearm for Zoe...  :-)', '2010-02-13 04:20:55.000000', '2010-02-13 04:27:50.000000', 0),
