(5868455, 847835, 10785, '<td valign="top">This may be your lowest but it inspired me to shoot one myself...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=852030" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/10785/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852030.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/10785/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852030.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/10785/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852030.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>It''s nowhere near as good as yours and my PP is way off... but it''s my first attempt and I love the subject matter. All that from looking at yur lowest scoring image of 2009... score isn''t everything!</td>', 'This may be your lowest but it inspired me to shoot one myself...   It''s nowhere near as good as yours and my PP is way off... but it''s my first attempt and I love the subject matter. All that from looking at yur lowest scoring image of 2009... score isn''t everything!', '2010-02-15 20:51:56.000000', NULL, 0),
