(5870037, 848312, 73056, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this shot, the more wonderful it is. It looks like a compliation of shots and I am amazed to read it''s actually not. Talk about being in the right place at the right time AND seeing it. Can''t get much more perfect than this for a candid. Processing choice is fabulous, too.<br/> <br/>Hate typos. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-17 01:34:01.</i></td>', 'The more I look at this shot, the more wonderful it is. It looks like a compliation of shots and I am amazed to read it''s actually not. Talk about being in the right place at the right time AND seeing it. Can''t get much more perfect than this for a candid. Processing choice is fabulous, too. Hate typos. :)', '2010-02-16 23:02:17.000000', '2010-02-17 01:34:01.000000', 0),
