(5917071, 848861, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think this is very lovely....I live in Florida and we get trees that are "full" of these birds if you can imagine it...it''s really funny to see all their feathers all "fluffed" up and them doing their little dances...I think this was well done...</td>', 'I think this is very lovely....I live in Florida and we get trees that are "full" of these birds if you can imagine it...it''s really funny to see all their feathers all "fluffed" up and them doing their little dances...I think this was well done...', '2010-03-25 09:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5923085, 848648, 49865, '<td valign="top">I''m returning to this image now a couple months after the vote, and it still has all the appeal it did to me in the challenge. I figured it would be a polarizing photo for many voters, and the score reflects that, but to me the blur still emphasizes that man''s haunted expression perfectly. What is he thinking? Who is he? What has he seen, what has he done? If an image gives the viewer pause and causes him to ponder such questions, it has succeeded expertly as a portrait. It certainly did for me, and it would appear by the comments below it did for many others as well. Great job.</td>', 'I''m returning to this image now a couple months after the vote, and it still has all the appeal it did to me in the challenge. I figured it would be a polarizing photo for many voters, and the score reflects that, but to me the blur still emphasizes that man''s haunted expression perfectly. What is he thinking? Who is he? What has he seen, what has he done? If an image gives the viewer pause and causes him to ponder such questions, it has succeeded expertly as a portrait. It certainly did for me, and it would appear by the comments below it did for many others as well. Great job.', '2010-03-31 04:50:30.000000', NULL, 0),
