(6084110, 848636, 119128, '<td valign="top">Your Welcome, regarding the last message. Oh, WOW, as I was checking your message and other pic''s I came across what I''m sure is my favorite insect shot yet!  I love the color and composition.  Insect shot''s, though they take alot of technical ability, aren''s usualy visualy interesting to me.  Beautiful! It''s one that I could see a decorator using as art in an impressive home!  Nice work!</td>', 'Your Welcome, regarding the last message. Oh, WOW, as I was checking your message and other pic''s I came across what I''m sure is my favorite insect shot yet!  I love the color and composition.  Insect shot''s, though they take alot of technical ability, aren''s usualy visualy interesting to me.  Beautiful! It''s one that I could see a decorator using as art in an impressive home!  Nice work!', '2010-07-07 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
