(6163949, 848879, 120058, '<td valign="top">Browsing around a bit and saw this. Looks like one of the paths I used to ride on as a kid. Brings out memories from winters when we went sleigh riding with my pony and always stopped somewhere to drink the hot chocolate and eat the sandwiches we''d brought with us. Lovely memories. Winters in Sweden is cold, but awesome. <br/> <br/>Where is this photo taken?</td>', 'Browsing around a bit and saw this. Looks like one of the paths I used to ride on as a kid. Brings out memories from winters when we went sleigh riding with my pony and always stopped somewhere to drink the hot chocolate and eat the sandwiches we''d brought with us. Lovely memories. Winters in Sweden is cold, but awesome.  Where is this photo taken?', '2010-09-16 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
